<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="6">

  <DocumentRef DateTime="20260627T021250" id="586ced87-1e77-47a4-8a52-d5b53fab7365">
    <XRef DateTime="20251230T233309" id="db0ce099-8e5d-405c-884b-c5aebb9b00c3"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20251231T003806" id="a4675f1d-5dd1-4057-a554-d42bca2ac523"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20260106T045755" id="0d23d3bc-ee8e-43b3-a894-ed67a68dd5ed"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20260106T073145" id="10e1e5a0-2b88-4da6-932a-f665ca31b25a"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20260120T015033" id="4e05d552-2b77-4c6f-a824-62bca361ba88"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20260127T210807" id="5c1bac18-502c-4b30-b31b-1f82ec20e292"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20260223T180021" id="7726f683-1c32-4687-9501-8f5183289ca8"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20260317T201412" id="30b6c0e0-e782-46dc-a15b-48ace9be4f28"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20260317T234114" id="ca433888-9458-43fc-b0b6-2d1566628c5b"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20260402T002650" id="7e88acd2-97c6-442c-ac4c-d9aec0cf7098"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20260601T230530" id="182ba119-1882-46f1-9a6f-0321b4b24afa"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20260607T233355" id="77356288-2f3e-4e60-b736-483fa506d671"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20260609T202625" id="30cf2931-b8de-4d80-9a25-e1e6fad62f59"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20260617T232310" id="7547994f-56cf-4226-8bc4-2b722cf94e16"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20260619T044532" id="df5d8e81-8398-4560-8442-1d964bb05e67"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20260622T144828" id="5ce0d810-ef0b-444a-ab28-97ccd864baf9"/>
    <XRef DateTime="20260627T020839" id="5ef87a4e-f4e0-4daa-9928-d2bbc882a2b5"/>
  </DocumentRef>

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="efad2c6d-93be-4872-a526-1a5c87bafed8">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="REFEREE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Olympic training center - colorado springs - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="db5e01e0-de32-4894-bd63-3a11f1101f9b">
      <Text>1992 - the U.S. Olympic trials in Judo. RYAN CUTLER (YOUNG RYAN - 24) stands across the 36 x 26 mat competition area. Sweat pours from his body, a drop of blood drips from his nose.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fb3915b3-efa1-4b4a-9f8a-06e4324519ad">
      <Text>His OPPONENT, younger but just as exhausted, standing across the mat tucks the skirt of his judo </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> into his black belt and pulls the knot tight. Ryan glances at the scoreboard. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0f7bf960-6542-4d0f-8609-2dab52e01ac7">
      <Text>He’s up by half a point with thirty-seconds left. The Referee nods to both competitors.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="91ec8aae-44da-4821-b23d-07f353785753">
      <Text>Referee</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fbc72ddf-22f5-41ed-a45f-692df90716de">
      <Text>Hajime!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c1ab03cb-84f4-4d03-baaf-df7a3ecd483e">
      <Text>Ryan moves forward. Ryan’s Opponent reaches for Ryan’s </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> - Ryan catches the sleeve and twists into a one handed Sleeve--Lifting-Pulling-Hip Throw (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sode</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tsuri</Text>
      <Text> Komi </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Goshi</Text>
      <Text>) - both players begin to fall forward...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b06292af-b48a-4280-aec8-64f2762eebf4">
      <Text>Just before they hit the ground there’s a LOUD “POP”.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="4dfb1ff6-acc0-4338-8488-69812f1d63ac">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="YOUNG BYSTANDER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. HOLLYWOOD BLVD. - DAY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="af344f56-d9fd-421e-b470-566a1bbd639e">
      <Text>Thirty-three years later. Ryan falls flat on his face. A half bottle of bourbon, the neck peeking out from a brown paper bag, EXPLODES on impact.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a3476587-4613-46df-937b-ce3e3a8ed1d6">
      <Text>A YOUNG BYSTANDER witnesses the fall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8498c39e-1e23-4481-9546-bf776b07b37f">
      <Text>Young bystander</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="75a22a4e-b025-4444-b08a-0c1ea3656ca7">
      <Text>Whoa, dude. Are you alright?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ed130c5b-8f7e-4ae8-a1fb-daa8c0e88ae1">
      <Text>Ryan looks up at the Young Bystander’s outstretched arm. He helps Ryan get uneasily to his feet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="076f19f3-3163-481d-929b-4e773f73156c">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6e90f4c4-f0c7-4d58-9135-7d23a3a80c50">
      <Text>I’m used to falling... done it a lot. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e00e3f80-63bf-4a35-872d-b738d4d65b2f">
      <Text>YOUNG BYSTANDER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fa1052f2-f99a-419e-bbb4-958af6c0e823">
      <Text>Are you okay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d21c09e0-bfe8-4cc0-9a5d-91b2fc1a67a9">
      <Text>Ryan pats his body... satisfied.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4469f203-d358-4eaa-9573-58dd46b00b17">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="68c153be-2fb1-460b-9c8a-75d5e03c0c1c">
      <Text>Keiko </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">desu</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">A-Ok</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1417d9a1-be12-43a3-9b86-18a387d520da">
      <Text>Ryan pats the Young man on the check.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="347d1137-f88d-434e-98b5-930f767c8d35">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0771fee0-f2de-4bf7-8f5e-d0f452d6214f">
      <Text>You’re a good kid. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a615a73b-f74c-44dc-bd0c-45a34adbce50">
      <Text>Young BYSTANDER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d4d15ab8-a0a2-462c-ab24-44a6e323299d">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ummm</Text>
      <Text>... you’re bleeding.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="518ea864-c574-49d7-8f49-1f0e7e0beb39">
      <Text>Ryan taps his forehead where a trickle of blood winds down the side of his face. Ryan smiles...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b299b1a2-fd70-40c6-9ff8-c565fd5c37b1">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8e5d8301-f1ab-4959-9aa7-f82abf16935d">
      <Text>I am used to that too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ea628f10-df0b-455d-b924-710c63b33dfb">
      <Text>Ryan rights himself and stumbles away. He tosses what’s left of the bottle and the brown paper bag into a nearby trashcan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="4dd72928-5095-497c-9822-acedc5e447b2">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Ryan’s apartment - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dd9906ce-ddda-4598-8d05-41f58e3f9dda">
      <Text>Ryan unlocks the door and enters the dark apartment. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="27a4452f-b239-431e-9775-e883566a9e39">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="887e2098-4625-4535-8f50-14ee128854ce">
      <Text>Sarah? I’m home.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8fd0d807-f1db-4730-b334-c9816fdb9781">
      <Text>He glances around. Silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0de9eb78-97ba-4c27-9e29-d3dceede7971">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="81f89452-23b9-40aa-ad45-1844541abbc3">
      <Text>Sarah?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c3e56d6b-23e6-454c-807f-74b955e0fb10">
      <Text>He goes into the bedroom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9e429142-5fe7-48d5-a703-3b8eb8a05132">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SARAH’S CELL PHONE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Ryan’s APARTMENT - bedroom - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fb769342-e2b7-4002-b017-691018ff3de7">
      <Text>The bed is unmade. The closet doors are thrown open. Half of the closet is empty. Nothing but a half dozen empty hangers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="faceae5c-ee33-43b5-acea-96ecebd65eee">
      <Text>Ryan reaches for his cell phone and dials.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4dfa7fde-aa88-4f58-8b90-62e59bfab866">
      <Text>Sarah’s cell phone</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="71def4db-e24b-4fbe-9f82-28f15aef9bed">
      <Text>You’ve reached my cell phone. Please leave me a message. Unless it’s Ryan. If it’s Ryan... fuck off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="672003d1-5d2c-46d9-a091-06e94c36ff72">
      <Text>BEEP.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="457e129e-3911-4746-87dd-421b50ed575d">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e28d4787-d32a-45f2-b28e-db3d4a0e0c2c">
      <Text>Funny. Very funny. Call me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="78d22431-9aaa-4450-874c-944ac2a5040e">
      <Text>Ryan hangs up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="0a52a68c-8341-4dbf-8f97-66f336e261c1">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Ryan’s apartment - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7538022a-5716-4484-bad4-e0302ee6cdc3">
      <Text>Ryan watches an </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">MMA</Text>
      <Text> fight on TV. The fighters trade punches then one moves in tight and does a perfectly executed Sweeping Hip Throw (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">harai</Text>
      <Text>-o-</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">goshi</Text>
      <Text>).</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0da2cc60-c198-45ff-a466-7ed6981384ed">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6a5b8ae6-9623-486d-8fcd-773f582b5342">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Niiice</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8a736e90-049e-4be0-a7e3-1c3a9bc91e99">
      <Text>Ryan gets up and goes to the kitchen.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="6f4e5839-8142-4404-8dc0-c0db7c3775d8">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Ryan'S APARTMENT - kitchen - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="94c88322-f023-45ff-a957-9456d05d328f">
      <Text>Ryan opens his refrigerator... sad sight. An empty carton of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Oatmilk</Text>
      <Text>... a slab of moldy cheese... a box of something.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9962cd9d-bc24-4451-aa35-803e91fd5940">
      <Text>Ryan picks up the box and sniffs. His head SNAPS back. Ryan, puts the box back in the fridge and shuts the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6fd29bf9-eb82-4a82-863a-274078caa93b">
      <Text>He looks at his phone. No calls, no texts. He pulls his wallet from his back pocket.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4a7d72c6-21c9-4945-af14-58a345cd95da">
      <Text>Three singles and a five. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="f1024b6a-d26a-43ec-9080-cf9280eb3d64">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BANK TELLER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. chase bank - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="634e91fa-1aa1-4f3d-afbf-9ae68281ea5a">
      <Text>Ryan stands with a BANK TELLER. She glances at the receipt she’s printed before reluctantly handing it to Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3b747a39-fa1c-4aec-a7f4-87d7178d1525">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="000f3b42-cb47-45f6-810b-5f0b85c37e39">
      <Text>Three dollars and fifty-seven cents??? Where’s all my money?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="95396bab-9da3-4699-acc4-5f2647ab684a">
      <Text>Bank teller</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ad746c4c-e773-445c-903a-5c04b1674594">
      <Text>There were two withdrawals made in the last forty-eight hours. The first was for $3500 and the second for $2350.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="813620b3-8afe-4b78-a142-16aaa9dc039d">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9ed2aa3a-9b30-47f0-aaa0-33982a97805c">
      <Text>I need to speak with the manager.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b081eba7-4a23-4c5b-9139-77e1c650a2e6">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BANK MANAGER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Chase bank - manager’s office - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6648610d-3759-402c-9991-2e492e3ef5a2">
      <Text>Ryan sits across from the BANK MANAGER. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d02340f7-70ae-4271-921e-9e3014750a57">
      <Text>Bank manager</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="96bea09b-922b-480b-87fb-5196039fc9dd">
      <Text>Her name is on the account. Nothing we can do.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="054c8d63-0aab-4217-a9af-eb6bd377ea84">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2f6327fb-e54e-40b4-b2b3-6f29b6c8b72b">
      <Text>She took everything. I can’t pay rent, I can’t pay for food. She can just do that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c6c5e764-73f7-44ae-87ae-19f1cc8526ad">
      <Text>BANK MANAGER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d8d2b141-3551-4e73-a334-5f808db94083">
      <Text>Her account as much as it was yours, so, yes, she can and she did. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="056e5c9d-94ef-4498-9397-7f642e655301">
      <Text>Ryan SIGHS, deflated.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="55a5bfef-9762-49d5-8920-16cba9a97ed6">
      <Text>Bank MANAGER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="22edb6ba-d961-45e2-b840-7b26f67e3c22">
      <Text>And I hate to pour salt in the wound, but you’re below the minimum balance. You’re going to have to pay a pretty substantial fee at the end of the month if you don’t make a significant deposit. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a033911f-9533-44d5-be01-82fe79b1da9a">
      <Text>Ryan just stares.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="87b5aeb2-63fd-4555-bbd2-383ea7f8df54">
      <Text>BANK MANAGER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9c0b2892-80b2-4295-ab07-e7d8eea0eb1a">
      <Text>I am sorry.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="933043f3-aaed-4368-be8c-00c07ae545e8">
      <Text>(a beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1635d16a-d146-40ff-bdf0-1151818069d9">
      <Text>Is there anything else I can help you with?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="522536f8-f4d6-462a-8288-96efe85f74e9">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="4" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NICK">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Strip mall vitamin store - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c24b388e-c44a-4a75-969b-dc9c9051678b">
      <Text>The door CHIMES as Ryan enters the store. The MANAGER, NICK, mid-30’s, restocks a shelf with powdered creatine. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="12309e26-040f-4d44-9b68-675144b85fb3">
      <Text>He spots Ryan enter the store.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f3f02c58-6328-4ab9-9c2a-f6db9d0905b0">
      <Text>Nick</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a199cc61-b25f-4038-ba28-625bf62a6c82">
      <Text>What are you doing here? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dbd83817-551d-45b2-9d62-a9a0b8061b79">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e47c2b96-dbe2-4e93-ae65-66078155c4af">
      <Text>I know I’m late... I had car trouble.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d52f2f00-bff9-4051-8603-541ff036c6bb">
      <Text>NICK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d856385c-ae57-4011-b793-1ab99aafcb24">
      <Text>Uh, huh. But what are you --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="970220c1-9a0a-4cc1-a574-423db0b1e71a">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bba5d756-96cd-473c-9876-a8437dd18e07">
      <Text>I was hoping I could get an advance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c5b0ea5a-0cdf-406d-b731-f5248e2c6306">
      <Text>NICK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9476bd71-d529-4e4f-8b38-e64bd78e46bd">
      <Text>An advance... on what?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fcf847f4-b0e9-47a2-8be1-5a7073796c8e">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e8402cc6-64ee-4fb7-bf37-f4bee783d15e">
      <Text>Next month’s pay... or next week. I just need --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="75c9dd57-5085-4db1-9e4c-3363bfda2ea1">
      <Text>NICK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="66428db2-60db-4b5b-96b2-1c0c899dc478">
      <Text>Are you for real? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6613eb61-390f-4331-b1d2-2feb3172966b">
      <Text>Ryan looks puzzled.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b5f2485c-039d-476b-92da-1b6290caa26f">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6a1d8e7c-5acf-4484-9e32-c3095dc4767a">
      <Text>Nick, I am asking for a big favor, i know --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0b3ad372-fe6e-4b03-b14d-d1040ee4a9db">
      <Text>NICK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="18328f9b-04ff-4ff2-99d8-7c39c3adbcd8">
      <Text>You’re fired. I fired you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0bd2c6ff-01b3-46ba-a0b1-28a510a10a72">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6fbdafaf-5878-4391-afcb-413245622356">
      <Text>You fired... when?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aeafa0f9-4ecc-4386-b353-6a561edb9485">
      <Text>NICK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="88250ec0-e354-4ca7-add4-79b5258880dc">
      <Text>Yesterday. When you came to work smelling like you’d been swimming in scotch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d9df847b-934b-4c4a-b5ae-af870da94086">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="deaea938-27ce-472d-8985-d54155224302">
      <Text>I thought you were kidding.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="576d19e3-e68d-4ea3-b2a3-3d70a5b470bb">
      <Text>Nick shakes his head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fd7d8482-c5ee-4c86-84d1-74730473a0e9">
      <Text>NICK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bfc3f1c3-2e6d-4a15-9c65-89a2bdea9d19">
      <Text>You pissed on the floor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fcfdd292-32ab-4c24-a170-f1740f6cd2c9">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="756c1a8b-9796-4d44-a229-0f0bc872e79d">
      <Text>In the bathroom. And not entirely on the floor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f6ad5867-9ac3-44d1-badb-3e62a37ee6f7">
      <Text>Nick</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="84e74dec-5095-467f-9613-e950f0f72137">
      <Text>True. You hit the toilet seat, the wall...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="502f264e-f8cf-41e2-a5ab-7e6ac79dba3f">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="30844e2e-391a-46e7-837f-37cbb8bcc652">
      <Text>Some of it went in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3ba79f13-9415-4c7a-9402-ebf77a8f2a99">
      <Text>NICK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="01bf6c92-e2b0-4d26-bccb-7c6c19143da2">
      <Text>You don’t work here anymore, Ryan. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b888b894-08d2-4cb6-aa16-0cea5905190e">
      <Text>Nick goes back to stocking the shelves. Ryan hesitates, then turns back toward the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="c3eb8712-811b-4a48-8006-f9baaae41f76">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="6" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Ryan’s apartment - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6bd0d654-28c8-48f6-9aba-a9ef47c4371e">
      <Text>Ryan goes into his half of the closet and retrieves a large glass container that’s filled with medals. He pulls the jar down with great effort. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="be88960d-660a-4afc-b226-4ee103f8e228">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="6" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PAWN BROKER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Pawn shop - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fc6b51b5-3bce-468d-ab6e-8eeb25354846">
      <Text>Ryan has two dozen large medals spread out on the counter. There’s twice that many still in the jar. The PAWN BROKER looks at them through a loop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="779f0a44-3768-40d6-b9f9-3f1806727cda">
      <Text>Pawn broker</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e7f68966-0812-4eef-8150-fd9631759035">
      <Text>I’m not seeing much value here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="587b5cf1-4a71-41f8-99e3-a02fa86ad79d">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="033778dd-4dd0-453b-989a-fd281dd27538">
      <Text>Value? That’s a silver medal from the Pan Am Games.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="670d189a-e1d9-48c5-b984-8d589e335a5c">
      <Text>PAWN BROKER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="273ed999-e2f6-4be5-9e95-7701bd4dc6a2">
      <Text>It’s silver plated. Cost me more to extract the silver than it’s worth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5d31d758-2844-4315-a1c0-073e6e6588f5">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="713c3606-9440-4447-b98e-af110e04d198">
      <Text>It’s a collector’s item.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d62ab332-3abf-4c12-929c-b5516ad549f7">
      <Text>PAWN BROKER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4be7925c-1446-4095-9cdd-c4ecc826ea1b">
      <Text>By who? Who collects second place thirty-year old medals?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="de14bdaf-0b69-4578-b813-2f580fb47626">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="708e41f9-dc95-41bb-bfd1-4f4c75450990">
      <Text>I got plenty of gold too. Look, this is the 1991 U.S. National Championships. First place... Gold.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e1d8526e-264c-4673-b5b5-aed7ff5b13b1">
      <Text>The Pawn Broker looks a the medal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1c277383-0a1d-4230-9e35-4f53c01ded54">
      <Text>PAWN BROKER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1b927583-9e40-435e-a16b-d935504cff58">
      <Text>Very nice. But not worth anything.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6164572a-6fb9-4b96-85a4-fdac74b68e05">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1d0926cd-41d9-43f8-a8db-772f9d504148">
      <Text>Are you -- that’s gold, man. Gold!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1293039a-a950-413f-80cf-8274a2363941">
      <Text>PAWN BROKER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="494a829b-6f1f-4d0d-be84-f5e8726d8610">
      <Text>Plated. Maybe 14 karat. I can’t melt it. I can’t sell it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4d0fbc29-777d-41c3-a3c2-f491bb6a7366">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="084d7747-337b-4f37-8583-147ead6ff5c1">
      <Text>I have over a hundred medals... they have to be worth something.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="98113ec5-44c9-4357-92fd-a74f3f470739">
      <Text>PAWN BROKER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d0d30be0-7af6-4329-a1eb-687a6246e936">
      <Text>Jeez... I can give you a loan for the lot. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="206927d1-b650-4f32-bc49-4e84484d5d4e">
      <Text>Ryan let’s out a sigh of relief.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="10cc0f8e-2e18-4334-b93e-8648dd7f8ad8">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c7a85936-85a7-43ba-adda-fda401eb365b">
      <Text>Okay... good. Thank you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="98800066-ceff-4d86-b398-e9220b7b1a6c">
      <Text>PAWN BROKER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ea0634eb-ceca-4326-81c7-7acbe62908ef">
      <Text>Fifty bucks for 90 days.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4e85349c-cac8-4d59-95c9-3c2b62cdc112">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e290ea52-9ccb-4659-b99d-a547f1e097e4">
      <Text>Fifty bucks? That’s less than fifty cents a piece.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="25b49399-029d-4791-a4f0-93e08963545d">
      <Text>Pawn BROKER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e562b463-8d12-4e4f-97a6-c449f94d50ae">
      <Text>I am trying to help you out here, but take it or leave it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4cf174b6-6e99-4865-aab8-37d7d6f8c7d0">
      <Text>Ryan nods. The Pawn Broker pulls out a form and clipboard and hands it over. Ryan looks at the medals one last time and sets pen to paper.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="006ab80c-912f-4b2b-a819-860848321012">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="7" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="UNEMPLOYMENT WORKER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Unemployment office - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f19b6937-b2cd-467f-a2a7-56f1a0ff89f7">
      <Text>Ryan sits across from an UNEMPLOYMENT OFFICE WORKER.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5297e128-63ad-40a7-9814-3110256d5f38">
      <Text>Unemployment worker</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4b7b6f31-84b7-44cf-957a-842961e3e775">
      <Text>You said you have a degree.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fd570f67-690a-4014-b9f6-b041d64acdd3">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4348052a-1f84-458e-aff5-4714c8c6b656">
      <Text>I have three... partial degrees. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="77c2e949-7398-4710-8e6c-5d451fac735d">
      <Text>UNEMPLOYMENT WORKER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0e23bbe1-c94d-4c0b-9339-73dc7eb25149">
      <Text>Excuse me? What do you mean?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="41e09f07-7471-4739-9137-dedf7233120f">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="41a8c621-cda5-497d-b532-40cbd634fc51">
      <Text>I got a two year degree in kinesiology, and then a part of a biology degree... and most of an English degree.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0baa53ec-f10a-4b59-a235-ae74b0b0b7a9">
      <Text>UNEMPLOYMENT WORKER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c1eba498-538d-4a44-8008-9e24d64c0412">
      <Text>Most?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0dfd36a5-d115-4768-b1f4-43d7251dc07c">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="698ba5bd-bf3f-4ecc-a429-179a84a51b96">
      <Text>I was trying to cram four years of learning into twelve.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ffed828f-3728-4156-955f-9826e9c3996f">
      <Text>UNEMPLOYMENT WORKER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2714de8f-8eb2-481d-b904-69b3592f368a">
      <Text>Uh huh. I will keep an eye out for you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="284ea5f4-de5c-4985-a499-9dd6f6d0ce21">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d697ade7-19a0-45b1-a2bc-eba1bbba4607">
      <Text>No... no, no.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5f0a9256-911c-4e73-8967-87aefddeb2bc">
      <Text>UNEMPLOYMENT WORKER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0af2f00a-d71f-4d83-864c-4f5e0ace461a">
      <Text>No?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="17875f30-d956-4e70-aaf9-0f02d0a6c317">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="94d524b7-7a46-4fe1-9ea3-1bf4fd40a82c">
      <Text>I have ten dollars to my name... I don’t have enough for rent. I don’t have enough for, well, for anything. I need something NOW.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7588b396-87cf-474b-868a-1159528b1104">
      <Text>UNEMPLOYMENT WORKER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a061bcc8-1f16-4411-9d59-5b29037c9ec3">
      <Text>You ever been on unemployment before?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fc731f74-9334-4ec2-b5dc-2497ca07a6f9">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3456da9b-3098-47b6-885e-7a5ec817a6e9">
      <Text>A few times.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9b435ff1-f6e3-4c90-96ee-a6d2f3839b5d">
      <Text>UNEMPLOYMENT WORKER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c8ebc28f-dd17-490c-9c88-a8fb4a94b4e5">
      <Text>And you don’t know any better how this works? We don’t have a magic wand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="69090f3e-cfef-44bf-b086-f367eda716ac">
      <Text>(taking pity)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="22225065-b4cc-4e79-9cd7-cac1a13bf641">
      <Text>Look, go onto our website, there’s a job board. Maybe you can find something there that works for you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b69f740c-ba81-4d3f-93c1-d60c6b7a3981">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="8" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. ryan’s apartment - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4ed97dc8-8920-4c8d-a15a-b9e56dd7ac68">
      <Text>Ryan approaches his apartment and notices a paper tacked to the door. He pulls it down and reads.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0c74b1fc-e8bf-4f1e-9edf-e5d4ad1dffc1">
      <Text>“LATE PAYMENT NOTICE. TWO WEEK WARNING. ORDER TO VACATE. EVICTION.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="502ffcdd-2a6e-4dd6-8522-cd72752e66df">
      <Text>Ryan crumples the paper and tosses it down the hall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="4bd262b9-1fd7-4c4c-8248-31fe3e03be60">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="8" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Ryan’s apartment - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3849ba6e-d593-438b-b1b4-7a0ce90a84e5">
      <Text>Ryan eats a cup of instant ramen while he surfs the net on his laptop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Shot" id="3e0a4aa1-6550-4acc-b917-1f7ba2f8d077">
      <Text>On his laptop</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ed1de9c8-10d6-49a6-9531-9800ef3632a1">
      <Text>Ryan scrolls through the job postings on the Unemployment Jobs site.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0e4d2ae3-52a0-4075-9df7-6e50c896e28a">
      <Text>He pauses on one post -- </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="405d5cf0-57f3-49d0-90a4-f65cc25177ff">
      <Text>“SEEKING NATIVE ENGLISH SPEAKER. MUST BE WILLING TO TRAVEL.” </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c8270d66-8fa6-4664-8fe0-f69eecae620b">
      <Text>Ryan clicks on a post and a Calendar Opens. He enters his email and chooses 10 am the next business day. The moment he hits send --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="14ce252b-5fd0-4c90-bacb-365c9aaf9968">
      <Text>All the lights and power in his apartment go out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d211db8f-1ddc-4ccf-a9cb-3247461e6cf7">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="583075e7-a113-4ef0-a0bb-90aed18870d1">
      <Text>Are you fucking kidding me?!?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="23093552-a1da-46f1-bfff-a116a24f2f3d">
      <Text>He gets up, bumping his shin on the coffee table.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ac981795-a7d3-4790-bc39-54876db4b7b4">
      <Text>Ryan </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8a8494aa-261b-4158-a15f-b80065b4075e">
      <Text>Ouch! Ow!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="f5c552f9-7a97-4c56-a4c7-96f7d5175b78">
      <SceneProperties Length="3 6/8" Page="9" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BENJI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. International language institute - (establishing) day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="58919912-9b57-480b-aa79-e9af8ea156f6">
      <Text>A one room office in a strip mall. Ryan, dressed in a rumpled sport coat and button down sits across from BENJI, early 20’s.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c45f78c6-0f3a-4333-adfd-4bdc8c74eebe">
      <Text>Benji</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3c3ce9ec-727f-486d-9e03-12f1cce37781">
      <Text>You don’t have a degree?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2d6c08aa-abd9-4be3-8e9e-1ad5005fbeae">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="81e24317-63a7-4e7c-9ef5-47f973778f70">
      <Text>From a two year college.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9f89d6c6-8128-4a52-969d-d5ea8a831824">
      <Text>BENJI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0ae9efbb-3146-460d-8112-cc755e505fcc">
      <Text>Oh, okay. That’s something.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="89b38aac-ffd5-46d8-8c86-17e7f937601d">
      <Text>Benji makes a note.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="de4d6f0c-9d2e-43ac-b95b-8c2902302b27">
      <Text>Benji</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c987393d-642b-4bea-b41a-defd6c37b575">
      <Text>Any teaching experience.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fd0b6278-93da-4c30-a662-f48aaa7de959">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a1c1430d-9922-440b-b581-c6a483ff9919">
      <Text>A lot. I’ve taught quite a bit. All over the country.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a978753e-c608-4257-8ea3-52bee68f3b0e">
      <Text>BENJI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a090e69d-91ce-4b50-a42c-ac3fa9161bdc">
      <Text>Is that on your resume?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ab0a3a1-f7a5-41fb-85bc-e7d290f96fbd">
      <Text>Benji rummages through a stack of papers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8b311fa0-a05e-4317-bdad-0b4c65c5370e">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2b77a29a-3a83-4a29-a955-57e8a50ca623">
      <Text>It is sort of... and sort of not. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="59dbad6e-0e7b-40e6-b763-bf6deb231af2">
      <Text>Benji stops digging.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="82acac2e-cb1a-4528-9517-e02c1eafb933">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d5506222-9bc9-46bd-82ce-c6fb535572b0">
      <Text>I taught judo. I had a class downtown and I used to do clinics all over the country... a couple in Europe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="321762ba-38c2-46b6-b4bc-acaae3143434">
      <Text>Benji</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f7f25c6e-8732-435d-828e-9e2a67895ab2">
      <Text>Judo... isn’t that what bagels are made of?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="29eaeb4c-5b3d-4ee3-af60-f6f9b1d372f6">
      <Text>Ryan stares at him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e4b931c7-51e5-4513-a560-3364537d716b">
      <Text>Benji</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eeea854b-1afd-4f3e-8c85-d99335c7b418">
      <Text>That was a joke... I’m Jewish, so... ah, anyway. Most of the jobs we have require a four-year-degree, some want you to have a master’s in education.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7e8bc862-04b8-4e18-80ee-db1002f79c3e">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f3457f05-db3c-4a0d-a443-6d6448f68b21">
      <Text>Okay. Well...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="af89bb79-c245-4460-b5a9-643ab8793236">
      <Text>Ryan stands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="12fac6ae-3d52-4510-b337-d62a23ea54ba">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1a9c9499-88d2-48e3-90be-0aad54014abb">
      <Text>Thanks anyway...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ee6559bf-7818-4b72-8403-9e6f966ca09d">
      <Text>Benji</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="566b9327-eed4-4ab7-a6d8-400ff6ff6be0">
      <Text>Wait... there’s one position I’ve been having a hard time filling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2ef1c994-201b-443e-984a-3673fa3d428a">
      <Text>Benji digs through the pile again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2528917f-3bc4-4c2f-a8d9-8b674945788b">
      <Text>Benji</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="61dbfc0e-dc3c-4e78-83b6-84c63b45f94f">
      <Text>How do you feel about Africa?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bbec34ac-30c1-42bc-8cbd-ee739c55de26">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d8edf2a9-938e-44c9-a187-23d411ca0cd9">
      <Text>How do I feel..?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7a38df52-ffeb-4412-985f-e1000590bd56">
      <Text>BENJI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="302277dd-28ba-4b38-9d01-c84bb179701d">
      <Text>Have you ever been?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ccbb30c2-1077-46bd-898c-9017cad57987">
      <Text>Ryan shakes his head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="358ecaf7-b03a-4e74-a485-722aff288087">
      <Text>Benji</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6b902c79-735f-41ee-95e5-4adf4fba6e73">
      <Text>There’s a private company that’s looking for a native speaker to help with their English language skills. It’s a long term contract. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="58ff33ea-a2a0-4a76-9e06-e898ea303fd0">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b4e569ed-588e-4f53-ad99-d7ff68aa3de2">
      <Text>In Africa?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cd642547-1712-4d04-a22c-0e841609c47c">
      <Text>BENJI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4789c9e0-d4e9-4821-bd36-1e97e7a6ddc2">
      <Text>Burundi. Bujumbura.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="771ed74d-7bf2-4e27-9436-e22f17525551">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d40afec5-85ef-4a76-a7b4-fa1e8013710c">
      <Text>Bujumbura?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7bf36f55-2fe6-4003-85c1-077184f0b2cb">
      <Text>Benji</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5e07a8a3-3c3e-4fce-875b-c250aad780e3">
      <Text>Do you have a valid passport?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bfceee0d-5849-4828-9cd7-a458e9eb9f8a">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="512a0fed-a0fa-40a8-ad96-72dca01f6788">
      <Text>Yeah, I think so... When would this start?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8dd9a722-a177-4126-85bc-f93a1c40fe6a">
      <Text>BENJI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="04a64a65-b0c0-4352-9aea-cffa01d42344">
      <Text>Well, we’d do a Zoom and if they like what they hear... tomorrow? Monday?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0f2f384a-1fa5-4fce-a408-a01336a84c0d">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="391b5497-39d1-4441-9a26-0f9329898e8b">
      <Text>Holy shit... I think I might need some time to put things here in order.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="641ed8cf-c615-46f2-b41d-ad692abb39df">
      <Text>BENJI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0f90d1d8-d03f-4eb3-9648-adb9150e9e55">
      <Text>Let’s not get ahead of ourselves, shall we? Can I set up the call?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="76118273-728e-45cc-aab0-e3587739a52e">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="72421232-af46-4e01-82b6-0542a17f6d63">
      <Text>How long is the commitment?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3b85a500-51c0-443a-8333-907a5707026d">
      <Text>BENJI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="61ed0aa4-f615-44e2-a85b-ee952aac744b">
      <Text>It’s a three and three contract... but you know... I mean if you hate it what are they going to do? Whack you to death with a machete?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c4d8b48e-8ef3-4642-b879-b524f541d14c">
      <Text>They look at each other for a beat. Then...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5eb80554-9338-419c-af3e-51477352408f">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4ab699b6-29e4-4406-a69c-6449a917b513">
      <Text>What’s it pay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cb9e6cfa-f341-40be-8d24-c6c5b13ffaf9">
      <Text>BENJI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3e9f4b86-490f-4853-aa16-29dc6977a357">
      <Text>You have to remember that it’s commiserate with the local economy and --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="56338e57-9bd0-4c20-b324-078ef90111f3">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="adb9a27a-e7cd-4c03-afab-2a0dd61e9191">
      <Text>How much?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d648fbec-757a-4d27-b5d6-cd1b665a0098">
      <Text>Benji refers to the papers...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="829dac78-586b-4290-bfb0-1d030bd7cad0">
      <Text>BENJI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bbb92579-ca9e-4439-8839-34e4baadd500">
      <Text>Well, it’s actually... I mean you can live very well on... it’s in Francs, of course, Burundi Francs...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5a335c5b-559f-4ed4-9c47-d6802e3c4c87">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5b69039c-76e6-4568-bf3f-fc189dab95fe">
      <Text>How... much?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e55a73f6-5630-460d-af13-b47daa867fd4">
      <Text>BENJI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aff6a78c-ad89-4a30-a98e-8bedc43babe6">
      <Text>Four million Francs per month.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cf92dc89-f2ac-4675-a589-43bd8b0243a2">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b2d14585-3e02-4156-9d13-4d90b9b20efd">
      <Text>Wow... that’s a lot of Francs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5243cf5d-9706-4cc7-9f7d-fe0f4f56af8e">
      <Text>BENJI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7913b6eb-03a6-44dc-ab25-df896ab3f4ae">
      <Text>Burundi Francs... It really is. You can live like a king on that. I swear.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d30c70e1-1aec-40e9-a432-ce25bf7d0b62">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b2d14585-3e02-4156-9d13-4d90b9b20efd">
      <Text>And in dollars that is..?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6ac0d9e2-2e36-43bb-8c16-f13c24c2e25e">
      <Text>BENJI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="38acfb79-5c39-433a-9798-377b97a4ba85">
      <Text>Well, you know what Groucho said, “In France ten thousand Francs is ten thousand Francs.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="03a5f138-57be-481d-b48c-3cab25d8a6d5">
      <Text>Ryan fights the urge to throw Benji through the window.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="68a0b4fa-3da8-4a60-9a4e-e543200d9484">
      <Text>Benji</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ac959663-b989-4e0e-84a2-1db976c7dad7">
      <Text>Um... with the current exchange rate and all... it’s approximately... a little over thirteen-fifty a month.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="43b94416-abcc-4cfe-9eef-8a2eeed5466a">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b9c9df56-d8eb-4c9e-a131-f49fc68c6c41">
      <Text>You’re shitting me. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5eb640fc-88b5-4bf4-a7d3-f027a052c01c">
      <Text>Benji</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8eb75bf3-f1ed-44b7-9a63-c274c298d6c1">
      <Text>Look, you only work about twenty-five hours a week.You can get a beautiful house for $250 a month. Foods cheap... And it will be the adventure of a life time. And let’s be real, at your age when will an opportunity like this come around again?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="502bece8-b770-473c-a32a-3a93954a7333">
      <Text>Ryan looks at his cell phone. No text from Sarah. No calls.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="17e11617-7bad-42a6-934e-11e5f6e8fbe9">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d6f81b6a-5990-4766-a537-88d289245075">
      <Text>Set up the Zoom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="660e4afb-9e9d-4a26-a458-402bd8ad5708">
      <Text>Benji beams at him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="14fb64f5-6a4a-42c4-a145-1aca68ae59a9">
      <Text>BENJI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8efd6da7-c191-4a34-8ba5-9877e79e41c0">
      <Text>They’re going to be very happy. Really, I have a very good feeling about this.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="a781c19e-961f-4fb3-af73-8b5a8ad25456">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="13" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. carvana - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="20803a55-f058-4cf6-ab74-e9bc248ffdd8">
      <Text>Ryan holds out his hand as a CARVANA DEALER pays him for his Prius.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="6dd2f4c7-02cf-4eff-8b62-f03806b4901f">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="13" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Ryan’s apartment building - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b23e4a62-a066-4e6c-a010-2c5013f75582">
      <Text>Ryan holds a garage sale on the lawn outside of his apartment complex. A YOUNG BUYER picks up a tattered judo black belt... Ryan hesitates for a moment before taking the belt away and tucking it behind his chair.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="3bea687e-e988-4dc5-aa9e-08613606ca38">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="13" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Lax - international terminal - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f4775872-28c1-485e-853b-74441f994fb2">
      <Text>Ryan gets out of an Uber and grabs two large suitcases, a duffel bag, and a carry-on bag. He gets in line at the curbside check-in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9095cc1a-26d8-4027-b163-1849b3bdb01c">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="13" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CAPTAIN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. JET BLUE AIRLINER - DAY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="459e7baf-6e48-49ba-b74e-c7e606a28d34">
      <Text>Ryan puts a carry-on overhead and his laptop under his feet and takes a middle seat in the packed economy section of the plane.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="261f5d81-0aa2-447e-8a68-c965d521a56b">
      <Text>CAPTAIN (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0f79a381-7e69-4542-88c7-59ba8768079e">
      <Text>Good morning and welcome aboard flight seventeen-o-seven. If everyone will clear the aisles and take their seats we’re looking at an on time departure and a five-hour, seven-minute flight into JFK...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ccd1782a-534f-4c67-a6fc-0283a70068a1">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="13" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. jET BLUE AIRLINER - montage - day/night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e623c092-c58d-4daf-91c0-6169df6c92bb">
      <Text>1) Ryan rushes through JFK International toward his next flight and makes it to the gate just as the doors start to close.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="582f7601-8651-4837-8dc3-a1c71ec7b493">
      <Text>2) A MAP shows his progress as the flight crosses the Atlantic to Brussels...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5050e609-746f-4649-96ea-9aee2b713c68">
      <Text>3) KENYA AIR takes off from Brussels</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8d0f9bc6-079a-4f6b-834c-94eba9220a41">
      <Text>4) The Map shows the path from Brussels to Nairobi...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4926d09d-98b1-482e-9267-29f9f0277028">
      <Text>5) Ryan transfers to another plane in Nairobi.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a3f4f600-a5f7-4591-b42d-536135842c6d">
      <Text>6) Ryan lands in Bujumbura</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="e4606e2f-6ea0-48b2-a48f-c9296c976032">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="14" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. kenya air - Puddle jumper - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a9fb77ac-d5ad-4a23-af51-b2448e943bed">
      <Text>The plane lands at Bujumbura airport.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="c5503db0-2d0d-4692-b3d3-b53198a98fef">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="14" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DIDIER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Bujumbura airport - customs exit - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5dc0e8a8-e831-4e7e-878e-5136503e2a91">
      <Text>DIDIER (30’s) holds a sign “PROFESSOR RYAN CUTLER.” Ryan, pushing his bags in a luggage cart, looking exhausted, hung-over, spots the sign and heads in that direction.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6f51e875-5943-44bf-86dd-3cbf3162113b">
      <Text>Didier</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1c4a4699-67d5-49eb-beb5-750031346943">
      <Text>Professor Cutler. Welcome to Burundi. I am Didier.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="71c87f8e-4f9a-4fa4-a6ce-998876e197fc">
      <Text>Didier shakes Ryan’s hand energetically.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="74708060-9ddc-4db4-8a5e-0bce6b0d1d4a">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="61dd6998-e47a-46c6-8dc3-492c4c3c495e">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Mwaramutse</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0cf5e01d-7d81-4071-b6df-dabb45a8b2ba">
      <Text>DIDIER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7a7361b2-3922-45f8-a800-b165f712e446">
      <Text>Oh, my god. You speak perfect Kirundi. I had no idea. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ikirundi</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">canyu</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">kiratunganye</Text>
      <Text>. None </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">mwavyize</Text>
      <Text> hehe?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0339196d-a0b1-4f64-91a9-a9c12cfc8618">
      <Text>Ryan nods his head. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="997786ba-0ac6-4122-892e-622155327e1c">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="efa54dc2-d8b7-4d5c-96fe-aee06b4075a8">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Mwaramutse</Text>
      <Text>... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a0e56787-6f5e-40ee-882b-ad60954aec53">
      <Text>Didier</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3f815f57-25c2-4606-a685-c71bdaa48f98">
      <Text>Yes, good morning. Very good. Allow me to assist you with your bags.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0756008b-bc40-4ce0-8f6e-c033873ad40e">
      <Text>Didier takes the cart and pushes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b33aef30-8c3c-4387-b13d-938e9b633e77">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="14" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DIDIER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Didier’s car - traveling - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="611ba25a-6e29-437f-84f2-8488ab01af2c">
      <Text>Didier drives down a highway in a tiny Fiat. The pothole ridden pavement makes for a bumpy ride.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bf4dcc08-04cd-4a54-aa69-64ca925b2fd0">
      <Text>Didier</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="871209de-e33c-4ce7-93bd-02f6586a0d3d">
      <Text>We are the fifth largest coffee and tea exporter in Burundi... we hope to expand internationally and that is why we want to express in English more greatly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e33ac990-db5c-45f1-85da-74a3635b38b5">
      <Text>Ryan looks out the window. They pass a family of four. The MOTHER balances a large bundle, a YOUNG BOY rides an ox being led by an older girl.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7e7745f7-78d7-4974-9405-0bce3f3bf02c">
      <Text>The colorful garb contrasts with the mostly dirt and flat scenery.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a54ac8d1-013f-415c-9c84-f5bcb06a46d7">
      <Text>Didier turns onto the main street, Boulevard du 1 </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Novembre</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cfaffaf5-e2f9-4c8f-9e80-e46418828fc9">
      <Text>Didier turns into a residential section and stops at a modern duplex.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3e0e62a4-2321-4514-9f58-b89c54316d78">
      <Text>Didier</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9ebd2ad4-95ed-4192-8577-71f9a09da08d">
      <Text>Here we are.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="f5cf4da7-9c8b-4393-a565-b3f2b457ed46">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="15" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DIDIER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. ryan’s duplex - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6b3fc8d5-0ca4-4272-ab4a-90b276346dec">
      <Text>Ryan gets out. Three LOCAL KIDS watch him from across the street.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="795552ef-655a-495c-afbf-e465f09b554b">
      <Text>Didier</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c327dabb-c3cd-4581-ae52-7e07d41bc96b">
      <Text>We don’t get too many foreign visitors. They are curious.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eb679894-ef56-4972-8ea4-08864d77fd86">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="120e4448-1902-4420-b7a3-55c3e006c83a">
      <Text>How do you say good afternoon in Kirundi?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="654f6f13-b690-433a-977f-96dd0d00a4c5">
      <Text>DIDIER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="427ff7e8-6d25-4ecc-a65a-3072fee48018">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Mwirlwe</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="37ad3918-a2cb-4d16-8abd-73b976896d46">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9d609233-b859-4cc7-be88-a6499a5c6baa">
      <Text>M...</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">mwhirlway</Text>
      <Text>? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fe1e7c4a-56f7-4364-b1f9-0904da3dc635">
      <Text>DIDIER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3a8a1e7b-9562-4289-8eba-6f699931e63b">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Mwirlwe</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="063ad172-4361-40c0-8883-bf04cb9f049e">
      <Text>Ryan waves to the kids.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e6f613f4-2578-472a-aa11-8404d8eb297a">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e0fd3b39-ff5f-4d1e-8301-c151475bba6c">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Mwirlwe</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b7499c68-2778-4c90-9cc7-60e6f1d4752e">
      <Text>The children burst into surprised laughter. They wave to Ryan and run off together.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9f546036-b69d-434b-acb0-0ec1d5d42b8a">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="15" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DIDIER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Ryan’s duplex - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7ba2c457-fd07-4995-85fa-ea669d196bcb">
      <Text>Didier opens the door to the duplex. It’s new. New sofa, new chairs. Modern appliances. Didier has three of Ryan’s large bags leaving him with the carry-on and his laptop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3ab1577e-5075-4bf5-975e-cd0e953d3dcb">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6706c456-729e-4966-9042-e6025e7e5d47">
      <Text>You didn’t have to carry all that...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="37efedc4-f92e-4452-aa90-49f7e39fe1d7">
      <Text>Didier</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c01b00e8-9ec1-4777-9f22-3885632b5812">
      <Text>No, no... we are very respectful of our elders here. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8a316a46-2b58-4d0c-b6b8-87195e1e66d0">
      <Text>Ryan takes the hit. He wipes his brow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6a0e87ec-338d-4346-9a49-cbfb1b15c2b1">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="be178bbd-58b8-448c-afe8-932ba10f9f95">
      <Text>Is there AC?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d5fdab31-0ca8-4817-bb72-1707c37fec9e">
      <Text>DIDIER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b03a683d-6a61-49de-b710-3392c87ddefd">
      <Text>AC?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8e10f831-d2e7-4c5e-8a7c-2fe9b3852bac">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6afdaf2e-49ee-426f-b41c-5bd7abe8c5ea">
      <Text>Air conditioner? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="644375f5-cd1c-4fb1-b861-d1d8115c2f5c">
      <Text>DIDIER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="00c12f1d-205c-4f39-a229-e1a6564cc127">
      <Text>No, sorry. The electricity here is weak. Best to buy a fan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="131795d7-c791-4de1-9564-571608edfa40">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cc91d887-653d-4515-8a75-182433f623e9">
      <Text>Is there a fan? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dc08f8ff-3077-49b4-a08e-7e6913dc2c87">
      <Text>DIDIER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7b30ca54-37d2-4a1d-a2d2-4aa84e48287e">
      <Text>Not that I know of, but of course you can buy in the market place.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1461bb3a-baa3-4ddf-99f5-7ba7780cd95e">
      <Text>Didier hands Ryan the key and a folder. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fab3049c-da7c-46b1-a592-925fb42d2083">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="af41ad4f-0922-4776-a3d5-9acf93773ddd">
      <Text>Thanks. This is..?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="77297612-2af7-4c96-ae3c-3f67b774135c">
      <Text>DIDIER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="abf08e61-7df5-43fc-a9e1-874aef579d4d">
      <Text>All about the company. You’re very close. Ten minutes by bicycle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="372572a1-6a8b-4959-a367-46e9597aecbb">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f71ea56c-e8d5-4f72-b15c-ed2e01ac9ef4">
      <Text>I thought you were providing a car?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="da9d8cfa-d620-4af6-a2e9-02bc2c3ea208">
      <Text>DIDIER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="33d4f380-d04f-4e1f-bf46-ab88ff14b2af">
      <Text>Transportation. Not car. Petrol is forty-thousand a liter. Very expensive. Is there anything else I can assist you with?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a38db1fd-4f07-440d-bada-e7ed96316168">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="356130df-7990-42e3-a98d-ab0c3b040db0">
      <Text>Where’s the nearest liquor store? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="78c24dbd-6831-439a-ad8f-0684590f67f0">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="16" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Garage - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c34b784f-0571-4785-8176-4586391b3c11">
      <Text>Ryan opens the garage. There’s a row of storage lockers with cleaning supplies, a broom, a mop, a washer/dryer, and a three-speed bicycle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c5fd31a4-add9-4dc6-b93f-73362e2d039d">
      <Text>Ryan closes the garage door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="55ed4803-3c0f-4068-9e67-ed2620ab3c07">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="17" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Ryan’s duplex - bedroom - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e7e3a9d1-febb-41d1-a74b-b0e5bf586cd2">
      <Text>Ryan’s cell phone alarm plays the theme from ROCKY. There’s a half empty bottle of bourbon, and a few bars scattered beers around the bed. Ryan rolls over and dismisses the alarm. He’s covered in sweat. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cd098d2a-e22c-4fa2-8e45-22197346becd">
      <Text>He looks at his home screen, 7 am, 87 degrees... He throws the covers off and slowly gets out of bed holding his aching head. There’s a long scar on his right knee. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0140e3a2-3fab-4b02-a697-54665c3286ef">
      <Text>His neck and back POP as he stretches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="64436645-204c-4038-b6dd-bfe8ca888220">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="17" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Burundi tea and coffee company - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e5269ebc-127e-4b0f-b66b-5e5eed394d0a">
      <Text>A fence and guard shack marks the entrance to the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">BTCC</Text>
      <Text>. Ryan rides up on the bike. Sweat darkens his back, and arm pits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="80d714ff-4f5d-49db-9823-221b658d3e17">
      <Text>The GUARD greets him jovially and ushers him through.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="453463e5-e8b0-4943-9cc8-7acabbe72aca">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 6/8" Page="17" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ELVIS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. BurUNDI TEA AND COFFEE COMPANY - conference room - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0b4b9997-3747-4b55-b86a-beb60bf7c631">
      <Text>Ryan downs a tall glass of iced tea as NELLA </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NIYANGABO</Text>
      <Text> (50’S) and ELVIS </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">IRAKOZE</Text>
      <Text> (47) wait patiently - sharing an occasional look of concern.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4ef61f1b-e38a-4033-bc51-7d9f951686ca">
      <Text>Elvis</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9bb099d2-73a4-4b93-ba96-1cdd4596201f">
      <Text>Professor --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0ce2b8f6-5fd6-4577-86be-41512c2df391">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="899362ae-e82f-47e3-b94c-687483210823">
      <Text>Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="816c0c51-92e9-45e9-a15c-69df1cd98943">
      <Text>Elvis</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8ac6cc90-897a-4906-ad52-bf9e2696af40">
      <Text>Professor Ryan --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6e63f3b4-e1c2-4770-a417-ae0dba43d084">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6839a5e1-6803-4ef1-8719-73a8772e29cc">
      <Text>That’s okay, just Ryan. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="00c1ddf4-7749-4ecc-9dbd-772628462b0e">
      <Text>ELVIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="acbc0e2c-c99b-4566-8510-406da702fb9a">
      <Text>As you wish. Are you alright?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6297c7f4-1942-46ab-b9e8-25f3b6d3d5f3">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c949d621-b686-4da3-a341-3319a0dd71de">
      <Text>Fine. I’ll get used to the heat. Could I get another --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c452e5f7-cdae-40b3-bffb-320fa4e3f63e">
      <Text>He holds up the glass. Nella sends a text and a moment later, a YOUNG EMPLOYEE enters with another glass of iced tea.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8163a7c9-8409-419e-bf5c-146bcbfb53de">
      <Text>ELVIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="77b5fa58-24b7-4183-b885-d6db8cd8a566">
      <Text>As I was saying, I am Elvis </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Irakoze</Text>
      <Text>, the CEO of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">BTCC</Text>
      <Text>, and this is my head of marketing, Nella </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Niyangabo</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b02b4a83-16d7-43c2-acc0-16bceffe1d8a">
      <Text>Ryan chugs the other glass of tea.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="54a39891-4cc9-4a96-99c4-d8b803d83512">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c1b98621-0b71-43a1-a73f-7dbf23de8e34">
      <Text>Are you certain you’re okay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="11603804-146f-4b9d-a0b8-0be2fc847be0">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="30eb8dba-3dfb-4a28-be1a-e14ee438ee02">
      <Text>(swallowing)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="44565b78-611c-4e8b-86b8-2529af9385d8">
      <Text>Fine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b067e050-d822-4d3b-85ed-8d5fa0aedac4">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="26094e1d-131b-461f-898f-e5cbd76cb539">
      <Text>It’s important for someone such as you to take it easy, you agree?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c064716e-689f-4dd5-8bda-95535019709b">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="96c8c65a-bee7-4594-8d02-21753fe0fdb0">
      <Text>Someone... it’s not the years, it’s the miles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3818626b-ef60-484c-ab9c-d2ebc5d03f04">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="06a8f52f-e759-42f6-b8fa-1f2455a897a3">
      <Text>Sorry?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="446974ca-bdca-4ae6-8666-73155ce2f07f">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="78808424-51f3-45b2-a215-86abf32499fd">
      <Text>I’m fine. Thanks for your concern.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="efd93ecc-cfbb-41e7-afe8-e0c0dcd99e75">
      <Text>Elvis</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b33b944c-7ec2-4353-bd41-d4ee715113e7">
      <Text>You will be teaching the marketing and sales departments </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="822a2792-2001-4652-b5fe-d4f5e1d40113">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c9564ddc-17ef-4ceb-a1ab-eb888ea9f9ec">
      <Text>How many students?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3cb97f01-910b-4270-905d-d5556deb2028">
      <Text>ELVIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1bb637e1-e8c8-4c70-b7c8-38f4a74ac4bb">
      <Text>All together?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8dc2fa70-926f-4c6f-86d8-6cafcccadd9c">
      <Text>Elvis confers with Nella.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7161044d-58cf-480c-a520-85b6d9030a55">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="da95616e-b8ec-46a1-9955-fe3eccdaab9d">
      <Text>Four. But I will be sitting in with the class from time to time.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6864358f-3999-4639-b644-ff81be5456cb">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="370b90f8-21d5-49d7-8432-6514e8fbae3f">
      <Text>Five’s doable... I mean five’s great.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="78de18f5-d797-44df-8e93-517c4973cf89">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6585c890-23d7-4363-ab6f-0b21aaa61b8d">
      <Text>We will meet here in the conference room. Mondays and Wednesdays from 7 to 10. Tuesdays and Thursdays from 18 to 20.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9b153829-a41d-4876-9b7b-e0ebcf391880">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8a114101-92d9-45a6-b004-599488f7bfdd">
      <Text>Seven to ten in the morning?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dee27b05-9c9d-499b-929b-db5c3567e4ad">
      <Text>Elvis</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="510a400c-9dd7-4a9e-ba36-3d28d78ff8dc">
      <Text>Is that a problem?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d77a1d03-3c8a-4391-a822-03f2a2c01a8b">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1a34a7ca-c1f3-43d5-aa6c-1bd05d5287c6">
      <Text>Not... no. No problem, and 20..?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6ac29883-c1fb-47f2-a1ce-6e7f0e93129d">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0b2ba14a-ac13-4092-89f0-b7283e5dd47c">
      <Text>Six to eight pm. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e6c0d58e-94d7-4514-b50a-689450b1b42f">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4635fa63-63b2-426b-ab75-c1c4023bb757">
      <Text>And the rest of the time, I can do what I want?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ea0e2593-6cc5-48e3-8424-4e3e2c353a24">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="188b2d94-4d1c-49b2-bb32-04c9b68de15a">
      <Text>Aside from those hours your time is your own. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8fde2ecb-b586-4a69-bde2-bd1e1829b09c">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7b7666e5-c8a0-453f-8938-0b38128c9760">
      <Text>Starting?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4ffb6a40-7f6c-46ae-b4a6-3db6fc0d75d6">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fb3c6fef-8f04-45c1-81a7-b7c20da0b5fd">
      <Text>Tomorrow morning will be the first class.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aa427924-d994-48f5-806c-7f84c59cde9d">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2f3743a8-4c84-4d4d-a3e5-f763a742f5d4">
      <Text>At seven?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="963041a2-1a1c-45a2-88be-a3a797b928b6">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1307d2be-174b-4922-8ed0-745cb884d131">
      <Text>Seven a.</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">m.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fd59c7b9-f60b-4747-89eb-843be99a077b">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="be62e52d-701a-430b-bf81-5ffab8df8d10">
      <Text>I will be here bright eyed and bushy tailed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d0ee7afe-bca9-4521-a444-57944474aca7">
      <Text>Elvis</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ed5c9278-ebfb-468e-91ff-005d77d986e6">
      <Text>Bright eyed... I am not sure... Where is the tail?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="83284caf-c8bf-4719-a133-184faf66a04f">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4cae247c-6c33-4507-9024-01585d92820e">
      <Text>It’s just a saying</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a504e856-86dd-435c-8dce-d10fd882d5e5">
      <Text>ELVIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="4da61fd0-c464-4079-9dbb-e186d535475a">
      <Text>(chuckles)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b333fa3f-34c7-4b40-aedc-b38f401d4acd">
      <Text>Yes, yes. Exactly the kind of expression we hope you will share with our employees. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="67ea8964-15ed-46d2-81f1-515abbc6276b">
      <Text>(a beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ddd6bfe5-c609-4e93-adf4-d19acc5d501f">
      <Text>Any questions?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f7d8f5b1-7d3d-4a4b-8c20-51f4f35cdaa5">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9bfac53c-d148-4c0e-98f4-5e2bc3254938">
      <Text>Oh, a million, I’m sure. But I can’t think of any at the moment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b94d39a1-bbbd-4f35-86a9-34562e70c00a">
      <Text>Elvis</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2ec1cfd8-4e55-4b04-b8c0-c17a12651a21">
      <Text>You can always call Nella. She will be happy to assist you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e37b057f-05ee-487f-84c1-f6549c8cd730">
      <Text>Ryan smiles at Nella who looks anything but happy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="45677426-50a2-45b9-ac4e-f65476fc664d">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="20" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. BurUNDI TEA AND COFFEE COMPANY - hallway - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="44c0d774-5823-4fe2-ba75-6e255307c665">
      <Text>Nella walks out with Ryan. She speaks in KIRUNDI to the Young Employee. They both glance at Ryan. The Young Employee scurries off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9f23a66d-8246-4aee-ad0c-173e8cd3496c">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="19c12782-690a-4cc4-a768-90177994539b">
      <Text>I trust you’ll be well rested for tomorrow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="681f8846-633f-4b06-b3e1-57a11d3fa760">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="245479c5-aca1-4a76-82e4-605fb42fe2fa">
      <Text>I’m not a great judge of human nature, but I get this weird feeling that you’re not a fan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="01d28407-f3da-41dd-881c-c603b2487aec">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d8fad1f2-baee-45de-8808-e6c309842d01">
      <Text>I am sorry to have given you that impression.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="162bbab1-65af-4564-8fc6-b439138f25e6">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c254980b-6bb1-401f-9439-c587fd291cba">
      <Text>Maybe it’s jet lag... sorry.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5d8f7913-c73e-4d5b-a76a-a6520fa1193c">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ad396ae3-0412-49c7-9d6f-d6ca0790fc79">
      <Text>Or perhaps the alcohol?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e320a832-d53d-477a-a89c-25a90fe88a15">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d025846b-afc5-4282-95df-9e164824685f">
      <Text>The alco..?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f2c8019f-3adb-460c-ad57-395a5175850a">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5dcc4987-0d91-4d23-8869-2c6d5bb8eaa7">
      <Text>As we said. What you do on your own time is up to you. Only...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bc384f3f-b904-4955-a5ce-747044b1647a">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cf3d47a8-617a-4e7a-a1c3-b78772127011">
      <Text>Only..?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4674355c-c5d9-4e67-b91c-b3a1067c2df1">
      <Text>Nella looks toward Elvis’s office. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1a6bf2c1-1571-406a-9dc3-9b4b739d0937">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eb455e2c-35e9-4e48-bc4a-1ed70e083c89">
      <Text>We have official languages in Burundi - Kirundi, French, and English. I find the idea of paying a foreigner a king’s ransom -- </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3814fd42-47d8-425b-8c8d-03a458feb194">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fba3a7be-8f2e-4a73-8000-f207744417cb">
      <Text>King’s ransom? Thirteen hundred -</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1ecbcfd9-307e-45bb-957b-a63fb1084a1b">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cf4f9c78-2866-4047-b660-abd6e74f7edf">
      <Text>Ten times the annual salary of the average person --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f5dd2fbb-ce76-49ea-980a-792e0b8d915d">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a0ca0c9b-f7bd-4803-8070-67a191e4cf16">
      <Text>I know English is an “official language.” I also know that 90% of your students lost scholarships because of poor English skills. Maybe, just maybe, I can help. And if not... I’ll go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2f7807c4-ebf2-4c5b-a877-42169f9a3357">
      <Text>Nella considers this for a moment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ff399d28-9b31-4b16-ab29-08a5ae30c15d">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ba6f0481-54f9-4391-9161-ffcf99676aeb">
      <Text>Fair?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3c3d5151-c4aa-4a20-afc6-65cebbff015e">
      <Text>Ryan holds out his hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="85a671b3-bd27-472d-8b34-10b434c0e4a5">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="87fa5522-e28c-4cc4-a711-b2f14a34ace1">
      <Text>(hesitant)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="230613b1-5e08-4430-ad21-f6579cae31fe">
      <Text>Fair.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0b0c8d7c-68ab-41b8-aa78-83c74ed5e5c7">
      <Text>They shake hands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="a8481031-3a9c-4d13-a15e-2784fa6d77d0">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="21" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. bujumbura city market - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a9d2fbda-57c9-4ee8-8053-1a8f8f4d36e3">
      <Text>Ryan walks his bike through the stalls and shops that line the street. Mostly women hawk their wares... food stalls, clothing stalls.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="048b78b6-7995-4e40-9ad6-1b7f59622af7">
      <Text>Ryan stops at a stall serving a hot bean soup (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ibiharage</Text>
      <Text>). He pays for the dish, about a dollar U.S. And walks along.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="66fc0b27-f03c-4dde-b04e-d150686d9f59">
      <Text>The market is LIVELY, not just shopping, it’s a community. People gathered, chatting. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a08057dc-f47b-4f3f-8feb-bca0537139a6">
      <Text>Ryan hears snippets of Kirundi, French, and Swahili. Occasionally, there’s a word or phrase in English.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="16bd4747-2e2d-41bc-b28e-50d2b64ac486">
      <Text>Ryan passes by four STREET THUGS, about 18-20 years old.  The LEADER THUG motions to his boys.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="664f7379-473d-4e7c-9a3d-18593088dc82">
      <Text>Ryan greets people as he passes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6aea9948-681d-4c3a-9ec2-96a225ae5ec1">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="face3531-fba0-43a0-a225-a859b7e8b314">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Mwiriwe</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f3ce7c02-4f54-4a10-a998-ef53876f7153">
      <Text>The SHOPPERS greet him with smiles and nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="dce17f9c-55a8-4829-a7f7-6d46dffd9c38">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="22" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. ryan’s duplex - bedroom - morning</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e31edc9b-c089-4532-b0b1-58d42953ad0f">
      <Text>The ALARM on his phone goes off. He slaps it and cracks his eyes open. It’s 5:30am... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b9bdfdfe-430c-4e6d-aa31-3292c86854cb">
      <Text>Ryan swings his leg over the side of the bed. He stubs his toe on the (now) empty bottle of bourbon. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4074a3f9-f972-40e9-acb6-386a53427fa7">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="18b3897a-db10-4bfc-9597-5ecaaa5b700a">
      <Text>Ouch! Damn... sh.. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">mother...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="10df38ce-daa8-4cf9-bf01-e92b0d8ea1b8">
      <Text>He hobbles off to the shower.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="0c4f4bd3-3481-4efe-b71e-1ff3dc3c81c4">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="22" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ALL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. burundi tea and coffee company - Conference room - morning</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9ac648a3-9846-49b5-acee-cb516026d41f">
      <Text>Nella sits waiting. It’s three minutes after seven according to the clock on the wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c242dc2f-d959-4173-9a90-d5faec536eed">
      <Text>Seated around the table JEAN CLAUDE </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">UWMANA</Text>
      <Text> (26), </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">JEANE</Text>
      <Text> BIGIRIMANA (24 the YOUNG EMPLOYEE), ERIC </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">KWIZERA</Text>
      <Text> (45), and MAMA </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">CIZA</Text>
      <Text> (39). They all CHAT in Kirundi.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="23dc9df7-e5a8-45b6-8ac8-917bbc3b772b">
      <Text>They fall silent when Ryan walks in. Ryan’s perspiring. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9b425c1f-3db9-4e44-b906-fd0d1e4f71cf">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3047bbed-dca6-4747-ac58-a4a7ba4119b4">
      <Text>Good morning, everyone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fa1e9020-6f15-4770-8ec4-3f3674b4054d">
      <Text>The all rise.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="de443cd6-aff1-4ae0-8774-6f96452d8334">
      <Text>All</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f63ce028-18f8-4d12-8df0-55136456b68b">
      <Text>Good morning.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f2d93590-298f-4c4b-bd89-1210fd8aeff7">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4fa9e3cd-632f-4caf-88a2-ccf151597eec">
      <Text>Sit, sit... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0f01dabf-aa59-41ee-bd9f-5329a6dcd425">
      <Text>The class sits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="94b1c86c-bbb4-49ec-9d66-1673e1c6b6d7">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4fa9e3cd-632f-4caf-88a2-ccf151597eec">
      <Text>Let me... just get some water and we’ll get started, okay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="07575276-ab17-45f6-853b-467afa77b2a7">
      <Text>Nella shoots daggers. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d2ad0e08-c83c-4d30-bbcc-8454b86c8b78">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0371769d-57c3-4855-888a-bcada0d1ced0">
      <Text>And I would find water..?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8b579129-c412-4512-8c24-c95b4edb1deb">
      <Text>Nella rises.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ce772c17-29bf-4316-90b3-3f585bb7331d">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2e8c2b11-d46c-4cba-a016-69420e49efc7">
      <Text>I will show you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="5ec68ec0-1394-4c9e-adfd-5d5dee6a132d">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="23" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. burunDI TEA AND COFFEE COMPANY - HALLWAY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b5b4c68f-ce06-47df-a65a-a88d600cedba">
      <Text>Ryan allows Nella to pass him and lead the way to the mini-fridge in the break area. She suddenly stops and turns.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6cee89ee-7a7d-4e67-9d09-ff478831e924">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5f8d0fd8-c9b4-45ac-9e0d-f9835d59f760">
      <Text>Can you explain why you were late, Professor Cutler?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="24d59a0e-5cfc-4929-8a2f-98f609683b98">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="25d89c0e-71f9-43f4-bc7f-5bd072191fb6">
      <Text>Just Ryan... Was I late? I mean maybe a couple of minutes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d3ae3fda-7db5-487d-a577-3902a9467935">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e4a808f0-37d6-4e6a-a7c1-c9a8c635108b">
      <Text>The time for instruction is short. If you cannot be on time, we will need to make other arrangements.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9e658b89-1846-4463-a934-d9d37c38fee3">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f9955ae1-21cc-47e0-9d97-a487f68d8072">
      <Text>Starting later might help.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0acb06db-9347-4c84-907f-f79a84615df6">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="82d5a7a9-6b89-4430-8153-3aa2d1342ec8">
      <Text>This is the time that has been set aside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3d78fa64-fe51-4062-b825-574d94dc9c84">
      <Text>She reaches into the mini-fridge. She retrieves a bottle of water and hands it to Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8520bbe1-803c-4f99-9f28-96170f8906a0">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="52d63263-c22a-44f2-813a-2ab3066c70e2">
      <Text>It won’t happen again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="efa870b3-58da-4253-a423-b6575bed1fa1">
      <Text>Ryan takes a long swig and watches Nella walk back to the conference room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="f51383e7-5c5d-4bdb-b1d5-2b9dcce1e246">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 3/8" Page="23" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ERIC">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JEAN CLAUDE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JEANE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MAMA CIZA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. burUNDI TEA AND COFFEE COMPANY - conFERENCE ROOM - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0fa4c840-bd40-4d60-9e30-f5ff4a3c9360">
      <Text>Ryan stands at one end of the conference table. He glances at Nella.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="08651585-47e3-4b04-bd3d-6caf14b5bf33">
      <Text>Ryan </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="60f44488-c397-42ed-9566-e218bd33018d">
      <Text>Okay, sorry I was late this morning. I got stuck in traffic.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2269898d-8713-4cf5-b68e-588c608c96d1">
      <Text>He waits for the laughter... there is none.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0ff11426-1e8b-4182-9c57-fe71fd042732">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="51a59af8-cc3b-4d49-9c9b-3f1af3cb1dbe">
      <Text>Okay... Why don’t we go around introduce ourselves in English. I’ll start... I’m Ryan Cutler. I was born in St. Louis, Missouri, but I spent most of my life in Southern California. What’s up, dudes?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0f150bef-b104-4217-a7df-d36aaa807292">
      <Text>No reaction. Except from Nella, who shakes her head...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c46e18d3-c708-4608-a250-9592fa426d84">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7d949b35-379d-45b3-be3b-431d6ed5c02e">
      <Text>I was a judo competitor for many years, and I taught for many more. Let’s see... I’ve had an eclectic mix of jobs. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="00ea36ae-fbaa-4ed2-bad3-2b7745ac4592">
      <Text>Jean Claude raises his hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e955828e-e2e5-42a6-9554-1ee55d76705a">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0d75071a-fdb6-4b85-83d3-ca821eb8e427">
      <Text>Yes? You are?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1b875ac3-c655-4fdc-90b4-90023e96f016">
      <Text>Jean claude</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5b3a4fc5-1659-47c8-a802-e30528648a41">
      <Text>I am Jean Claude </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Uwmana</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="46a0d51d-36b2-4a24-8bfe-e3142b4a10a8">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="18c005cc-5d46-4b29-a685-92902cbbfd7d">
      <Text>It’s nice to meet you. Any relation to Van Damme?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2e9d2c7d-4c44-4641-9ee7-123cfcad602c">
      <Text>Jean Claude looks confused.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a7f00aae-b94d-41ab-a464-1dee936c095f">
      <Text>JEAN CLAUDE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c75094b9-694d-4095-9bfb-9b3bab51f244">
      <Text>I don’t believe so. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d09f014b-972b-45a8-a7f7-10fa94f8632c">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2cb7c48e-714e-4532-a169-fc63d9e99343">
      <Text>How’s your French?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1156efb8-d9b7-4d95-8f5a-ca3d2a6b365c">
      <Text>Jean Claude turns to Nella...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a9c2161f-474c-4512-bdfb-77db63b5f503">
      <Text>JEAN CLAUDE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="0f78919a-e529-4408-ab1e-993444a86c33">
      <Text>(in Kirundi)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f8cef492-a3b2-4a7a-9bda-6f5ad15531bb">
      <Text>What did he ask?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="334776b2-555a-4b36-b8f2-da06c7644e37">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="ebba00aa-4f55-4fe7-ab58-3e734c206361">
      <Text>(In Kirundi)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e9098cad-1801-4f48-9b00-5c9d0f761505">
      <Text>Do you speak French?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fc7440c7-bc38-4087-8bf7-359f0ce5e424">
      <Text>JEAN CLAUDE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1de5bc0f-445c-4089-853f-36c58ad80276">
      <Text>Ah, no... no French.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d8448b43-3337-48cd-a3ff-1f6e62e390c4">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="10447585-d79f-4b4a-8faf-ca7823644971">
      <Text>You had a question?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d8962522-32f5-4344-9b23-fa10b02f131b">
      <Text>JEAN CLAUDE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e35801d9-822a-4d36-885c-93de2210fa9c">
      <Text>You use a word... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="2758620f-1a18-4a67-8f81-7f5ab2238be5">
      <Text>(checking his notes))</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3923289c-ecb4-4d11-8949-d487e4c292e6">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ekalecatic</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f2aae103-28a1-423b-bd77-4eaeb8a860f3">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0624f1a1-5c6d-4f2c-b0e2-661d42121c04">
      <Text>Eclectic...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="84b09bd3-d2f3-42c6-9d2d-546dc29245f1">
      <Text>Ryan writes it on the whiteboard.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="43b7f79f-46c5-41b6-a68b-777795e6f6ed">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d161cf09-3445-4870-a05d-4dfa6f061749">
      <Text>It means a mix of things from various sources but usually under one category. So, by way of example, I worked at a shop as a salesman, but I also taught judo...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bb2cc33f-de2a-45f3-86b0-2ad2854ed7cd">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jeane’s</Text>
      <Text> hand goes up. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bef10d7c-d130-4e88-ac60-e934ef936c16">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dfa6994b-ff2d-4b6d-a9f7-f7e2ea6e6395">
      <Text>I met you yesterday... what’s your name?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="35beb722-1aae-4982-9414-0ca4c9f36fa1">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jeane</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9ad74cdf-15b8-424e-bfe2-2a944acb1ce2">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jeane</Text>
      <Text>. Jean Bigirimana. What is </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">jedou</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6d8c990c-a49c-4c59-976f-45861a96d5bb">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="025e0be3-ac35-4403-a0a5-bdf9321591f3">
      <Text>Judo. It’s a martial art, and an Olympic sport.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d54aae2a-0d7c-4c7d-8549-9f144282b16b">
      <Text>Eric</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca42906a-47ae-4c8f-9f49-345d2e793e62">
      <Text>You must be very strong.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3135b9a5-ef24-4f20-b417-ce60006f8f0d">
      <Text>They all nod in agreement. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="831ca2fe-f972-4da3-842a-93050d2f9200">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="66a6df1c-5099-485a-a712-b35b792cefeb">
      <Text>I was at one time. Now I’m an </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">umutama</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5ec078d0-d4a2-40d9-9b88-fcfa9613fe5f">
      <Text>They all laugh.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="04c1c0a1-f25d-46ae-8089-34bfd9edd83d">
      <Text>Eric</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c4788a49-4f2a-473b-aba0-e488ea52e8e8">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Umutaama</Text>
      <Text>... not at all.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="141b0faa-a408-49d8-b65f-4aad61b9a30c">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b778babe-580d-4094-b817-9fb2bed41f34">
      <Text>It sure feels that way.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="aa2310db-104e-4584-87b9-5b1c5a34b0e8">
      <Text>Ryan turns his attention to Mama.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="01d0b614-483e-42da-836f-d405c35438d2">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2f0d04e2-5e11-4742-8ee6-42cfdd541ced">
      <Text>What’s your name?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8d521964-8dcf-44fb-b82c-5b5d28c4527c">
      <Text>Mama </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ciza</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="911c904e-4882-43d9-a016-ae5fb8b8d329">
      <Text>I am Mama. Mama </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ciza</Text>
      <Text>. I work with Miss Nella in marketing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0e4c793d-aab6-4841-b425-004dc7b84b6d">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ff8522a5-e795-449e-8eb4-0bfbffae045f">
      <Text>Okay, nice to meet you all. Let’s go around again and this time, tell me something that I don’t already know about you and what you do.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9b10be30-8254-44f5-90ee-e30081701e98">
      <Text>Nella watches Ryan like a Hawk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="adbb5183-4c88-4b7f-ab5c-942a1d441336">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="26" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int/ext. Montage - day/night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6cbaec89-baee-478f-b98c-68047dcb40cf">
      <Text>Ryan leaves the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">BTCC</Text>
      <Text> offices and hops on his bike.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0af37acb-752d-4886-9b64-ad9f0e503803">
      <Text>1) Ryan passes by fields of coffee beans.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ab414b3e-1b1b-4543-89b0-a41237619909">
      <Text>2) Ryan at the market - The Young Thugs watching as he buys a beer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7f4542b3-03fe-44e4-9b35-1ad0d465babf">
      <Text>3) Ryan at his home computer - sees an email from an attorney - there’s a file called “Cutler Divorce Settlement”... a new bottle of bourbon sits on the table. He pops the top and drinks from the bottle. After a moment, Ryan delete’s the email.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9c641803-cfc0-4bbb-8565-030be7a9ffa6">
      <Text>4) Ryan waking up at 5 am. Pushing beer bottles scattered on the floor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="04cbf795-6ecd-4530-a992-86b36a5d48f8">
      <Text>5) Ryan and the students watching an episode of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Mork</Text>
      <Text> and Mindy. Ryan demonstrating “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Nanoo-Nanoo</Text>
      <Text>.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1199f25d-ae38-431b-84b5-f124e468d265">
      <Text>6) Ryan biking through the countryside. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="63bc0220-5a90-405d-95bb-473043252c6e">
      <Text>7) Ryan’s evening class. The students LAUGHING, Eric, Jean Claude, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jeane</Text>
      <Text> enjoying him. Nella walks by - watching, then continues through.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="fba85c59-1b83-4724-a15f-8765c25fe142">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="26" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VENDOR">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. bujumbura city market - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="70237d79-604e-4c41-98ba-dffd2e7ce463">
      <Text>Ryan saunters through the line of shops and stalls. He has a shopping bag stuffed with items from foods to toilet paper.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c75e4273-099f-4c4c-95b3-3e8c975e060a">
      <Text>He hands a VENDOR a few Francs. She gives him a slice of Banana and date cake.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e9e96bde-b420-49e2-bea2-0d1ac0e956e1">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b3d9c059-cdaa-4fe3-b7cd-f43813576052">
      <Text>Oh, my god... </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">kuryoha</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="73075d71-57ac-46b4-b8cf-388cfcd52fec">
      <Text>Vendor</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7a86ceca-6bbb-43e2-a4a9-60f789a888e1">
      <Text>Thank you, Professor Ryan...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0020afe9-f1e5-4be8-b118-2e62ef7402c2">
      <Text>Ryan starts to protest --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a5b0ab44-5222-4f48-968b-8938f1b14460">
      <Text>Vendor</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0faa6baf-1185-4414-bef0-2e42ed7d1090">
      <Text>Yes, yes... Just Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a2f6672f-b4fe-4daf-9018-e39744891a03">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f5a06420-65b3-4533-9823-9ca1ea1c9cd0">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Urakoze</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c32f21e3-f612-4828-b638-8fc9dfaf33ce">
      <Text>Vendor</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1420a1d7-5701-4b3c-92df-65a781803600">
      <Text>Soon you speak Kirundi better than my English.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b6836922-3e08-406d-9535-5558d4274748">
      <Text>Ryan hangs the bags on the handlebars of his bike and waves as he steps away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f4dcf537-52ca-4c61-9d60-067d3fcab4e8">
      <Text>The Leader of the Young Thugs follow at a distance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ea613e3b-952a-45bb-bce5-a5c88ed472f5">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 2/8" Page="27" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="COHORT #1">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANIEL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LEAD THUG">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LEADER THUG">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Bujumbura street - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c5356bc2-efb2-40c5-9b1c-79cb8b79ad1d">
      <Text>Ryan walks down an empty and dark alley. Two the Young Thugs appear at the end of the alley, effectively blocking his path.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="36836110-ff93-4ae5-902b-9e6e645bbe63">
      <Text>The Leader and a Third Kid walk up from behind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ce27e2f5-d34b-425d-a8c1-bae301c72ebd">
      <Text>leader thug</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9f1895a4-5195-4c9a-81ad-37dda2df14f4">
      <Text>Hey... you are American?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b00332cb-cfa9-449f-adce-694d888d2de8">
      <Text>Ryan turns to face the Leader. He’s keenly aware of the two large teens behind him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5d4be381-1ba1-466d-ad38-cdc8c8b19758">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="07b63306-4b5b-45cb-9722-22c5e60ca61b">
      <Text>Yes. American, but I live here... at least for now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1cd78608-c7ad-4050-b765-81e1298cd601">
      <Text>leader thug</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="efd9c558-6928-4e27-95f1-aa6ad93faa5e">
      <Text>American’s are rich. Very rich country.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="33ff492e-fe3f-40cd-90fc-88ea82b445a1">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c096d58f-2725-442c-a12a-94702f63defe">
      <Text>As much as I’d love to discuss international economics with you, I need to get up early A.F., so, if you’ll excuse me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b2d07376-1bb4-4ac3-910d-a9af03a6a6bf">
      <Text>leader thug</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cdf51b94-cd08-41e6-9ed4-5bbcfe1c3d0f">
      <Text>I don’t excuse you, old man. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ba971dc0-340d-462d-b4f4-7aaee42ea697">
      <Text>Ryan stops, sighs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a1859d57-0755-4fdd-89bd-67124bc33503">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4fee896e-6a33-4bac-8a78-12b342f7cebf">
      <Text>What do you want?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="16591641-15ea-447d-af85-6f33d3fe4eac">
      <Text>leader thug</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="97fdbba7-0dd8-4c54-8838-3f2da671a344">
      <Text>Money.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ccb2e773-1415-4dad-8a02-9348b1e6aa77">
      <Text>Daniel’s cohort takes out a SWITCHBLADE.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8664774c-2627-426e-8146-a3fae56d7576">
      <Text>Cohort #1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="200779b7-0855-451f-ba5b-6862780a915c">
      <Text>(in Kirundi)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5281c9a3-c2fa-4569-b83a-7d19780002a6">
      <Text>And his bike.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ca65f7f0-4571-45d0-b9a1-4dcc3ceb849d">
      <Text>lead thug</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="59e72860-f86a-4cf4-a5e6-983a00199440">
      <Text>(shrugs)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f572af97-b390-4dd7-9c23-657c300800f0">
      <Text>And your bicycle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="05ae2fae-2cac-43fa-bdcc-a000b37e09c4">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d36fd8c1-3f81-4e3e-96f4-1eb93430e8e9">
      <Text>I have some change, you can have that, but I need the bike to get to work... so, not gonna happen.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a2be992a-9fa6-4d5d-aa3d-f7e0829cda65">
      <Text>The two larger boys, blocking the alley rush Ryan. The taller of the two gets to him first. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="739bd0be-f61a-4c5d-abb1-2aa8556fd720">
      <Text>Ryan let’s his bike drop. He parries the wild haymaker the Larger boy throws and steps inside the arc of the blow. Using the kids momentum he throws him to the ground with One-
Arm-Shoulder Throw (Ippon </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Seionage</Text>
      <Text>). </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e160b975-14df-43b1-adcb-f714b3d626a7">
      <Text>The Larger kid lands, getting the wind knocked out of him. The other three rush Ryan. The first Young Thug connects with a shot to side of Ryan’s head. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="51695d6a-cead-462b-9a9f-9b96eddbb68a">
      <Text>Down the alley, another young man, DANIEL, see what’s happening. He runs into the fray.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="291bcd79-dbf3-4670-b2aa-7becd399c7f8">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="15c44c9f-e2a1-455d-814e-47eef0eab76d">
      <Text>(in Kirundi)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c37edfe9-d83e-4203-b516-c8296bb08bba">
      <Text>Leave him alone!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f4ffa368-f862-4fad-be02-3283cb1c04f6">
      <Text>Daniel steps forward and grabs the Second Young thug by the shirt... Daniel throws the kid with a leg trip. The Third Kid comes up behind Daniel and hits in the back of the head with a wooden plank. The wood breaks and Daniel goes down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="09a873fd-3a97-4843-8817-fcfb59784e4e">
      <Text>The Leader Thug grabs Ryan’s shirt, and before he can move, Ryan has taken a half step to the side and uses Double Foot-Sweep (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Okuri</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ashi</Text>
      <Text> Barai) to take him to the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="60f21a9b-cc0d-47ab-983b-49df1d52be01">
      <Text>The Leader falls hard, flat on his back. The Leader scrambles to his feet and he and his three cohorts flee. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="75c37bca-b185-4c83-8b60-492ad1d32e4b">
      <Text>Daniel struggles to get up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b9cf006c-c5eb-4c55-8639-4254f19a1694">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f40d1614-9e09-4765-b2db-a412949a5781">
      <Text>Stay down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="981062af-dc7c-4adf-b811-7bf3b4cfd9e0">
      <Text>Ryan guides Daniel to lie back down. He feels the back of Daniels head... His hand comes away sticky with blood.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="43b541ad-f57b-4b66-910c-0dacd6d2bf18">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="59bc501f-7661-4f66-b29e-592d142fbe8f">
      <Text>(rousing)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7eac14fb-243a-4ff5-bfd4-961acbec4881">
      <Text>What --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7b04154f-025b-45de-8b39-df5a5fdcc20d">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f3635d8a-db31-49c6-8bf4-b9d5c5c78583">
      <Text>You took a pretty nasty fall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2f19b186-dc34-4329-9059-1622d6fd7f7e">
      <Text>Daniel tries to get to his feet again. Ryan pushes him back down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="365a4b7c-6401-4461-9005-efcc2f611144">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="abf02ae8-d57b-4cec-a6e5-f5e235e135f4">
      <Text>I’m okay.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d3ff8f09-f73e-43b6-84a7-32ddad38abdb">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4e5510ca-89c9-4a39-b2c7-828429d9fad1">
      <Text>Kid, you did a brave thing... Not sure it was particularly bright thing, but... Thank you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="27d302ce-47e6-4fa4-a1c1-ce475aa96336">
      <Text>Daniel tries to get to his feet again. He stumbles to his knees and retches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3afb7ef7-473f-43bb-8211-75a9f66a31d2">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b252ae7a-47b8-4e1b-99f4-65e7bd89ffe4">
      <Text>Where’s the nearest hospital.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="a9e5ce8e-8c51-43f6-9872-a9ff75a5240b">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="29" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Bujumbura hospital - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="49d3246c-3833-425d-8b13-26e70507308c">
      <Text>A dirt road leads to a larger paved one that leads to a small, two story hospital. Ryan pushes the bike with one hand and supports Daniel with the other. They enter the hospital double doors.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="4e00affd-1ceb-4fda-bb11-5980cdf44b49">
      <SceneProperties Length="2" Page="29" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. bujumbura hospital - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="350a7a98-16b6-4fbd-a1dd-de7aaeea4807">
      <Text>A few patients, but not terribly crowded. Ryan watches as a DOCTOR speaks Daniel’s sister CHANTAL, early 20’s, athletic. Daniel, lays in a hospital bed in a small room with three other patients. Daniel’s head has head bandaged.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b1a3c25b-b2de-4558-b6f6-82833ce6eea5">
      <Text>Chantal exits the room and spots Ryan seated in the waiting room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7cb452e2-26ce-44fe-9271-694d8c648e88">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a6faa94e-61ee-4854-9db4-9fbc5a1f72dc">
      <Text>You brought my brother to the hospital?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0f206c01-c4fc-4a66-87ac-eef57bff1309">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f0d00a51-4ee4-430a-a9a5-23f421b6cf15">
      <Text>I brought someone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="937f2a92-03d7-4209-8494-58c08956f103">
      <Text>CHANTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4e5220a6-ad8c-432c-9f33-d10b4b525cdc">
      <Text>My brother Daniel. I’m Chantal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="befae40a-1d2a-41eb-994a-a6a470ac2382">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8c292ce1-19ec-4a68-91fd-82dd721addf8">
      <Text>Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="005541ca-3318-4e76-8507-0a7854b6a0d6">
      <Text>They shake hands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9c873140-dc8f-4438-b7bb-3c5fb5f4e968">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8c292ce1-19ec-4a68-91fd-82dd721addf8">
      <Text>Is he going to be okay.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c94d367b-b31d-4d01-b73c-070d4da14c61">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ad0e2fad-9b89-41c6-9440-a865fe514f00">
      <Text>They will keep him overnight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="92444161-11be-4577-89ff-8b9f465edd55">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f37033be-e3c8-428c-bbb7-b7a228cb6999">
      <Text>He was just trying to help me. I feel responsible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="989aea25-aeca-43be-be78-796fd9cebf6c">
      <Text>Chantal eyes Ryan suspiciously.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d592724e-8a52-4393-8523-47fffbfcc2c0">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6c0341d5-81bf-41b5-bcc8-7e167245fc1b">
      <Text>He says you threw them to the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b113674c-542c-4357-8087-a2bae1e78731">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5563a2f3-91ec-4952-90b9-f35fc2f61817">
      <Text>I didn’t... no, I wasn’t... one of the kids hit him with a two by four or something -- </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="90e9dbd0-19d5-457c-a603-b231672a7021">
      <Text>CHANTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f104279a-3cd1-47b7-aa6d-162bffcf97eb">
      <Text>No, you throw the boys.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1cf0ece9-a5f9-406d-bccf-68882a22dc49">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5f034b37-62a7-43c0-bfac-b45725233f79">
      <Text>Yeah, they were trying to rob me, so yeah, I threw them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="da40739c-469b-49ca-8ea9-aae86111b2c3">
      <Text>CHANTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="abc56ea1-f9a5-4992-97fe-79de2e1b6190">
      <Text>How?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="123f72ba-17fc-4590-bc16-a4a8b0e5d636">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="148517b5-d533-4c73-8f07-7a8790d990ef">
      <Text>How what?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fc5a87f8-806e-45de-8b3c-b1f0c50343ef">
      <Text>CHANTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b8560da9-cf69-403f-b566-ae13ba9b4405">
      <Text>How did you throw them? With what technique?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3d1175b7-50f3-4f96-b5c9-58aee7771cf3">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="508aa9d8-a52e-4b02-bca5-3f3678d972a5">
      <Text>I don’t think that --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3d2804ba-8329-40c8-aed8-a364259256b7">
      <Text>CHANTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="41541b97-1832-4505-8b37-fca523c057ea">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Osoto</Text>
      <Text> gari? </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Uchimata</Text>
      <Text>? Daniel said you used judo, no? What throw?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e66f2bf2-3690-47b5-82a1-f91d481b53da">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ae3f9339-49d9-4317-a052-8161d3a6f4d1">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Okuri</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ashi</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">barai</Text>
      <Text>... How do you know that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3b9be01c-1203-4bf6-9eaf-9b7b45ff386d">
      <Text>CHANTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e4a5f71b-ce37-4d60-80f9-ba59aefa4ce9">
      <Text>I study. How do you know?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8884152f-33f0-487e-9adb-e67414f7a041">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ad9fed0f-3450-4485-b236-e130170813f8">
      <Text>You do judo?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8ba98893-87f7-43f7-9d14-39bb4442a26a">
      <Text>CHANTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c2c43642-690a-418b-a1d3-48a00a696e2f">
      <Text>We do. Do you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="30382fbb-4502-4eb2-a211-aedbfa498a8b">
      <Text>Ryan grins.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="621dc247-6c47-40c1-8019-4c14874a7f21">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fc9600b9-cc2d-40fc-a76a-1586db196f0c">
      <Text>Once upon a time.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a6df3647-65ae-4b50-9143-4fe63cd94d18">
      <Text>CHANTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a685a9e8-8889-4c5d-a308-c538782f0bcc">
      <Text>You should come to our dojo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="293428da-6932-4ef1-a9f2-16ccfb014afe">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2538b431-92b6-4b66-92ed-f530d0fb72cb">
      <Text>Thanks, but that was a lifetime ago.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="000152f7-c436-4ba0-a493-42849126096f">
      <Text>Chantal smiles slyly, nodding.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cc295c8a-10f2-4025-859e-d13536692b21">
      <Text>CHANTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9775ae65-130c-494f-8615-f40be9f984c8">
      <Text>Tough sport for an old man, I suppose.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dac1e8ef-dcd1-42bb-a5a0-2bd61f229bd8">
      <Text>Ryan bites his lip.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="56d2ed1d-8af2-45cd-aa81-8ec4e7995f38">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="89b1a53b-dc7b-4d15-b0c8-c93f157c8115">
      <Text>Where’s the school?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="532e195e-55c3-4012-969c-e8005f42af41">
      <Text>Chantal smiles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="561b5ce2-ce84-4679-8c27-c27401db718d">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="31" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>int. olympic training center - flashback - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a96fdc95-f19d-48ea-96d2-acf4ae0c8b8e">
      <Text>Blood drips, Ryan attacks with the one-handed Sleeve Sleeve--Lifting-Pulling-Hip Throw (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sode</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tsuri</Text>
      <Text> Komi </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Goshi</Text>
      <Text>).</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="687860e8-920f-4b76-9750-050bf4574da4">
      <Text>Ryan and the opponent FALL - there’s a loud POP.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="db37de74-21a3-4908-ab05-b1b5415ca981">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="31" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Ryan’s duPLEX - BEDROOM - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0509740b-6252-46e0-a06a-934f320c3b33">
      <Text>Ryan bolts up in bed, his breathing heavy... still in the fight. He swings his legs over the side and gets to his feet. His back POPS, his neck CRACKLES, and his knees SNAP as he stretches and bends. He reaches for a beer... finds an empty. Stares at it for a moment, then tosses the bottle in the trash.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="5a09d8f9-8c96-46d6-9723-82dfa15364e9">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="31" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. BurUNDI TEA AND COFFEE COMPANY - CONFERENCE ROOM - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b473ffe1-077c-4322-bc74-208e4677c004">
      <Text>Ryan stands in front of the white board. Elvis, Jean Claude, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jeane</Text>
      <Text>, and Mama watch and take notes... attentively.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="1bd00499-f4f9-4f47-a5ba-bfd523b4d9c9">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="31" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. bUJUMBURA CITY MARKET - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="61500c1d-d9b4-4a5c-85fa-2a56959e4865">
      <Text>Ryan checks an address on his phone. He takes a RIGHT onto a side street and heads up a narrow alley.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="d5337b32-fc0e-4e3c-8ebc-dabc34ee582b">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="32" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Bujumbura judo dojo - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1cb5affe-e650-42d3-9c4b-9968fd084592">
      <Text>There is a narrow road that leads to a run down area of shops and businesses, peeling paint, but vibrant colors and well kempt, clean streets. Ryan leans his bike against the wall. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1cb5affe-e650-42d3-9c4b-9968fd084592">
      <Text>Ryan looks in through the window. There’s a class in mid swing with a half dozen 7 to 9 year old children. Some of the kids wear hand-me down </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gis</Text>
      <Text> that are too, big, others too small.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1cb5affe-e650-42d3-9c4b-9968fd084592">
      <Text>The Sensei (JOSEPH </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">BUKURU</Text>
      <Text>) claps and they all line up and as he barks out an order they start rolling across the mat. The tatami mats are bare in places with straw peeking through.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="515363a5-7a73-47c3-a349-ed2854a5cf64">
      <Text>Ryan turns the bike around and finds himself face to face with Chantal. She has a judo </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> slung over her shoulder, and a gym bag. She holds the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> by the crisp black belt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b702b5aa-b77e-4079-bc74-ca40cf03417d">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0f6b2d63-19e3-49f0-931f-f45c52d8f052">
      <Text>You came.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2482f605-6f62-4c33-9b16-e36a1ff4f535">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="93197f5f-5403-4f0b-97c9-1185687af9d9">
      <Text>Well, I was in the neighborhood. How’s your brother doing?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ddbfd8ac-1148-4f94-b48d-dc48f81e3067">
      <Text>CHANTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cd41e436-8d81-4105-bf8f-7293182ef06d">
      <Text>They sent him home this morning. The adult class will be starting soon. Come on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="659dbc19-e17f-460a-9cf5-748500ed95f1">
      <Text>Chantal pushes past him to the dojo door and opens it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c3dc6cfb-3960-4f34-b902-bb4bd4f0d6fe">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aa37a98d-7950-48c8-85b1-eef14a8fdccd">
      <Text>Okay.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b3d82c1f-3fb8-4761-bb6e-4ab4501eb05c">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="32" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Bujumbura judo dojo - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ee6b21a1-ca3d-4435-b4f6-acfe8efd2e4e">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph lines the kids up. There’s a wall clock that reads 4pm, and a thermometer that’s hovering at 85 degrees Fahrenheit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e9bf0c43-ec7e-4b4c-a925-94949ebdaa3b">
      <Text>Sensei joseph</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="013477ca-66eb-4222-bc14-b856b88ec1cb">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Kioske</Text>
      <Text>. Rei!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4469a360-f9d9-41cb-a99a-005a576a3e6f">
      <Text>The kids come to attention and bow. They high five Sensei Joseph as the make their way to the dressing room or off the mat and out onto the street.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="33c47f3a-a60f-42bd-b21a-8a80fca31062">
      <Text>They each pass by Ryan, eyeing him with great curiosity.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="19bbd21e-a2b8-469d-b664-8a61d82036fd">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b7b4c1d1-d895-4010-bff6-d25d7a417614">
      <Text>Sensei...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="15e7d562-6909-4b3e-b90c-c14c115cc3cc">
      <Text>(in Kirundi)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="207733db-392a-4c6d-8986-b0930c157eef">
      <Text>This is the one I told you about.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6c19bdb0-9ca7-4c71-8320-3ba8d01f89aa">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1609a556-f319-4bca-8a9b-3279861159cb">
      <Text>Oh ho. You’re the American who brought one of my best students to the hospital.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a824fa24-e76d-4029-a601-fd4d3bceec73">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="363b69bc-c529-4c20-9e28-1be240c77360">
      <Text>He was being a good Samaritan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b1b3ff32-cdb8-45ab-bb13-a8c83aa42e62">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cb972944-d176-4dc8-97a7-ea10abe59b22">
      <Text>A good Sam -- oh, yes he was.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="172dff33-c3da-4148-8e54-8bb5c71bf263">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c79e50f1-324e-4bf3-b809-3224339a1851">
      <Text>I am going to change.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bf79c4ea-78c1-4ef4-b281-c148e15ff07d">
      <Text>Chantal kicks off her shoes, places them in a cubby, and crosses the mat to the dressing room door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e983abc9-5ae8-44db-b54c-1faf504675f9">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="531e9486-c283-4bc6-a8a5-bf38265c25ad">
      <Text>Have we ever met before?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a5e261fa-ee86-4486-bbec-bd35b3de75a1">
      <Text>Ryan shrugs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2617a256-7d5d-437d-b151-350a60c8906d">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c5246379-0909-400a-a3b1-3b27e5623073">
      <Text>Tell me your name?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ac6e588a-e9f7-45ba-8b72-758f9b7297e0">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="646a04c9-5ded-4ac4-b70f-a80ab09adf69">
      <Text>Ryan...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a8e09778-e7c7-4765-8458-7ddafb93bb56">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4008cc00-3cec-4b24-b838-3c16ab6f00f7">
      <Text>Ryan what?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3d5f95f5-a4fa-4b71-9352-1738e7fcd88a">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="efb8d996-7459-43dd-8f08-44980ed14033">
      <Text>Cutler.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3847b7ab-6308-49e5-9738-a1d535d1226f">
      <Text>Sensei nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cf230a5b-18da-4316-968d-21956933f360">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9b48a12f-a6c6-4410-ae6b-fe1af92ccbee">
      <Text>I hope you will stay and workout with us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ce7d9152-2ba4-4096-ae40-0e151cabd77d">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dbdb7501-ed0e-455f-88df-c144df31ef82">
      <Text>I just wanted to see the dojo... I don’t even have a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="24e9d50b-9012-4f89-ba15-89d22c1c7f9c">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cbd10e6f-6680-4b7f-81ce-959baafc22b7">
      <Text>You look to be a size four? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="e89faaf6-d7be-4744-b4ca-be84af3f045e">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="34" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. bujumbura jUDO DOJO - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="583664b6-e951-4872-a5ac-c6c417b576d5">
      <Text>Several JUDOKA have arrived for class. DARCI, (22/52kg), TINY (25, 6’6”/110kg) all muscle wearing a white </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> and a blue belt, MONTEL (30/73kg) a brown belt, DONNA (24, petite), AARON (26/66kg) a black belt, TOMMY (25/90kg) a brown belt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="efcac22f-d8e7-46b7-b9d0-e2b50248e19f">
      <Text>Another half-dozen judoka wearing white and yellow belts warm up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="80e86e43-73f4-424b-89bb-5a2edf1a1e24">
      <Text>Ryan exits the dressing wearing a clean, but used white </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> that’s a two sizes too large. He bows onto the mat. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1a4521f7-1497-4a53-8aec-c77b9a3c0423">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2ecb6613-ad1d-4edd-84fe-befb5aad1973">
      <Text>Been a while?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a2a54b6f-e194-48ef-a106-32f8ea48e2d1">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f1da7c6d-7969-45d4-b611-a690074cffb3">
      <Text>Yeah. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="21001e73-cd16-4425-8e56-fd60cd7ef188">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7d402203-df1f-491c-8bf6-06b75473f2c0">
      <Text>Take it easy. Don’t get hurt. If you get tired, stop. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="561799ed-e947-4dd0-8abd-5ac80b27e0dc">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d72051a2-c3f9-484d-81ea-6c943537e93a">
      <Text>In that case, I should probably go now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="26e6a7f4-b6f1-4e54-b556-56c66c946323">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1972fe06-9fc1-48c5-bd0a-4dced64756de">
      <Text>It’s not a competition.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fda4efd7-7c49-45f1-a919-e7e86e4561d3">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph turns to the class.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ff543e72-2067-40a8-bf49-47ef83869403">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPh</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="d0cd1688-e2f9-4dd4-b42d-8533279020e5">
      <Text>(In Kirundi)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f20448b5-eee1-4f61-84a5-62592e471ac8">
      <Text>Line up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1e6224b8-3125-4121-8bd6-78b43d9781c5">
      <Text>The judoka line up by rank with Chantal at the front of the line and Ryan in his white belt at the end.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eab3a394-649b-4ed4-a54c-6844728ec1fb">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="71d2aab5-296d-436c-ab60-da40beeaca7b">
      <Text>(in Kirundi)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5ccb0dda-3f11-4939-879b-712922dff778">
      <Text>We have a guest with us today. Don’t kill him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c0664d9b-e250-45bc-b547-96f74c571883">
      <Text>A few of the judoka chuckle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="af90b41a-f488-4f52-b945-782a58f513ae">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="f247d671-f7e9-492a-a868-bd5e6ce892ed">
      <Text>(switching to English)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ec264b6e-c311-4dde-bbf1-7d37eb836503">
      <Text>We want to welcome Mr. Ryan Cutter to the dojo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="27283914-ae3c-47a6-8a40-dc0cefada345">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bfc116db-b975-4388-a363-75fffa259c6d">
      <Text>Uh, Cutler.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0cd075ee-1a41-4699-a80a-6a39742a19fc">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1a37d1e8-f6c6-422e-85f5-aaaab675d960">
      <Text>Yes, yes. Ryan Cutler.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="abc55523-4b88-4da5-a5f2-9d65745e728d">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0f19c7e3-8801-427c-8670-8c7cd876da47">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Kioske</Text>
      <Text>! Rei!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="962b00c9-bbc6-4281-9649-e26cb6cb4c6a">
      <Text>They bow to Sensei Joseph and then Chantal begins to jog. The rest fall in line as the formal warmup begins.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="e6c329bc-89f6-4395-ad64-17b1e82c2238">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 6/8" Page="35" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="AARON">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Bujumbura juDO DOJO - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="965a9f5e-b424-4c2e-b71a-f10165f6c4e7">
      <Text>Ryan leans against the wall... sweat pouring from his face. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8dbb93bd-df1a-4370-9fd9-4fd8a1eba6b6">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="0b3d62a2-9361-405f-9d9d-ebff5b5e7d7e">
      <Text>(in Kirundi)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8270df9c-8804-4e6c-92a9-a7c47a5414ca">
      <Text>Change partners.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d71de139-3749-4874-a390-533776db2b8b">
      <Text>The players scramble for a new partner. Aaron approaches Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a6ae464e-92f8-4469-9780-5bb2bac6a371">
      <Text>Aaron</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cf11c81e-de8c-4b7c-9c08-2de26de4b8c4">
      <Text>Would you care to practice?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ba8e48bc-63b8-4663-a496-eb01a3dd795b">
      <Text>Ryan sucks air.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="922702c5-93d9-478e-9704-30f3b432830f">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="67c5b38f-1fb4-4247-abe6-c9b48bff2891">
      <Text>Sure. Thanks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="247834ba-9ecd-4394-a08a-932c62bd36c0">
      <Text>Aaron enters a hip throw but doesn’t finish, enters and exits. Then he nods to Ryan... It’s his turn.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="89ea291f-215f-489e-9f6f-d149192ab07f">
      <Text>Ryan enters tentatively, slowly. They go back and forth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2824a8ca-07f2-4ef2-8ebf-a749b3a8be94">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph watches him closely. Ryan stops, catching his breath.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4c782449-3398-4513-83c4-6cf14763c847">
      <Text>Sensei joseph</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fd56692a-10f7-4ec7-a0a0-d07e8abb0120">
      <Text>How are you doing, Mr. Ryan?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aea7e289-7407-4fb8-9357-dac9cab09cdc">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0c5e0c4a-29f4-46c8-9fbc-cf1ffcf4b60e">
      <Text>Jim... Dandy... not used to the heat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="38a93da4-4c15-4952-8780-4b839ed486f0">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph nods, smiling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ce37bd8b-92b3-4339-8214-8b7c8d770c5b">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a67eddb8-4258-4fcd-8fab-6f8a6c833887">
      <Text>Randori. Aaron, please work with our friend Mr. Cutler.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="14b88306-48c4-434b-bdd0-ec8597e26d56">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph sets a timer for four minutes. The timer RINGS. Ryan and Aaron bow to each other. They move around the mat, it’s a match, half speed, but a match.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="72f1a9ca-ab62-43f2-943e-a928c4d66e67">
      <Text>Aaron hits Ryan an outside leg reap (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">osoto</Text>
      <Text>-gari) Ryan lands flat on his back with a thud.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2f7017e0-e5ea-4d79-b6ee-a2ce4eee7570">
      <Text>Aaron</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="082b0bca-ea4b-4e8a-8db3-31f44528ed48">
      <Text>(in Kirundi)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c5723aad-5ee8-466a-8613-1e5ddcb92887">
      <Text>Are you okay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9567d72f-dbd9-42ae-a3ff-abbce1e7df7e">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="532f8896-7b7e-40a4-9b89-d57e24857232">
      <Text>(in Kirundi)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="41b9772a-3c99-43e9-a030-f8c30463011c">
      <Text>Take it easy on him, Aaron. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0214a40c-6099-4c1d-ac9e-390f5b14c3f5">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b718b082-3ba2-4f9e-8465-113e0e9f5b42">
      <Text>I’m okay. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6d4b7778-72f6-46af-be8d-05b00ad4092d">
      <Text>Ryan gets to his feet his hands are lightly on Aaron’s sleeve... as Aaron breaks the grip, Aaron slides into a floating hip throw(</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">hane</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">goshi</Text>
      <Text>). WHAM Ryan lands on his back again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="24c2fd14-f3fa-4060-ae34-bb29aa686a31">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="59a06b47-5654-4d4c-a09e-9108a174606c">
      <Text>Aaron.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ca501754-8e27-46a0-a0d1-3e92495fb060">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b1eac0e3-6a44-403c-a46c-d706bd038386">
      <Text>It’s fine. Seriously.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="16f63576-888a-434b-b8a9-36eb92e60e2e">
      <Text>Aaron helps Ryan to his feet. The move, Aaron, cocky now, rushes Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="16f63576-888a-434b-b8a9-36eb92e60e2e">
      <Text>Ryan backs up a step and turns into a body drop throw (tai-o-</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">toshi</Text>
      <Text>). Aaron hits hard enough to SHAKE the mat. The entire dojo stops and stares.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a23087bb-366d-4565-802e-81282b28006a">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph watches with great interest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4368c6d5-97ef-468f-8073-aca49cce8723">
      <Text>The BELL rings signaling the end of the round. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="903e5fc2-13b2-4538-a699-6fe3ae978f38">
      <Text>Donna approaches Ryan... He’s sucking wind HARD, but he bows to her and they begin. Donna enters a backward throw (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ouchi</Text>
      <Text>-gari) and Ryan flies onto his back... he lays there for a moment, until Donna helps him up. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="87fd1484-98c8-4faa-b267-810313974bc7">
      <Text>She comes in for a one armed shoulder throw (ippon </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">seoinage</Text>
      <Text>) and he gently moves around to her side.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="bd7145a9-360d-4f2e-ad08-dd2818297e75">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="36" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Bujumbura judo DOJO - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4421a677-15b2-4abb-9179-f42e22bd1844">
      <Text>The clock on the wall shows 6pm... the temperature is down to 80 degrees.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8e546174-4518-4ca0-9044-af9258fa7bb7">
      <Text>All the judoka are seated on their knees... except Ryan who keeps his right leg outstretched. He’s looking down, sweat pouring, sucking wind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="17287f87-8eb8-4971-b181-fba94aca4e18">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c024202d-b37c-4e15-bca7-61ce3c9f2b4c">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Kioske</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Muksou</Text>
      <Text>!(Attention. Meditate!)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2278e46f-c703-4c3a-8d1c-bd490ff7da27">
      <Text>Everyone closes their eyes in silent mediation.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="97f44210-1863-4c12-b1ae-bee5696c3cd7">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8dd4c494-8ba1-4499-8a4f-dfc6c35a2a1f">
      <Text>Sensei </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ni</Text>
      <Text> rei! (Bow to sensei!)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="16bb3ea2-794e-4241-91b8-fa5092795ec8">
      <Text>They bow to Sensei Joseph. Ryan struggles to his feet. Several of the judoka walk by him... shaking his hand patting him on the back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8be914fc-37be-4270-8474-f4ebd8de03aa">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="09c5dfd7-66dc-41d2-98d9-f5554b25f63a">
      <Text>You look like you might use a beer. May I?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6662a930-f91a-49c7-99b0-9e34e4e75677">
      <Text>Ryan wipes his face with his </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3db63ae0-7e9f-4c3a-aafe-6ff9f25bd7f9">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2d77b5cf-9e04-4bfb-a550-d71f0154b7f6">
      <Text>If you’re going to twist my arm...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cff272aa-1ad8-4a10-9ba5-8ec7032612e9">
      <Text>Ryan bows to the Sensei.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="12b1f834-86ad-48a4-a9b0-21ad00ff3546">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 5/8" Page="37" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Bar - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="84c92939-79f4-4832-9ac7-8cad444b21fa">
      <Text>A busy local bar with the after work crowd. Ryan and Sensei Joseph sit side by side.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f07fcdbe-3154-43a1-9516-d3801218e6db">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e1d6b2ae-3eda-489c-9191-5fdfac3a64d2">
      <Text>I started judo in South Africa. I competed for the national team. I went all over the world. I wasn’t very good, not compared to the Japanese... not compared to the Europeans. You were a competitor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5d3b5ff8-3fb5-43a9-be04-ab2c4a08821c">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fc1ac3d6-cf7a-471c-8819-8aa8bf235be6">
      <Text>Once upon a time.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1eb7f961-02b5-4492-b339-83335f9e33a8">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="34ecdd45-830a-4a8d-9f06-da5120ffe571">
      <Text>I could tell.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2237cf7b-32c1-478e-8dea-603ff135c533">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ce0370ef-54b3-4ba9-9e3f-9d6cb07eb1da">
      <Text>From how I take a fall?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bed03416-0fe6-4f89-a0c1-c04a896981a5">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="48f165c0-d690-45b7-b1c3-28e6ac26f116">
      <Text>(a beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d627072d-4462-460d-a86f-895915ded18f">
      <Text>I remember a lightweight. About your size. He fought at the Dutch Open championships in Amsterdam... in 1990, I want to say. He had this amazing </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">sode</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">tsuri</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">komi</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">goshi</Text>
      <Text>. He would do it with one hand. Like Maruyama, but way before Maruyama.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c4d4fd53-f179-4c81-adab-2e794ec8f6c7">
      <Text>Ryan sips his beer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4c36b9da-a3d0-4db3-9885-561efbf5de94">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="88e7408a-d256-4223-b5f5-84af9a0a85c3">
      <Text>In the semi-finals he fought a very tough Russian. Broke the Russian’s arm in fact. But lost the match.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0d9e6019-8678-45be-98a1-d78f28b29cf5">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="189ff69e-136e-4300-ac4e-fdc3f3be87f8">
      <Text>He was one tough </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">mo-fo</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="381f852b-79ce-4b6e-877d-420bba385b2d">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37f9a98e-d6b2-4cc5-a49e-c378d7828eb4">
      <Text>I remember. You are one very fine judoka, Sensei Ryan...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="17a6f726-ffde-4cec-91a5-03a3570df177">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="11d12269-12df-4960-a615-0936c0803cc1">
      <Text>Just Ryan... I was. That was a long, long time ago.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="01e7679d-b71b-49a8-968f-5e8fac3f2a62">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="22dffe08-e39b-4ccd-b405-6a2fb575a880">
      <Text>You tossed with my second best male competitor today.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="82b2532e-febf-42b3-a82a-f40c314b4cc9">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bd503edd-f464-4ea7-8a78-d27e4657b167">
      <Text>He was being kind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b8191dd7-e7c5-4a3f-89a3-b610674f9f8f">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="87c77bdb-2594-4cc1-b35a-59b9dce866e4">
      <Text>I think not.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="742e561c-7022-4652-b072-6337c1d46482">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f89f85f7-89b9-4d5a-8efc-604e94bc58a2">
      <Text>Yeah... well...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8a8879c9-09aa-488c-8347-ca1e7a06c0c2">
      <Text>SeNSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="22dffe08-e39b-4ccd-b405-6a2fb575a880">
      <Text>I would be honored to have you come to the dojo whenever you wish. Whenever you can. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="41e4f500-e209-4be5-b024-3ebac41c592f">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="39059efa-1f90-4746-a9c0-b93dd87fa42e">
      <Text>Thank you, Sensei. I won’t make any promises... I am going to let pain be my guide.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ce7ba619-28cf-47cd-a85b-ea5ab7700cec">
      <Text>Ryan gets to feet with a groan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fe52af5f-908f-4aa5-abfb-d040cf0577e5">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f760a246-8118-4ea6-977d-9f665a441f51">
      <Text>Thank you for the beer and the workout. I’ll see you around.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a59e044c-a606-4bde-bd82-f374d8be72d1">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="85efc12b-3aae-4cee-87b9-23aa4cdeddcf">
      <Text>I hope so.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1f953c2b-eb70-48dc-9ed1-ed84a38d00f8">
      <Text>Ryan bows sharply... and immediately grabs his back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="997cfbb3-490e-4e03-aef9-a32649915e90">
      <Text>Ryan hobbles out of the bar.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="af3edde3-1ad9-40d2-b5f0-063127275567">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="39" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Ryan’s duplex - bedroom - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="725cd577-d50f-44c5-89ed-40c1d74bc7e6">
      <Text>Ryan’s alarm goes off... He painstakingly pulls himself to a seated position. Every move comes with a GROAN of pain.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9672b507-35ce-4574-9ce7-5d7e7a938736">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="39" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. bujumbura judo DOJO - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ab7a895-7425-4334-8eeb-48b74a2ad3c0">
      <Text>Ryan parks his bike outside the dojo. He carries a gym bag with him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="252435e6-7eb7-4902-91b7-120be691fc69">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="39" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Bujumbura judo dojo - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cc400a23-9c70-4b6b-9545-9b708adda1f5">
      <Text>Ryan steps onto the mat wearing the over-sized white </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> and his old black belt. He gets in line with the others. Just in front of the last brown belt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="34dd7844-bfe9-4a7b-bb62-1f2737bc2adb">
      <Text>Chantal looks down the line past the others, Montel, Darcy, Donna, Aaron, Tommy, Tiny, and Daniel... a half dozen others.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9f2078d4-5f9f-4d00-994e-5e82fde07287">
      <Text>Daniel’s head is bandaged.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="54fc8e57-2623-4979-ad23-b65ea6c88063">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7811a38f-91dc-4916-8b54-ba08299c85f0">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Kioske</Text>
      <Text>! Rei! (Attention. Bow.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ca3c055e-d9a5-49b8-9f75-527869ec20b2">
      <Text>They bow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="52d469a6-6bae-48f0-91cc-97809d4e61da">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="39" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANIEL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TINY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Bujumbura judo DOJO - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2f0630d5-31fe-4c75-9e16-09dd0bf700df">
      <Text>Daniel sits cross-legged against the dojo wall, watching. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="86c691db-c081-41ba-8e08-fb63e127ed59">
      <Text>Ryan, drenched, in mid randori with Donna. She throws him and he gets up smiling, in his element. The TIMER BUZZES, Ryan and Donna bow to each other... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="53176064-2bd2-4324-9069-cf6e403e365f">
      <Text>Ryan notices Daniel. He walks over.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="21244b00-1083-40fa-9773-202e7d5ed101">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2a2d3d7d-eac9-4aaf-aa76-d376cd1d1cb2">
      <Text>How’s the head?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7bc8c3b9-a0dd-425d-95a0-7320fb952607">
      <Text>Daniel shrugs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6cfe4aec-e1d6-42f3-bdb9-c1d5a89f3efc">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8112e374-e8a4-411c-9c25-e22aa4e1d634">
      <Text>I am ready to return, but the Doctors are stupid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="07fefc39-0548-40cd-9337-c922422578fb">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9779fe41-2796-4324-8373-33823f254a35">
      <Text>Slow and steady wins the race, kid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b04bb89c-a7b0-457d-830b-c229d302068d">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7fb90635-a872-4907-984a-3bb79d5cb1b6">
      <Text>How does slow win a race?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5c2461a8-3673-41c2-b68f-bb70b05a3b11">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c91d99cb-abb4-4a49-8ded-e8bca7003d70">
      <Text>It’s just a saying... it’s... Never mind. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="dcc2c34d-8d75-4e69-a69a-2a42185082eb">
      <Text>(a beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="45675b42-3763-48c3-becf-c1ebcb735efa">
      <Text>I just wanted to thank you again for coming to my rescue. You didn’t have to do that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="443a25ff-c76d-4631-9800-56f17990c6df">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b5b654c1-b95a-423f-999a-9a2bbb636fd8">
      <Text>They were stupid. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cb2d0f68-a1b7-4efe-8010-30183b578406">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="288ef8d2-21cd-49aa-8ebd-27a6a6c793d4">
      <Text>Well, maybe they’ll become doctors... Thank you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ff3d6ec-8fed-4ccb-a55e-8b1f4d69958f">
      <Text>Ryan sticks out his hand. He takes Ryan’s hands and shakes. Tiny approaches Ryan and bows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d4e40160-0493-42a9-ae8f-060e36d57abf">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3d9c2441-0742-49e5-ae92-6af94bcb6091">
      <Text>You... want to randori?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d5902856-1fef-4bfe-a860-f0da31171f4c">
      <Text>Tiny nods. Ryan looks up at him, deliberating. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="81c42ecd-6478-4853-8735-0b2885c99da6">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0de079f8-81d7-4093-9a80-ae0685d7c91a">
      <Text>Sure, we can go light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bf0e26f3-b874-47a1-9345-5bb270462e94">
      <Text>The TIMER BUZZES starting the next round. Ryan and Tiny bow to each other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ed22260e-2006-4b2b-81cd-650f6b26748d">
      <Text>Tiny tries to use his size and muscle entering a sweeping hip throw. Ryan barely evades the throw. As Tiny’s foot starts to touch the ground, Ryan executes a perfectly timed foot-sweep.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e873de4b-279c-4191-a3c9-cef0e4c91e37">
      <Text>Tiny lands on his side - stunned.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6065bdcc-196a-4339-9f28-1828eb87a935">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="07edd3b0-e289-477a-8bc8-6e6d7c7f2ee8">
      <Text>Are you okay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="36b3a339-918d-4584-b2d2-5b6e9581dfec">
      <Text>Tiny</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ed48cf1d-1812-485a-9250-c82ae2f7efa8">
      <Text>How did you..? Show me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="938a8991-765e-4677-a30b-897f132d62d2">
      <Text>Ryan shrugs good naturedly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a99198e4-1913-4ad3-9ce1-6833e51d51da">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ce322c34-9b88-4bc3-a767-8e5f9271fd6d">
      <Text>Sure, Tiny. After randori.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c435384b-ba83-4d5a-a1ba-832fd01b3326">
      <Text>They move across the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="1cf47148-5fd7-4cfb-a4c5-480f3d81f9a8">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="41" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Ryan’s duplex - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="599c5667-ade3-45b7-813e-64092194540d">
      <Text>Ryan has two large bags balanced on the back of his bicycle. With a GROAN he lifts them off the bike and enters his duplex.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="deb46bb0-f963-4aa9-94b4-8ff47a8af0bb">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="41" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Ryan’s duPLEX - bathroom - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="beaa8771-deb9-4619-af24-ba7bfc4e3af4">
      <Text>The tub is filling with water. Ryan has the two bags next to the tub. He opens the first back to reveal two five pound bags of ice. He rips the plastic open and drops the ice into the tub. He reaches for another bag.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="7839b316-dab5-420d-9524-29ba27763154">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="41" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Ryan’s dUPLEX - bathroom - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b940e513-5e9e-46d4-8e21-686a54705ccd">
      <Text>The tub is filled with ice and water, Ryan SHIVERS as he sits down in the iced bath. He lays back... soaking his entire body.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="74b0fd5a-01db-4cb5-afa3-55d80db4f901">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 4/8" Page="41" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. BuJUMBURA JUDO DOJO - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="06873ddf-7901-424b-a2d9-f06eedf1198f">
      <Text>Chantal and Joseph stand outside the dojo in a heated conversation. Ryan rides his bike toward them, hopping off as he approaches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="71365e1c-c602-423a-836f-3cb8bba10d75">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2d2fbb59-dfba-4cbe-a485-991aebee7345">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Mwiriwe</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="374ca09a-fbfd-4a0d-ba50-080e66c0a454">
      <Text>Chantal and Sensei Joseph shoot him a look.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cca6e37c-f569-4d43-8719-66cfdf41f357">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1492e1c7-5a6a-4337-a3f4-d6633cc660c5">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="22fd73ba-2579-4fff-a44e-7e27059ad538">
      <Text>SeNSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b30fd6be-b940-4eaa-8a8c-7d5ce566a87b">
      <Text>The regional team championships are next week, I think you know.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="603cef57-aa5c-444c-90d0-7026534a0cdf">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7e941480-12d7-4ef7-b05d-74a759ed4ac2">
      <Text>Yeah..?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="01c92e51-d346-469e-bc39-271415ebab71">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="94bd5017-e670-4bdf-9f77-6ad8cd8cf16c">
      <Text>Aaron sprained his ankle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9025078c-c761-4aa0-8adb-1e363825bcef">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1a40e969-c125-4e58-95bc-c61410f51ed7">
      <Text>Tiny sprained Aaron’s ankle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c58fd6b4-0789-4681-861d-3257298540ae">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ddc60159-1cae-4925-ab06-d57519459a71">
      <Text>It was an accident. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3674920a-7641-414f-8886-27014ae6a610">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ea5383f1-794b-4010-a515-ebf5c0798848">
      <Text>Sorry to hear... how bad is it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1a5d98bf-d9ce-4e07-86fd-a04e8d2941bb">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="01aea75c-f9e9-4eb1-9d9c-c70d5e266cad">
      <Text>Bad enough... Aaron is out, and of course Daniel is not medically cleared for competition... </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">So,I</Text>
      <Text> wanted to ask you something...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b934ca4c-bb68-4495-a416-03de549a71a7">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="4aad1ba8-37e1-4f64-b435-c10942a357f9">
      <Text>(in </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">kirundi</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5b86d7fa-98f8-4321-9ff3-06b15e6bed9a">
      <Text>It’s a stupid idea.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1a489c74-d1b5-443b-9fbe-32d96039d177">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e94d9f67-0fa4-48b6-b704-023d60f72b09">
      <Text>We need six competitors to compete in the team championships. We’ve won the last three years.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f0a329bd-ea1d-4bad-b251-a5a41bcbccc5">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2baef0fa-569c-47d1-89e1-56ad09b71f56">
      <Text>Uh, huh... and so..?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="79b6bbc8-544b-47b3-b495-86045c131ad8">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="de49fbbb-c36f-45d1-84b2-8f6cc6423583">
      <Text>And so, nothing -- we won’t compete in the teams. That’s all.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="23ff64ba-8165-499c-b4d9-f6d70e21abf1">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0c11bd47-0f58-487b-bdad-496d6ed918e0">
      <Text>Unless we find the sixth... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c586f099-28be-4d64-b5a2-714535c173c2">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="494e69f4-314e-4a39-bf24-51a04118e922">
      <Text>Good luck with that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="65abde0f-1158-44f5-9ebc-428691283b87">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3b4f6623-0058-4633-b7b0-60616860e6a6">
      <Text>The thing is, you’re about Aaron’s weight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fc81f855-5950-4ee5-bb59-2024a4bf9786">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e157857b-ed7d-47d9-a760-d3a6cec974ac">
      <Text>Are you... are you asking me to fight?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bc805a06-96b5-4349-9d73-4f92cde0bdce">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="66252dcd-c790-447c-9b92-8796802f6b4a">
      <Text>I am. You’ve been getting better and better over the last six weeks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8532ab20-2850-4d61-a10a-bb685aaf2552">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="191658d8-b15c-4e05-acc9-6843fae224c0">
      <Text>I told him it was stupid. You are way to old. It would be dangerous for you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8d0c2227-8b4a-4e33-a36a-ff9e6d29e642">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f1fb86c8-bf7e-4237-aa4d-bc94c77abaaf">
      <Text>Dangerous?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="33c0ff62-32e1-4b13-b2ba-6d334e232f46">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ff7e3205-1c5a-4fd3-b3c5-32df07b90fd1">
      <Text>We just need a body. You don’t need to win. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="32c5e4b3-87a7-48d6-b50a-f32b545f549b">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c9edae75-6e05-4bfb-91fb-5d6cd5b42a71">
      <Text>Just register and take the fall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3f0c124c-7aef-485c-a84a-297445dd41f9">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0b84e4ae-8794-4f2a-a18b-3fecf4741b2e">
      <Text>If need be.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5aec2506-59a3-4885-a564-a25971b6e300">
      <Text>Ryan looks at Chantal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="362afece-a2f0-49d1-8e95-564b22c52f4f">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="61814afc-3b71-4c2b-89d7-52f48ba7e315">
      <Text>I haven’t competed in almost thirty-years.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="b1089db9-ddc6-4340-8c3e-04409e84192e">
      <Text>(a beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cabd27e4-3fe2-4fa2-88dc-fe2357c67d74">
      <Text>What the heck, I’ll give it shot. What have I got to lose?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f983dcb6-a841-4963-9f5f-489d95ac2131">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="193124c1-ac06-45be-9a8d-3700a7f9150c">
      <Text>Your life!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ec4e0565-7a6e-4f51-88b0-0013a61793ac">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="79a695bd-cbcc-412f-867b-032cf0feae55">
      <Text>We’ll nothing important.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8c6fe796-0651-44c1-8735-bc8f389f4363">
      <Text>Chantal HUFFS and enters the dojo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e8f58860-ea4e-4d89-8845-de2bbe88447b">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6dc951cd-21f7-4567-b097-579e19edfa82">
      <Text>She’s the best competitor we’ve ever had, but she thinks she knows it all.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7e7c79d8-4fc3-4da5-9c37-6f15d993def2">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="00cfdee0-f631-4e71-b7b8-3d6426f0a5db">
      <Text>I did at that age. Now, I know nothing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cfaf9962-6d79-4918-988a-e7cde86e67fa">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1f3f1246-3540-496b-abc2-a43e35da9798">
      <Text>Thank you... but you will be careful, yes?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9eea218e-69a4-45d1-b513-7649cc01d3d1">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="19b2c9da-81bb-437c-a223-445c0ba0574d">
      <Text>Careful is my middle name. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d1dea05f-62b1-46eb-b79d-376de402397f">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e62b31f4-d62d-4fc3-97e8-5acd55413a55">
      <Text>Oh?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="49c3addc-8822-4498-ac4e-232696b4d254">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b5469e80-9420-419e-a35e-400ee67eefa3">
      <Text>No, not really. It’s Allan... but I will be careful.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="39a8e2d5-2402-4f2d-9290-d3a96d8b731d">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="43" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Bujumbura convention center - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="78524de5-78e6-4d1a-b25c-13e7aaced55d">
      <Text>A medium large crowd gathers at the entrance of the convention center. The digital billboard exclaims “Welcome Bujumbura Maire Provincial Judo Championships.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="3de759cf-ae9b-4e29-bea6-20887393cd7d">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="44" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="AFRICAN REFEREE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Convention center - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b9c4a88f-eaae-4839-bdaa-24050f18d972">
      <Text>The main floor has 5 judo mats with bleachers on both sides of the contest areas.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cd522055-003c-4958-a8ef-eb36c9d93f22">
      <Text>Ryan, Tiny, Darcy, Donna, and Tommy warm-up. Ryan does form practice (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">uchi-komi</Text>
      <Text>) with Tommy. The others stretch. Sensei Joseph comes over the edge of the warm up mat. Daniel sits next to Aaron watching from the bleachers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9d45a3e1-33d4-429b-a97f-fdc5f74b096b">
      <Text>SenSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="91f494c4-d1ea-4b14-8509-e863de1ffc6e">
      <Text>Chantal is in finals.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e10660ad-2cd7-44fe-b184-f186d854d0df">
      <Text>On the middle mat, Chantal faces </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">BELANGE</Text>
      <Text>, a tall, athletic woman in her early 20s. The AFRICAN REFEREE gestures the two woman to the center of the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c778f745-7702-4d85-8b27-be8fdb9536fb">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph bows and takes his seat in the coaches chair as the two competitors bow to each other and face off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f891b2c2-fe69-4d5c-90b3-098eb8d78685">
      <Text>African referee</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="415c577e-3e51-4aa9-8d47-98ba4d45095c">
      <Text>Hajime!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fc3f14d9-0f54-4bc2-8eb4-83d09caacd3c">
      <Text>The match begins with </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Belange</Text>
      <Text> using her superior height to get a collar grip. As she reaches, Chantal turn and squats low for a perfectly timed drop shoulder throw (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">seoinage</Text>
      <Text>). </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f243b1f0-1055-4c10-b569-fa0eca8c21aa">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Belange</Text>
      <Text> lands fully on her back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9e365eb8-c077-4894-bc28-f13d9b869783">
      <Text>AfRICAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9c96288a-7360-4525-bede-2b8e315d6a57">
      <Text>Ippon!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9d0a31e1-e208-4cbf-985c-a97ab28066b5">
      <Text>And BOOM, the match is over. Ryan, Tiny, Darcy, Donna, and Tommy CHEER wildly for their teammate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b67b58dc-609c-48d2-8e6f-60b3f489f192">
      <Text>The African Referee awards the match. Chantal and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Belange</Text>
      <Text> bow. They go to shake hands and embrace. Thrill of victory... agony of defeat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="5c3a236c-8028-4b65-b553-b16d98c764ca">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 7/8" Page="44" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Bar - restaurant - bujumbura - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="52b7d087-f72f-4d19-b90c-48cc7fde4493">
      <Text>Donna admires Chantal’s medal. Tiny and Darci are deep in conversation. Tommy chats with Aaron and Montel. The restaurant is lively, loud MUSIC, lots of people.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7e833c71-aa88-4c84-9261-b331565a100c">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph brings a beer over to Ryan. Ryan’s face is a roadmap of mat burns. His eyes are closed, he could be asleep, but he wakes as Sensei Joseph sets the beer in front of him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="790e8558-4018-4bc4-8d53-3daa8ac89e87">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f4eef63a-734e-4178-8f2f-b12840e69105">
      <Text>How do you feel?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="47296a5e-3815-44e2-a091-c6820cd8e2cd">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f351732e-3a31-47f8-b430-eb1b1c1156e6">
      <Text>Not as good as I look.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dcd4f5e9-8647-411e-930d-6367093e1ba9">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph holds up his beer. Ryan picks his up. His knuckles are red and mat burned as well.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b4bf88fe-fd88-4a38-bbce-a3f40e1cb7a7">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b167eb94-fc8e-434d-acde-727cfb5d8ecd">
      <Text>Cheers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="af356b74-bc92-4dca-8ba9-010e59440451">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="851fd2d5-4b98-4109-b374-886934c6c111">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Compai</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="94ae90f3-3b16-4e26-9c72-7e61a19cf10a">
      <Text>They drink...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="90acd14d-0c50-4ed8-b278-ba0b9f04e5d7">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1023f6f4-c399-4e65-8162-7d3f477ff37f">
      <Text>You fought well today.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c1abefc9-0d97-4046-aa61-bb8b0d263575">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="50adfa7f-3916-4e11-a18a-f89210235149">
      <Text>I will be paying for it for the next... decade? Maybe two.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ba291881-0a96-4d29-8c77-6cdf96740b6a">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="56d39c98-484e-41de-a4b3-9c8bd80965a2">
      <Text>The judoka from South Africa... </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Teboho</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ba19c135-dfa8-40ab-bc40-73565cf5a805">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="facf9bf6-acd7-47c2-910b-2dcf8d7118db">
      <Text>Strong kid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="093cce45-cb34-48d8-851d-504463dd74e4">
      <Text>Sensei nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="be6a4261-8137-4cd7-b5ff-32d2c0bc5e38">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1eb8c4a6-66d6-4a3d-a572-55aef0249095">
      <Text>He was the African representative in 60 kilos at the World Championships last year.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a18bcbf2-3de6-4fb4-ad5b-caf6608d3342">
      <Text>Ryan lets that sink in for a moment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cf9ade02-f8b1-4f8b-9dbf-066568e43ef6">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="45bd2039-e4ba-4860-bf7d-00e4044d5a2c">
      <Text>He fought at the worlds?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1292b28f-e15e-49b8-942c-325523aac52f">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="09d9f6be-b2ca-482d-83bc-4214331ffe24">
      <Text>He won the first round and lost in the second. Ryan, he is the South African National Champion. He’s won the African Continental Games three times. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9065b3ff-22d9-45dc-b7b0-b413d951ac9e">
      <Text>Ryan downs the beer. He goes to pat himself on the back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="28da0152-ecc1-4d33-8f75-6cafa64122de">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="130ad2aa-d9eb-4e6d-b0da-c2aa62c1fb62">
      <Text>Ouch... that’s... wow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="79e5dc32-c40c-467c-a5ee-65ce9b4d70ba">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e1ab2e5c-273b-4ea5-b65a-b630ad3ac7f2">
      <Text>How would you like to compete for the national team.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="71818d1a-243b-495e-acd5-6d92816c8a78">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e9a170b3-eb16-4f8a-a5fa-9feb488599d3">
      <Text>I don’t... can I even do that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="575c4037-e582-4dfc-a9ab-079a83c70227">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aba24d97-34e1-4ea9-8d0b-af5e487e5f33">
      <Text>You’d have to get citizenship, but I think you can.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7e6e466b-aa0e-400b-a5d8-f42134f43e1c">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="460bccf6-04d2-4cfe-b745-303a699ff8ec">
      <Text>I’m flattered... But today was just a fluke.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="78a820a5-5f7e-4114-969d-3ce28df0b29b">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="943b7e6e-bdbc-448a-be00-0579a957331f">
      <Text>You should have made the Olympics in ‘92... now you can.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="939a9d66-70a5-433a-88dd-32e19e683ae1">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5a7c6cd7-8bf1-4265-bc13-b9eb0fc89b18">
      <Text>The Olympics? Get out of here. I can’t I’m way too --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="86c1662c-ed54-46a7-92ab-bf3010d0076d">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="55164bd1-fff7-4958-a69d-affa70a12097">
      <Text>I saw you beat the best in the continent today. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="9bd99a8d-eaf9-4a80-b841-1d6b5f8218e8">
      <Text>(a beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="55164bd1-fff7-4958-a69d-affa70a12097">
      <Text>Give it some thought.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b4a08889-d4de-411b-8f89-a27f6e9028d6">
      <Text>Ryan gives him a nod as Sensei Joseph moves to talk to Chantal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="70a13772-354d-4597-8be1-128e0efa56da">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="46" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. RyaN'S DUPLEX - BATHROOM - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="454e7008-4993-45ce-9ef5-8fa7010df207">
      <Text>Ryan sits in the tub filled with ice... He shivers with the cold. Sits back and covers his face with a washcloth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="04aeff69-c6d7-4082-9d45-2ba49e6bc4bd">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="46" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MEDIC">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI MARUYAMA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="YOUNG RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. OLYMPIC TRAINING CENTER - FLASHBACK - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2ba4532f-f517-4f2a-b2a0-3ea8bb59d6db">
      <Text>Ryan and his opponent falling, falling and the LOUD pop. Ryan SCREAMS and grabs his right knee rolling on the mat in agony.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d9ab7f1b-8886-4a19-952f-4ed863661393">
      <Text>A MEDIC rushes onto the mat... and SENSEI MARUYAMA, Ryan’s coach.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9397bbaa-a0d6-4a3e-86a0-6b8c48f5f240">
      <Text>Medic</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="62dc8e09-b8f2-425f-9395-6b161d0721d7">
      <Text>Just lie back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="93391a48-a188-4428-a3a8-03f985e802e3">
      <Text>Young Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9eac6ac2-5e50-4fe1-964e-427ada48077e">
      <Text>No....no... I was so close...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d97cd5cc-5609-47f4-aa49-16e00c7af938">
      <Text>Sensei maruyama</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1f49548b-4870-4e10-97af-433ea01bfad5">
      <Text>You’re going to be okay.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b01070e1-1f2d-4f3d-9011-f028db9c1e2a">
      <Text>Young Ryan throws his head back against the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ec067628-b5e8-4daa-88cd-fed7fd1b51fb">
      <Text>YOUNG RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1c4a3dd0-9c20-4838-81de-45de723ed586">
      <Text>I was so close...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6dbffec1-56bb-4754-9bdf-efe728cf29cd">
      <Text>Medic</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a5fd9621-9047-40ce-a40c-26776edba6f6">
      <Text>We’re going to get you off the mat so we can take a closer look at your knee.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fbaeb18e-a1b8-49db-a75a-f960c13188ec">
      <Text>The Medic and Sensei Maruyama each grab an arm... As they help Ryan up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Shot" id="30043231-e5ce-4fd7-b63a-d65a33f8e924">
      <Text>End of flashback</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2e579af7-6e26-419c-b82d-ee0a779537c5">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="47" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Ryan’s duplex - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7a030a31-0575-4a2a-96fd-ef069296f57a">
      <Text>Ryan pulls himself out of the tub and wraps a towel around his waist.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="fdaa3aae-864d-4b7a-8cfd-345936fa8ee8">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="47" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. BuJUMBURA JUDO DOJO - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3f80d395-83c1-4d60-99d7-8e6e727d9e42">
      <Text>Ryan waits outside the dojo. Sensei Joseph opens the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="92e3587e-3022-429b-b3cf-65b4e9f56adb">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fec41cc2-8bf4-4cfd-a52b-d640cdec64e4">
      <Text>What do I have to do?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="907f0324-30d3-4574-b39a-d268ed32ff59">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph smiles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="f0c6dc7b-0642-4b33-a430-22b8d283f030">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="47" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. burundi immigration building - establishing - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cf54fa0c-286e-4168-8547-3d9bfe22ca95">
      <Text>A large Government building.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ce208fe9-adcc-4989-9e89-befdb758827a">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="47" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Burundi iMmIGRATION BUILDING - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2f3ff11c-2744-483b-b23f-fb5045eb1cb4">
      <Text>Ryan fills out a document - it’s written in Kirundi, French, English...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c8f62d7b-c1e8-4ba1-a0dd-e398aac8ceb8">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph stands next to him, interpreting... Ryan fills out the DISTINGUISHED SERVICE EXEMPTION and writes:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e3d044ed-ce49-46a7-896d-da8c3247d867">
      <Text>“Judo competitor”. Ryan finishes the application and hands it to Sensei Joseph. Joseph walks over the CLERK behind the counter. He pushes the application over to the clerk. He lifts the page where Sensei Joseph has placed several large denomination bills. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="13304373-af9e-4c82-a0d0-074e1c70be14">
      <Text>The clerk beams at Joseph, and takes the application away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="6e667f23-efc5-40fc-aae2-5cd2e0729e28">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="48" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. bujumbura market - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="907779a2-6815-4c1d-9508-f2cc6f7979f1">
      <Text>Ryan rides his bike past the stalls and grocers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="d7fffc53-1e5d-49bf-8603-be70adc0863a">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="48" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ALL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. BuRUNDI TEA AND COFFEE COMPANY - CONFERENCE ROOM - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="42e80f30-89c1-4d40-9017-ce103198ff21">
      <Text>Ryan conducts class. Elvis, Jean Claude, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jeane</Text>
      <Text>, and Mama follow along...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0a73b2c4-050d-4efc-ae58-0f08b59f5ea1">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ef2d1c09-f3f6-465c-82f8-0214488e8680">
      <Text>I stand up!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cf01b56e-1bb0-4076-a4ef-bdb67eec7b8b">
      <Text>Elvis, Jean Claude, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jeane</Text>
      <Text>, and Mama all stand...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="878e0af4-00ed-4031-8ef0-64dbe69232d8">
      <Text>All</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fa983ef1-5efd-4568-a965-39a13c48a518">
      <Text>I stand up!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f9984455-04cb-4a5f-9d76-2bc3cc48d72c">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e6a65895-1494-4a9d-8578-26784917c1e6">
      <Text>I sit down!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="50cdf16d-43ab-42ff-8173-26f989a4dfbb">
      <Text>They all sit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="959fafee-6337-4e08-ae7f-85db2a346100">
      <Text>ALL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e7ed9199-cc90-45fa-a6d3-4529705bcb63">
      <Text>I sit down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="642fd1e2-0c67-4338-85d0-d7fd8a7bf363">
      <Text>Nella walks by. Ryan waves to her... she smiles in spite of herself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="0372c258-ce07-4e6a-8835-6503758f5c58">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="48" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANIEL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. BujumbURA JUDO DOJO - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dd6ef5e3-c2b3-4202-a694-1fbdbfa133c7">
      <Text>Everyone’s beat, the end of the workout. Ryan has his belt in his lap, resting against the wall as Daniel approaches. Daniel nudges Ryan with his foot.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="34370ee6-e979-41a1-9ba3-578573a79296">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="67ebea65-3b2a-4d53-bedf-efdedf90593b">
      <Text>Let’s go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="86dae490-f626-4f84-9454-c3d0f386982f">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d15a7770-bc44-4efe-b582-55794e7ba922">
      <Text>You got cleared?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="054c8052-9b3a-4c99-a722-75128fdb7f1c">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7db67e38-b82e-4db4-9b03-22e71368fb77">
      <Text>Come on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b015e68-19ec-43dd-8733-e829f207388d">
      <Text>Ryan takes a deep breath, gets slowly to his feet, tying his belt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="141e4fb6-de4b-4bcd-8bd8-268d5528f1f8">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b0b3ba35-e666-4421-9185-025e03868b79">
      <Text>Okay, but be gentle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2176ff1f-77e1-43d1-a226-1482216bed8e">
      <Text>Daniel doesn’t respond.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="100d75b9-4c03-4b5a-8930-5faa30c1fcb1">
      <Text>The bell DINGS starting the next round. Ryan bows respectfully, Daniel barely bobs his head. Ryan smiles, he can see this isn’t gonna be easy. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4fc2f9c3-0051-456d-9199-e5b84449cce9">
      <Text>Daniel fights for grips. Ryan let’s him grab the collar. Ryan enters a foot sweep, but Daniel keeps his footing... barely.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6883b936-7244-415d-808f-b46b56881ae0">
      <Text>They go back and forth. Each trying to knock the other to the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fb0b8372-66d0-4587-9bcf-a47f343da876">
      <Text>THE CLOCK winds down</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="426b5cf2-381a-4a4d-9764-3f03fc3f45a6">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="49" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANIEL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. BuJUMBURA JUDO DOJO -night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9b9b595a-74d1-461a-9c94-506d1dc47810">
      <Text>The BELL dings. Ending the round. Ryan and Daniel both suck wind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="66903aea-c205-4d2d-ac5d-803920f4a3a5">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a77f3a03-5b8a-4ba7-9f3a-bea525a9586a">
      <Text>Keep going.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7d5f8991-8270-473c-b892-0169132eb300">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="190f1ddf-0f95-4470-b9b8-3a65f38ded09">
      <Text>You want to --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cc07c2a0-8caf-432a-97c8-a132dc6d70d3">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aa37b8ae-baf4-4233-b688-6db8cdd15824">
      <Text>Yes. Ippon </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">shobun</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="04bcf18f-c7b0-49e9-b095-48d89720d22d">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="374e30a4-249f-4ce7-9f1d-e7b4d0a201bc">
      <Text>You’re on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f4402dc0-d7d4-4668-96ff-288a9e031fa3">
      <Text>He bows to Daniel and they go again... The wall clock is at 6:10 pm... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="fb454a0c-5464-4fbe-af4b-8bb940a988bf">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="49" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANIEL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. BuJUMBURA JUDO DOJO - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="34a67594-ebb3-4688-afbc-591e8f8ce32a">
      <Text>The Wall clock now reads 6:32 pm. Everyone else has stopped to watch this marathon. Daniel shows that he’s quicker, stronger, and has more stamina, but every throw he attempts fails to score.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8e39bdb3-62ce-467d-9b84-34ec46d6ae91">
      <Text>Daniel breaks Ryan’s grip and steps back... he reaches over Ryan’s back or a high-collar grip... Ryan grabs Daniel’s sleeve and enters his one handed </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">sode</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">tsuri</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">komi</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">goshi</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a46ecaf3-687f-48b0-8bcc-53e77e0c2292">
      <Text>Ryan launches Daniel into the air... Daniel lands on his side... a score...  not a full point, but a score.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1bf3b489-58f5-40a7-a9b3-a348cbce4e09">
      <Text>Daniel jumps up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ad7370df-b4b9-4632-9363-ab53aca41bf6">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37dcde01-fef5-49ec-84d0-91f4e7aaebe2">
      <Text>Okay... That’s good.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="03f34fd3-0477-46f7-863e-7484be3ab315">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fa09b4e2-4a10-4b83-88aa-ebe7e8cde666">
      <Text>That was not ippon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7929494c-742d-46d5-9703-1a666dc1a1b2">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="44b5e24f-fc18-46e7-ab15-f866602cd245">
      <Text>Close enough. I’m done.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8326d20e-2318-4371-bdd0-75191be6b5bb">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d68d89a6-9a30-4588-ac1a-baaabfd5a0d6">
      <Text>You’re quitting?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ac31d50a-87ea-47f3-9797-832c48975fe2">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b793fa7c-2893-4a40-82e1-25e7c051c5ab">
      <Text>Sure. I quit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="89c84b84-8ae4-4cad-be49-e6a0348ac2e9">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f4d2ed37-bd23-4988-a587-3e7fb69d29ee">
      <Text>Then I win.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fa00989b-dcb4-47e7-8971-1bbc5317c6e4">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="852a407a-6052-4bc8-aa6c-d32796c96f71">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="44d7a4db-a753-46fc-b15f-0c94c2b6174e">
      <Text>(in Kirundi)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d08cc477-06d7-440b-b58e-d0f7a68279f6">
      <Text>Where are your manners? Show respect or get out!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f942f1a5-23c2-417f-a969-aeb7fe8724e8">
      <Text>Daniel bows deeply. Ryan returns the bow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b43408d3-2ebc-499b-9e24-08e25eb7bd28">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="62551b61-7f80-4d68-a238-218b9e39ad02">
      <Text>Everyone line up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="592ceb81-5ed9-4baf-b732-b132d23abc8a">
      <Text>As Ryan heads to the line, Daniel stops him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2629b5ff-4f0f-494d-8dd9-ba4a610587e5">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3f5bc446-98e6-44f7-bb91-0a4be39d7087">
      <Text>Can we train again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e3921b05-d8f4-412c-80d8-a43e3fa2f7c6">
      <Text>Ryan smiles at Daniel.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9ff45e98-498e-465d-9e9c-d3bc8cc2a5c1">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="683f6a62-b4c3-482f-bb1c-4164d54062d1">
      <Text>Do you have a bike?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b0f0efba-86da-4e86-a88b-97656b825b64">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="50" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. BujumBURA STREET - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="86ee62d4-c33c-468f-b7ac-b0d7149cd74b">
      <Text>Ryan rides his bike, pushing as hard as he can. Riding behind him are Chantal and Daniel on older, beat up bikes... trying to keep up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f80b2b1c-2a34-4103-8cc1-5f90a447b731">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph follows in a 2005 Prius.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1edea028-ac32-4286-972f-57b6975f26b9">
      <Text>SenSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="fb9c0a96-3915-43b4-8ddd-3ed8054a899b">
      <Text>(Out the window)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4715b42d-0ce4-453b-b267-e014a0c1b990">
      <Text>Halfway!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b6d69dcc-18eb-465e-8b53-cab0608ad55f">
      <Text>Daniel pushes harder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ad1dadcc-470d-4935-a76b-7bf2d87f780e">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="51" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANIEL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Ryan’s dUPLEX - living room - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d6594f8e-291e-42d6-8868-806232fd9cd4">
      <Text>Ryan does pullups on a “doorway” chin bar. He struggles with... Sensei Joseph holds a stopwatch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a5e22a15-4bac-47ee-a2e9-8333daad880d">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8e87645d-0053-4b06-b1df-b7672cd65a3b">
      <Text>Three... F...f...f... four.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="72ba8c9f-550c-4de2-86bb-bf2fea177039">
      <Text>Daniel and Chantal are there doing sit-ups. Ryan drops to the ground and does ten pushups. Daniel grabs the chin up bar - </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c2dcae20-a319-4a73-968e-d0e49c671fe0">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a109c720-593a-46e7-a71b-55cbebbfe96e">
      <Text>Six... seven... eight...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c6972700-f57f-4ead-9d69-96817fa7d43c">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9b346cb7-21a2-4e3f-99b6-1d29047f1dcf">
      <Text>Show off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6d40b73d-419e-415c-90f3-5e8272a5db66">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="56c95170-60d0-49d8-9355-ac9d9148ebc5">
      <Text>Nine... ten...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a562569a-b8a3-4b05-a2af-c10c3a107748">
      <Text>Chantal does burpees as Ryan does sit-ups.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="79669ece-49a1-4053-afe6-2320fd0ddb09">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c59cbe02-80f1-4b72-afb2-ca944c25dabf">
      <Text>Time! Water.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="f9ecf00b-2403-4510-b3af-90366d2a28e1">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="51" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANIEL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. bujumbura JUDO DOJO - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f7692be2-0468-4bf1-9cd1-4490b1709bb8">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph shares a list of important tournaments with Chantal, Daniel, and Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4b0b5b00-8b64-4975-a4e7-b040d587f612">
      <Text>SenSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1b8fbb99-3874-4822-88cc-015d34c84e02">
      <Text>The Casablanca Open is the first big test for us this season. People from all over the world compete.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d3b8dcf2-12a8-4898-bb10-a818622208fa">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a62220f9-e2cf-4689-b405-61eabb8002f5">
      <Text>Six weeks?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e76b133d-7d12-482e-902e-293cd80818bf">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="54bf1869-ad2a-45c6-8744-931060a784af">
      <Text>Where is your weight?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3203f706-d2bd-4521-b8d0-f26b8deb7af1">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="73fb60f7-6b60-4628-b555-24f32229580f">
      <Text>I don’t know... maybe sixty-three kilos.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="066f29c0-734c-40f7-99ab-5f2505e64f51">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3fe74f29-71bf-47e8-b459-7d2c224752c6">
      <Text>You think you can fight at sixty?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="da07e92d-632a-47ad-bd5b-b63351683f58">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="24ca2316-3698-4ef9-b827-82b2bb241340">
      <Text>Seven pounds...? Yeah, why not?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7a5dc46f-8b6e-4001-af64-443920325396">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2987e7d6-49fc-42c4-b5da-fa8f4ca9d944">
      <Text>But I am fighting sixty...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4a81482f-2bf4-4b02-9bf1-ad37e3e331ce">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="18c65159-3cf6-459b-aa94-7543d09c81eb">
      <Text>Both things can be true.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="c025b7d8-a255-48a4-8d3a-e624fa795509">
      <Text>(to Chantal)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c6d05803-914f-48bc-a682-4737ee970562">
      <Text>And you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9016722a-e7ae-46fc-bdb9-b0f9d7d2753e">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="29252964-2e5d-4aa4-b3bd-0e0efd44a22d">
      <Text>I’m not telling you my weight in front of him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6822e992-6743-4652-a960-2fb2bf35ed88">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7fbed957-9539-4fd5-897e-fcead5e56cf1">
      <Text>Um, you do know I was there when you fought last month. I know what you weigh.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1d05be7f-423a-4953-9a0f-05dbb25afce0">
      <Text>CHANTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="a2414b8b-9fb4-4256-9de0-92de5691e876">
      <Text>(in Kirundi)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1c823572-c9c0-4735-981a-3c9e031b9131">
      <Text>Suck a lemon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a5ec1de7-a260-482d-90a4-8ed54fdc6032">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="d260887f-de45-4552-9838-3c96f792e75b">
      <Text>(in </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Kirunidi</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c640a957-4c40-4b93-88e4-d7efc6b49fe5">
      <Text>I know what that means.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5fbbf164-68ef-471b-bae4-cf150e15a4d8">
      <Text>Chantal playfully hits him on the shoulder and walks away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4cb7b68e-eaf1-442d-805e-bed75b56d67a">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="6817b50f-0860-4df5-8051-c19ac2dcebba">
      <Text>(a beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="75f6e8a7-d4d0-4f95-92e9-f94244663cfb">
      <Text>Ouch! Your sister hits like a girl... who’s been training with Mike Tyson...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="98313ad9-33fa-4834-9ee7-71bfc5768d37">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e15474b4-7a7d-44d8-8b05-4baa3aa1347b">
      <Text>Oh, I know.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="8e5b9184-dfa9-4088-818c-0de83b21ed2e">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="52" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Weight gym - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2c5e1c42-7459-4534-a7f2-ae02fbd51f23">
      <Text>Ryan, Daniel, and Chantal toss a thirty-pound medicine ball back and forth. They catch, throw it to the ground, pick it up and toss it back. Joseph has a stopwatch on them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d46668b5-4ced-45d4-bb39-4978c213c1fd">
      <Text>Sensei joseph</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a14b4f74-9582-40fd-a63f-dd797f956be2">
      <Text>Thirty seconds... push!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b4a361a1-ee83-4643-a7b9-793fb8ec963d">
      <Text>They toss the ball again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b147a34f-ebfb-43cb-b630-cd77963101d1">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="52" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. buJUMBURA JUDO DOJO - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="17809a05-2639-43c9-a4d6-1d827bb08714">
      <Text>Ryan moves around the mat with Daniel. Ryan controls Daniel’s sleeve. Daniel tries desperately to break the grip and in doing so hits Ryan in the eye... hard. Blood gushes from the cut.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="befcf8a6-ffc5-4424-9837-9e9a525f9fe4">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="96301b33-5241-4df9-9efd-5798a72d0550">
      <Text>(in Kirundi)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b0c8f3d9-eb80-4da7-9d0c-9fe223380990">
      <Text>What’s wrong with you? Get him some ice and paper towels. Go!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="076eec50-c50f-41c0-a24f-70b2af453c9d">
      <Text>Daniel runs off the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="54eed8b8-a8ff-438b-8978-c4c94876be17">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="53" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. BuJUMBURA JUDO DOJO - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6b1f8bb6-80f6-42df-a19c-d36ccf5a7d63">
      <Text>Ryan sits on the side of the mat with an icepack on his eye while the class continues. Sensei Joseph comes over. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="edd70c13-11bb-463d-8a5d-dfbdab726f97">
      <Text>He lifts the ice pack and examines the damage, the gently returns it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7511b0ff-4a53-4f3a-891c-4c330d244e4b">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f3661e36-7216-455a-a8e8-13d2bad8e1f0">
      <Text>How is it?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6343ffb0-bfd3-4af2-8152-4c34716a7ef3">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5667926c-6117-49a5-9445-c7199ac0b31a">
      <Text>I have seen worse. Not often... not recently... but I am fairly sure that at some point in the last fifty years, I have seen worse... or at least just as bad.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d82f603e-4b35-4b1b-bca7-4df774d277da">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="08a39f65-4099-4f56-969d-6b110562c3c8">
      <Text>Great.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="87427c34-6c1e-4417-a78f-c9e3307cd21d">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 4/8" Page="53" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. buRUNDI TEA AND COFFEE COMPANY - CONFERENCE ROOM - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7f8ded76-2624-4f61-a174-34a732b1308c">
      <Text>The class Elvis, Jean Claude, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jeane</Text>
      <Text>, and Mama pack up their papers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="84bc4ea9-daea-417c-905c-4f7794992f65">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2223940e-b775-4810-98b6-cf7e7ff19943">
      <Text>Two pages, double spaced. And be ready to read them aloud. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="90c9025f-f1ae-40d3-b524-95b8f9966489">
      <Text>The class says their “goodbyes” and shuffle out. Nella enters the conference room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e460462f-a3da-4614-9086-ce4584206a12">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="de27f45f-3696-4a76-990a-1753dea46ab3">
      <Text>Mister Cutler, I just wanted... Oh, my lord. What happened?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b5dc4217-2376-4764-9341-d39f98a363b9">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="3286b335-f9b2-443c-b6aa-8e3c7908ca2f">
      <Text>(his eye)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4d76ce32-888e-4dbe-99b6-8e223008125f">
      <Text>Oh, this? It’s nothing. I cut myself shaving.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="888da658-d37c-42e5-b55a-a12b26a06808">
      <Text>Nella is unamused.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1bf2663c-e436-422d-a9b8-c25e82d57241">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="243e9ded-f5e4-4cd9-a23e-44bb95099f3a">
      <Text>I have aggressively thick eyebrows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="82fcb722-b2cc-4b55-9e90-aea4cc150f8e">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e8f1622e-f1d9-433b-a3f5-2f3b98dd69a0">
      <Text>I don’t believe you, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Mr</Text>
      <Text> - </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="481525e8-de56-454b-967c-662a184fa1f8">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="39333e30-614b-47c5-96d4-4bb0fc6688fb">
      <Text>Nella, please. Call me Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9d1f040c-c633-415a-92ea-b2ec1d861449">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d0382f39-e7b9-4147-95a6-e179ce9560f4">
      <Text>I don’t believe you... Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2ecf9ebb-e1ce-48b4-9336-1ea7073e34c4">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eed02464-d255-452a-8b26-76da116166f2">
      <Text>Yes, you are wise and see right through my deception. I did it at judo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d263b230-92ff-41d3-8c38-da8b3a76e1ea">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f29b8f20-ccb0-472c-a4cf-c6e52e7bb729">
      <Text>Judo? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ca1afbe9-f8d7-446d-92cf-5cb50f4fb09c">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="11f7125b-9351-494c-9f84-a9d754bb0e0c">
      <Text>I think I mentioned that on my resume... I taught judo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8a69b8a9-6407-4f6d-9cce-08426f5eaf30">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca0d5c07-9d3e-42dc-b8e2-03d4c46a490f">
      <Text>You get a black eye from teaching?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9da9c313-2013-4f75-9ceb-c77b2b86d055">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="77ec3eb8-14a5-4b60-84eb-524a155ab753">
      <Text>Not if you do it right. I’m trying to compete for Burundi. In fact, I have a tournament next month and I was hoping I could take a couple of days off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="232aa1f8-47fb-4f22-b81e-8c38aaad9a06">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="baadd55c-e1e9-4954-b468-b8435da0befe">
      <Text>You will fight against others your weight... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b50df60e-6c64-4057-b118-91c9caea154c">
      <Text>Ryan nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9be85797-d148-4aa7-aa65-b53ac0a3d825">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="662f21bc-7a5c-4cbd-940b-d2c3d852a739">
      <Text>And age?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a1c43a1a-2954-4d9d-9737-6d4fe5ee9b24">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5b45487b-95dd-4a1b-9904-d9d1c4209e78">
      <Text>That is highly unlikely. But don’t worry, the African Judo union has insurance. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ed6cc710-eb51-4d3a-9297-46c8e59538af">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c0a121be-b738-4108-8561-7e327134b58b">
      <Text>Do they also cover funerals?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ec91265d-2ded-4915-947e-c2131f215837">
      <Text>Ryan smiles widely. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8278283f-d8cf-412b-9fdd-f9b48c9a86bf">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="87f71cef-9d25-4325-9c56-67ef9675d0e3">
      <Text>May I buy you a drink?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8456bfca-33fc-4b80-8add-8f1748078008">
      <Text>Nella eyes him suspiciously.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9c08c2f5-1a76-4663-9b55-99e451b7a1eb">
      <SceneProperties Length="2" Page="55" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. bar - RESTAURANT - BUJUMBURA - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a39b9925-1bd0-4220-9c95-72fbde20d9a1">
      <Text>Ryan and Nella sit at a table. A few of the other tables are occupied as well, but it’s quiet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ccab0806-3785-48a1-ba17-82e93974ce41">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="78d826ba-79cb-4311-9ff8-9b4eff050efc">
      <Text>You hurt your knee.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7c1b79b5-10f0-4740-a242-0f2552d95e83">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4c62b784-dee6-40ee-a206-ea50be19f1fa">
      <Text>Blew it out, as they say... And that was the end of my competitive career.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3874d94f-e504-44c1-8a3e-1be60a5991cf">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="53050d71-6c72-425b-a3b6-f8b8d9e15c01">
      <Text>Until you moved to Burundi...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="20488fa0-9eae-4af1-a420-7b7d9d046044">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="75557a1e-5701-46eb-99c2-5b6427139d6c">
      <Text>(nodding)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f1c30c63-94d5-47d7-a0e1-460be5784506">
      <Text>Until I moved to Burundi.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="09e5853f-ea45-46ba-86db-4b94cd0d83df">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37c90f27-b17d-41d7-a5b9-39fd86fad029">
      <Text>Aren’t you afraid of getting hurt again?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="16223693-654b-496c-b558-17f33d21bcab">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="65ef4d6a-8193-412a-b65a-5eac218ed41d">
      <Text>When you fear getting hurt that’s when you get hurt the worst.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="32cb9f36-a1c5-4044-85a6-61b067c0ad1b">
      <Text>Nella gently touches his swollen eye.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6b6aab09-8c23-4634-8dcd-1284348a9d6e">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8888da5f-2a2f-4471-92f8-a738e45c1d51">
      <Text>And other times...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="059cc674-b389-4c86-b727-f7b9df71b0ad">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="19dd3492-164f-4ea4-bd23-8b4eed1ec55f">
      <Text>Other times you get hurt anyway. But I think that’s life, isn’t it?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d3187b40-b6d7-489d-b6b3-32788ce7a9de">
      <Text>Nella takes a sip of her drink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="33288f85-8782-43e2-98ed-90ace00365b0">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="740cfdbd-a2f9-442e-bfcf-786a0c6130d9">
      <Text>I don’t know much about you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ddbf3aec-8720-4cab-85eb-6fec8e763875">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c14161a4-1f89-4843-8365-6e7088418973">
      <Text>What do you want to know?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="27a0f52b-67e0-45c9-8dfa-131e8eef1ab1">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="10a21fea-d91c-4569-94f3-e70cb84bfec1">
      <Text>Are you married? Do you have kids?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="276742bd-0fea-4746-9874-c9de235b0fc4">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="61e61012-0177-47b8-aa33-223a4e571d27">
      <Text>I was. I do.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c13eeef9-e7e8-4351-9895-571480f1d5ee">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="860d3b23-400c-4d23-ac43-9ce150e43b95">
      <Text>Were?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8c2ea09e-a5c6-4f7e-9759-a6d2cf67b542">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fcfe81ba-89b3-4f98-8531-d256c814dcf0">
      <Text>My husband was... I think you call it a “player.” I knew that. I married him anyway. My children are grown. My daughter is a veterinarian in Kenya, and my son lives in the United States. He’s married to an American and works as a computer engineer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="68dd0fff-46a7-449e-b43f-a999088c383a">
      <Text>(a beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0b72a8cd-c4f9-4098-ab48-8fbeaa41ec34">
      <Text>And you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="65bab89b-e183-4346-9a80-5e3f0003dbb4">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="94751a02-9950-47ab-9f48-17ae01f617f1">
      <Text>I was married. I guess technically, I am still married. She sent me divorce papers... I just haven’t... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d0e8cf0f-ffa4-4eb6-8865-ab810df9d081">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="77d781fe-82d0-4bcd-9d32-6fd36a34b6a0">
      <Text>You still have hope?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="563f7c34-9b44-497a-adf6-d1d23275174b">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b891e933-e5eb-4acc-92c0-7a0b5b0b37c2">
      <Text>It ended a long time before it ended. I don’t think she knows I left the country or would care if she did.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2d97cd31-7790-4c78-92e8-ddac9b23a112">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fe901108-a2c3-4479-94b8-418fbe06191d">
      <Text>What did you do to her?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="57cf0129-227a-4cfc-925d-526bb839becd">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="131e0999-e997-4b23-9451-4a5778599edb">
      <Text>Excellent question... Well, I was self-absorbed, drinking too much... generally being a bastard. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9a5e9646-11e9-4481-a18f-1b9cace468d6">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4fcd84c0-2c2f-4d35-adac-f62cac3d0829">
      <Text>You sound like a real catch, Mr... Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a1a32afe-522b-4243-a414-87623f9ff9e7">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a678ce35-8455-4700-a235-6c87be6ebfea">
      <Text>Oh, I was... in the beginning. I don’t blame her, but then I caught her in bed with some guy and she couldn’t understand how </Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">I</Text>
      <Text> couldn’t understand that it was all my fault so she just... left...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5a2816bc-037b-4958-9326-30188572804c">
      <Text>Off Nella’s look of sympathy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="004e1a48-4de8-49bb-bef6-fda26f8e7abc">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="57" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Bujumbura streets - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="21d7c54c-0c1b-4924-abf3-016df2ddb8e5">
      <Text>Ryan walks Nella to her car. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="65bc4f19-4f0d-4550-a882-569818537dc4">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e43ff100-71ad-48b1-84f0-4e50d8f5c9a7">
      <Text>Thanks for the drink. It was an interesting evening.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="daaa9ede-fbbf-4e8f-8cf4-c225342cada4">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9f02bb3b-553c-4e64-88ae-094c648bbf05">
      <Text>I like talking to you, Nella. You should come to the next </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">shiai</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5add73d1-5b7b-420c-9142-8270ba47b144">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c3168f9b-7b57-4ad1-bd84-ab9905aa1b68">
      <Text>The... what?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3803c0b3-4f8a-495a-9e8d-a8dfa097b5f3">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eb94e13a-6a90-4067-a4b5-ad866893b201">
      <Text>Judo tournament.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e82e17f3-7bba-4c98-a70c-fc25a6b56937">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aa85b25a-a936-4dd6-af24-ccb2878b9460">
      <Text>I think I would like that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="30fe65fe-2bfc-46e5-8527-548a0a3bf79c">
      <Text>Nella gets in her car and drives away. Ryan goes to his bicycle and hops on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="337bc2cd-9950-4982-9ac7-756a575537cf">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 5/8" Page="57" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="AMERICAN COACH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="AMERICAN JUDOKA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ANNOUNCER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANIEL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. casablanca convention center - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1352daf0-f85d-440a-b385-69fda7e2892e">
      <Text>The floor is set with six mats. Chantal, Tiny, Donna, and Darci warm up. Ryan’s fingers and hand are taped. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="60647384-549c-42d9-aa96-2b4041dfe4b2">
      <Text>Nella and the class, Mama, Elvis, Jean Claude, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jeane</Text>
      <Text> take their seats in the stands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fc66e2a1-1b8b-4b28-91cd-7dd370327332">
      <Text>Ryan and Daniel do </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">uchi-komi</Text>
      <Text>. Entering throws, fast, hard. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b01a1796-af06-49b6-8d77-3e46a0254edf">
      <Text>Announcer (over p.a.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="714c1414-3c78-40ea-ac9c-c5f017714d41">
      <Text>Competitors, clear the mats.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bda8e986-9acc-4469-8e88-e9134c5859ae">
      <Text>Daniel smiles and releases Ryan’s hand. Ryan looks up and spots his class. He waves to them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3bf629ce-7cef-4ea0-ac9a-f0d10946ab67">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="20def874-c3ad-404a-b40d-4feda05ed14f">
      <Text>Don’t get killed today.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d1c270df-8ef9-4160-bcf8-36c6b7d708e9">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="90e10bc5-783a-431a-b0dc-4f92bebedcca">
      <Text>Solid advice, kid. Solid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="effbf97a-ae77-47bf-9a78-fd68abc6ae94">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph approaches with a match schedule.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b1cd3d05-550f-4f63-bdcc-4e6104a65b65">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="530550f4-6f72-4973-b875-c40093ec90ac">
      <Text>Listen up. Ryan, mat two, but you have a bye the first round. Daniel, you’re in the other pool.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="be242df8-cde7-41d5-9fcd-55c2c4e7cb3c">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="7dab5c45-6c41-4f91-a6ae-4a2630ce2242">
      <Text>(under)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3d9a5ad8-be13-4f52-aaa2-0e56581feec2">
      <Text>Good.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="709d8397-a478-4a27-8c2d-cfa1d3218b8d">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="8d0b7505-1971-4c50-a5bf-615716d30b1f">
      <Text>(in Kirundi)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bd7dfca1-a05f-433b-88cc-8fe310db5b83">
      <Text>Darci, Donna, mat 1. Darci you’re up match 12... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="611bc082-fddf-4004-9934-886c13fbea03">
      <Text>As Sensei Joseph continues to dole out information to the judokas, Ryan puts in earbuds and walks over to watch his competitors.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="85a6434e-fc3b-4e72-80a9-81783192ccf5">
      <Text>The theme from “ROCKY” plays through his headphones. His go to “pump” music.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b4bf79e7-2caf-4c5c-bc49-1c104745686a">
      <Text>Ryan watches a 60 kg FRENCH JUDOKA get on the mat with an EGYPTIAN JUDOKA. They bow. They glide across the mat with each other... awesome speed. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3830b924-1570-45e3-b5db-2f1546048d01">
      <Text>The French Judoka blocks a forward throw and reverses it for Ippon! Ending the match. The REFEREE awards the win to the French Judoka. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="824a1d2f-cd8d-4de0-8234-9ed4fb20bc96">
      <Text>A young AMERICAN JUDOKA - CHRISTOPHER CHANG stands on deck, the AMERICAN COACH/his father passes by Ryan and does a double take.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="374ab883-c5f1-4004-a4ce-8353e5b226e4">
      <Text>American coach</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="bec3e5ae-b326-47e7-923c-3569442619be">
      <Text>(to his son; re: Ryan)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="15e40c8d-e981-45e4-95c5-5a46db0dfb57">
      <Text>I think... yeah, damn, I used to fight that guy. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2f0f4d59-2de5-4b5b-9908-cff787525f41">
      <Text>Jang glances over at Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dfd57e6b-7a2c-4af4-b3bd-c268cab0a3e9">
      <Text>American judoka</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="41e8f84b-eb7b-4a83-a3da-c12f7559c5f1">
      <Text>What’s he doing here?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="311bf20c-4490-4550-92f5-cb3050cbe8d0">
      <Text>The Coach shrugs. The American Judoka bows onto the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3a5fa2b0-4327-4fd7-ac63-ce5417d8004e">
      <Text>The Referee bows them in and his match against the South African competitor begins. The American Judoka is lightning fast, and he dives under the SA competitor - boom... that quickly it’s over - Ippon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="67603878-b19c-429a-89cd-5c0444ef691e">
      <Text>Ryan jumps a bit as Sensei Joseph taps him on the shoulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="01411e72-7ce2-4419-8658-2bca66041f26">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a0dd1219-3670-4ac6-82f8-abfc43e78368">
      <Text>You’re well? You need water?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="da3bd8d3-aaf5-4beb-8334-67aebb735d88">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c8614942-ced6-4aa8-8d34-cfb45e6aabe7">
      <Text>They’re so fast... I mean, jeez, like how are they </Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">so</Text>
      <Text> fast? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3272dc91-7b1b-475c-a490-5da0fb0bbb33">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="568cac27-2e3b-47bd-9897-71e2a04d2214">
      <Text>All you need to do is your best.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e78108dd-1c24-440e-bb08-bf5391ab2551">
      <Text>Ryan nods, lost in thought.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="e17690f0-327f-45b9-9228-0b240f703309">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="59" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="REFEREE #5">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Casablanca CONVENTION CENTER - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a101da86-e26e-4462-a3cf-b1bf3c1da917">
      <Text>Ryan fights an ANGOLAN JUDOKA. The match has been going for three minutes. Ryan and his opponent both pour sweat. The scoreboard shows Ryan behind by two “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">yukos</Text>
      <Text>”. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cc53135e-3a45-405a-ac85-620d3658a92e">
      <Text>Ryan attempts stomach wheel throw (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">tomoe</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">nage</Text>
      <Text>), a sacrifice throw. The Angolan stuffs him. Ryan sneaks his other foot onto the Angolan’s waist and lifts him with both feet into the air.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4fb82ad0-04a4-4994-99ce-6e24157f4697">
      <Text>The Angolan twists, trying to land on his stomach and avoid a score. In doing so, he leaves his arm out. Ryan entangles the arm with his leg and enters an armbar (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">juji-gatame</Text>
      <Text>).</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9ebcc7fa-a89d-40c6-a4ca-af8348c0af18">
      <Text>The Angolan struggles, but Ryan has the arm straight and locked out. The Angolan doesn’t tap out. Ryan applies more pressure. There’s a LOUD SNAPPING SOUND as the Angolan’s elbow dislocates. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3ff78ff9-7b04-4475-a4ec-073c0729cba7">
      <Text>The Angolan lets out a SCREAM of pain and taps the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="87a558fd-1253-44c1-99a9-73e031d7e139">
      <Text>Referee #5</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="74a9948b-6ff0-4520-9cfb-1dc7212f502d">
      <Text>Ippon!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cc42c1dd-3c21-432c-b566-f57809212dc3">
      <Text>Ryan gets up. The Angolan doesn’t. He lies on the ground writhing in pain. Medics rush onto the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="592791be-48f3-46b1-87d6-c9ffee604fed">
      <Text>Ryan looks heartsick. He glances over to Sensei Joseph who motions that it’s “alright”. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="da0ba9fc-cf6a-484a-9bec-166034cfc7a5">
      <Text>As the medics attend to the Angolan, Ryan is awarded the win by the Referee.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cc8a7389-2636-4b3a-92ac-c78c37d6d1e8">
      <Text>Ryan walks over to Sensei Joseph. Joseph hands him a bottle of water.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ac52dc4f-d913-4287-8a19-9eb91564d9fd">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eabaef70-a2e3-43a7-92d2-a385b860d992">
      <Text>He didn’t tap.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a0e7a948-4cf5-4048-bb13-1b824ceb9080">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6e6e61c4-fb52-45b1-ba61-046c5cdc4757">
      <Text>That is on him. You gave him the chance. Focus on the next match.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fe7293b5-a237-486a-9909-de227d7de5ba">
      <Text>Ryan nods. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="a68be934-35df-4b03-a850-1539b9b0aee1">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="59" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. CasaBLANCA CONVENTION CENTER - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ca186ca0-2d1f-4c89-92e6-a6059c40d6ca">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="60" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>1) tiny wins his first match</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="c37c723e-4511-4c04-997e-fc910cc40452">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="60" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>2) dARCI LOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b9b98f50-59f1-4a03-ad76-f4149a726313">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="60" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>3) Daniel wins with </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">uchi</Text>
      <Text>-mata - his head just clearing the mat</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b3b90e38-e5ac-436f-a925-2905e7bf0fea">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="60" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>4) CHANTAL WINS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="bdc21c43-6eb9-45e1-9819-e0e367adc4a0">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="60" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>5) DONNA LOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="3d13424a-8a73-4227-a4b1-b24f1d41bd3f">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 4/8" Page="60" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANIEL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="KENYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="REFEREE 6">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. CASABLANCA CONVENTION CENTER - DAY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5d2448d9-1d63-4fbd-b507-38a3d4ecef66">
      <Text>Ryan is on the mat again. This time against a KENYAN COMPETITOR. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f793802f-ba8e-43c6-aaea-0f70930fb61b">
      <Text>Two minutes into the match. Tied score. Ryan fakes a forward throw and enters an major inner reaping leg throw (o-</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">uchi</Text>
      <Text>-gari). The Kenyan turns to his stomach at the last second. No score. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4025282a-eecf-4e92-b15a-4724dddc6b55">
      <Text>They roll in ground work for a moment before -</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eac39ae8-6dfa-49b1-a3d4-4cf3af74e51a">
      <Text>Referee 6</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="36bb64f4-31e4-48e2-8fe8-96c96332d382">
      <Text>Matte! (Wait!)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="922ac299-4808-4e2f-b32e-71b20a33b6aa">
      <Text>They stop and get to their feet. Ryan’s a little slow getting up. He gets to his feet and the referee penalizes him for delaying the match.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="623698ee-3082-47d4-a6d4-c0dd37bb2b33">
      <Text>Referee 6</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="eab08d4a-4b41-4408-8076-cb50faf47baf">
      <Text>(pointing at Ryan)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0504b28f-1f5d-4b57-ac1c-e78e380f8a4a">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Shido</Text>
      <Text>! (Warning!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="267d30e2-e02d-4197-afd1-99cd8fe0e908">
      <Text>Ryan bows to the referee. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ef7593d6-02ca-44e9-87a6-bd4cf621d4bb">
      <Text>REFEREE 6</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8f529541-b401-4f81-bb4a-5a775ed385b3">
      <Text>Hajime.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="abef845a-10b8-4068-9a4a-9cc300d8e35c">
      <Text>Ryan and the Kenyan meet in the middle of the mat. The Kenya enters a deep inner thigh through (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">uchimata</Text>
      <Text>), but Ryan sidesteps the throw and sends the Kenyan flying.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5bb28dc4-6f74-42c6-9cb5-ab1b81a72957">
      <Text>REFEREE 6</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="18e2bc7f-0a4f-4fce-afff-ec81cfcedf9f">
      <Text>Ippon! Sore made...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6cf92b29-e7e4-4e02-a08e-285e21efebdd">
      <Text>Ryan clenches his fist. The Kenyan shakes his head as the Referee awards Ryan the match.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="53340c49-abc3-4ccf-81d6-6d2246c6806e">
      <Text>Ryan goes to shake the Kenyan’s hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b468d61b-af10-41c3-86c5-184077be0119">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8d8bb622-10cc-4e2a-9219-a40b187da148">
      <Text>Good match.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b44c923a-fc00-40e4-ae7d-fe17f1d04072">
      <Text>Kenyan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="25419f1f-0601-4300-9752-70208cf26dc4">
      <Text>(smiling)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="52781c13-624f-479e-a097-8cbd219f47d8">
      <Text>I have to call my mother and say I got my ass kicked by an old man...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a6b470f3-aea8-46cc-b246-1e68e0f92a90">
      <Text>The Kenyan shakes his head, and bows off the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f5efaae8-3e1e-438f-bc8b-0b52419b484d">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph greets Ryan and Daniel.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aaba0eb2-6fbc-4a98-aad1-f7a6513b3d2d">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ecdc4ac3-3f7d-442d-8f16-2d1ed72f25af">
      <Text>You’re both in the quarter finals! If you win your next matches you will fight for third at the very least!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dcd6e485-5419-433d-b8c6-82345f6947a5">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="655079dd-4f00-4008-9711-a928a33ee94a">
      <Text>Not bad for an old man.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5ce8faa9-2cc6-4185-8ade-7060f8b56fcc">
      <Text>daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dc198ef9-5ac2-4c10-9f5c-ac8c474fbcf0">
      <Text>Not bad for any man.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="535286d2-345e-4987-9a8e-15c71f767e38">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f561e7e8-c4ed-4971-88d2-b3f47d7f9dd6">
      <Text>Do you know who I fight?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="419ce50b-9510-4bdb-8b72-24b462855d85">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cbba80ad-87d7-47b6-88f0-23b93adf4063">
      <Text>It doesn’t matter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d4389b6a-69e1-4881-93a7-ebda85097401">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4abcfa99-9517-44e1-9e30-1ef52838fb30">
      <Text>The Frenchman?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0c544924-1a70-4d6d-a8ce-79ff937903bf">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b415acfa-5aa0-45cc-9113-1cbfb713f115">
      <Text>He’s got two arms, two legs... he’s just a man.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="69437d3a-f7df-45e7-93a9-197c2453a75a">
      <Text>Ryan smiles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="0a6539b9-cd4e-4de4-9e6c-79cc3fe26fb4">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 3/8" Page="61" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ANNOUNCER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="EUROPEAN REFEREE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JEAN-MARC">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MAT OFFICIAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. CaSABLANCA CONVENTION CENTER - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cae4ba50-0397-4556-aa51-84ca1d8e0a70">
      <Text>Ryan, wearing a white </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text>, warms up on the sidelines. Across from his the FRENCH COMPETITOR (JEAN-MARC) stretches. Jean-Marc, mid-20s, carved out of stone, cauliflower ears, make him look tough </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">AF</Text>
      <Text>. He seems relaxed. The EUROPEAN REFEREE invites them onto mat as the coaches, Sensei Joseph and the FRENCH COACH bow to each other and sit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f531689a-73e3-4314-8310-27618dbba30d">
      <Text>Jean-Marc and Ryan bow to each other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1b9f7adc-4430-418c-929e-5debdd42c0da">
      <Text>European referee</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="12871280-b3ff-413e-b3ea-5ae70a867ffa">
      <Text>Hajime!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ed9cd5f9-b27a-49fe-be5f-88216355a26a">
      <Text>The French Judoka comes forward, cocky. Ryan grabs him, fakes forward and hits him with minor inner leg reaping throw (ko-</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">uchi</Text>
      <Text>-gari). The Frenchman, taken by surprise falls onto his butt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d07e978e-5e65-4b8d-ac87-fd6be855b79a">
      <Text>EurOPEAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3173c9b2-da0b-47ef-a022-190774c87606">
      <Text>Yuko!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5c624cf3-3338-4d18-8ebd-f5a3c8010b5d">
      <Text>Ryan jumps onto the French Judoka, working for a choke, then an armbar, but there’s nothing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="77b73787-8dea-4fe1-b92a-16e2613e21b4">
      <Text>EUROPEAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1481228b-ca7c-448e-92a4-c6ba7e2314a6">
      <Text>Matte!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ed01155e-8828-49b1-b491-4574e342e914">
      <Text>The Referee stands them both up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2b1fd759-5802-4912-b87f-d6277f76c780">
      <Text>EUROPEAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="35263099-eb17-46d3-929c-6ca4bc0d434c">
      <Text>Hajime!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dd4ffbf3-0de0-4963-8b18-0af4d7fb6a3d">
      <Text>The cockiness gone, the Frenchman looks dead serious. Ryan grabs him, and Jean-Marc immediately breaks the grip. Ryan enters </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Uchimata</Text>
      <Text> (inner thigh throw) Jean-Mar stops the attack and lifts him in a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ura</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Nage</Text>
      <Text> throwing him backwards. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2d79b372-592d-4ef2-8f7a-a37623984f4b">
      <Text>Ryan has the wind knocked out of him as he’s slammed to the mat, flat on his back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="affe98d8-8d12-4f48-a4dd-f95ea14b6542">
      <Text>EUROPEAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c88841d2-6b2a-4d51-b81c-676219520b83">
      <Text>Ippon! Sore made.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d8d6e35b-6031-4b80-bd0a-e01eccf799df">
      <Text>Ryan slowly gets a breath and makes it to his feet. The referee awards the win to Jean-Marc. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e860971f-73be-4266-b39e-36f791028d9c">
      <Text>Jean-Marc shakes Ryan’s hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ec42f83b-556f-4b5d-a745-c3f330f18b39">
      <Text>Jean-marc</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="a900a8f9-e0cd-45c7-947e-d5c22a38b1c1">
      <Text>(in French)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="68faeaa2-1ee0-4f72-83ae-6967a9544b61">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Salopard</Text>
      <Text> dur!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f6c7f8a1-58a4-4920-846f-a4491ec894cf">
      <Text>Ryan hobbles off the mat. He glances up into the stands where his students and Nella sit. Nella looks concerned.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="589adb4e-e717-4975-88a3-5f8a4eead611">
      <Text>Ryan turns his attention to the mats just in time to see...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9b0b022c-42d3-4b15-8c09-d3ecaaaea229">
      <Text>Chantal fighting a girl from GREAT BRITAIN.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8e16ad65-a2fe-4d94-b4b3-d6690d76c070">
      <Text>The SCOREBOARD has Chantal ahead by a half-point (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">wazari</Text>
      <Text>) with five seconds left. Sensei Joseph sits fidgeting in the coaching chair. Time ends and Chantal is awarded the win by the Referee.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bf01d2cf-3fe9-4588-b8db-c540c844efd7">
      <Text>Chantal comes off the mat and leaps into Sensei Joseph’s arms.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="35a29a7c-6b26-42ae-b657-4b2c7a0bf5aa">
      <Text>Ryan walks over to them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c39fcb3e-e95c-43e7-aac4-1f1d09fc115a">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4319d703-bd63-463b-a93a-7b560dfe2113">
      <Text>She won the Bronze!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fd40be7a-bf0c-4cef-b69a-b42c5a8b12bb">
      <Text>Ryan high fives Chantal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d97d3f5a-cc72-4466-8ec3-a30d95172b36">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="213333d4-02fa-4bba-8b43-29316297250f">
      <Text>And you! You scored on Jean-Marc...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f284329c-75c2-4ade-8c98-24f88edbbc32">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="527664ae-0bb3-4ae5-b7dd-c63b672ba0b2">
      <Text>Yes, right before he picked me up like a rag doll... I scored on him. In hindsight, that might have been a mistake.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="df3bf6d5-22d6-408a-9500-c565a5697f14">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="63a8aacc-edb4-438a-aea3-d8951a26856c">
      <Text>He’s number one in Europe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8d76e75a-dee1-4903-993d-4e05aa8348c4">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="81913a43-2a03-44c0-b673-2cd55b7a1997">
      <Text>He’s ranked eighth in the world.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c673291f-8f55-4ed9-9f2f-8021281b4a17">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="db79a0a0-cacc-471a-bdf2-b997d13cff7d">
      <Text>In what world? Our world?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="055adfe1-2e15-4ee3-9125-1dcc4515ac24">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f3025f8e-f1cc-4a7f-a43c-a973aa440803">
      <Text>You, Ryan, are my hero...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4dd1df74-fded-4b17-8ce8-343426ce449e">
      <Text>Announcer</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="84d4e85d-1227-450c-9457-98c28f16b66c">
      <Text>(over the PA system)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6c2f004e-0851-4d75-b868-2b959fe71d32">
      <Text>Ryan Cutler report to mat number two.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="923810e6-f285-4c56-aa34-6b0e2e4f0ce3">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bb54dada-ed4a-42a3-aa1a-f63380162039">
      <Text>The repechage. Are you ready?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2e41ef92-4915-496c-9575-e81c57ef9a85">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="79c95102-c904-49d3-804d-49cc73f1d039">
      <Text>Nope.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="faae64df-1daa-4f86-ad61-383688079c35">
      <Text>Ryan jogs over to the mat... a MAT OFFICIAL looks at him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bc011e49-0f58-4f20-8c18-a1bd213356ca">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="48945725-5777-4fff-8780-02a701b72d2c">
      <Text>I’m here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="11ac6fcb-beea-4a15-8e9f-4ae94759b738">
      <Text>Mat official</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="90c34fcf-2d9e-499c-b6b1-9bc7a91a8892">
      <Text>Blue.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="94a74967-94c0-4b58-a89e-6178e5e2269f">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="65474f34-5478-409d-8d3a-8c9ab6e8df26">
      <Text>(confused)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f7efd42b-a274-4dc1-a530-c84c003eec8d">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bca1b0c3-c619-4cbf-9f33-b25d454654ad">
      <Text>MAT OFFICIAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ee90d124-5c9c-4f47-85de-3856e994d223">
      <Text>You have thirty-seconds to change to blue. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f3534575-5760-4717-9a13-49f4bd9b3925">
      <Text>Ryan rushes to the bleachers and quickly locates his bag. He grabs his blue judo </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> and sprints off to the men’s room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="4ad025ed-948d-4235-9955-ea93363c7614">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 4/8" Page="64" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ANOTHER EUROPEAN REFEREE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANG">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANIEL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="EUROPEAN REFEREE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Casablanca convention center men’s room - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="34420529-01e6-41b5-ac37-41dd3d2e094b">
      <Text>Ryan strips off his </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> and jumps into his blue </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text>. He runs back into the convention center main floor tying his belt as he goes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="52b526dd-3664-4b2c-8820-6b1612ba7a84">
      <Text>He gets the mat and see his opponent in white </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> waiting impatiently. He’s an American judoka - CHRISTOPHER CHANG. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="80a18ac6-a3c6-4895-be25-a3afb99ea5e1">
      <Text>Chang’s COACH nods to Ryan before bowing to Sensei Joseph. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="36536e6d-be76-468d-9aef-efb8c3995efa">
      <Text>Ryan and Jang enter the contest area and bow to each other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e2d86823-98e4-47e5-bed2-0c49054cadc2">
      <Text>Another european referee</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b19c0ceb-b31c-486a-9e04-474a9fe242f8">
      <Text>Hajime.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2298b5d0-b0c7-4274-a0f1-5f5bea800e0a">
      <Text>Ryan and Chang circle each other. Jang gets his grip and drops under Ryan. Ryan twists landing on his belly. Jang drives with both feet trying for force the score.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9b90fa47-1259-414a-a60f-b39a7cd2628b">
      <Text>Ryan has a mat burn across the right side of his face. Jang takes Ryan’s back and presses his fist under Ryan’s jaw. Ryan pulls his chin down tight - the pain clearly etched on his face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4b77ebae-016d-4c79-ad5d-ceee6a4b2ca2">
      <Text>Another EUROPEAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e067415d-ce2d-4f91-b634-705fa2bf56e1">
      <Text>Matte!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0e5ac57e-823a-4d08-8e63-f30f99412656">
      <Text>Chang gets up. Ryan does as well, but </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">sloooowly</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3dd547ff-21c2-4e33-bf76-3570783ff00f">
      <Text>ANOTHER EUROPEAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c8a752d9-9e4a-4ee6-a969-1ccd71011a6b">
      <Text>Hajime. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5e9e3054-636a-46c0-90f5-3ea8b47f1002">
      <Text>Ryan moves with Jang as they fight for grips. Ryan gets a hand or Jang’s collar, and Jang jumps into a knee drop throw (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">morote</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">seionage</Text>
      <Text>). Ryan goes over, falling on his side.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8ca2b38c-3c13-4391-b5ed-34a865d149a7">
      <Text>ANOTHER EUROPEAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a81f1bee-2e10-443b-9a41-515c22cc943e">
      <Text>Yuko!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7cf0f729-0f57-4af0-9c46-3012e44b699a">
      <Text>Jang rolls Ryan onto his back and secures a pin.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a1742ad2-5692-4497-91b2-f48634c4a33b">
      <Text>ANOTHER EUROPEAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="03039661-9d3f-456f-8ee0-4193a879de00">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Osaekomi</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="33420a8e-3f52-4963-957d-2e8aa7ed97ef">
      <Text>A sub-clock appears on the scoreboard. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Shot" id="17e994e3-5c20-4a7a-bcf7-44052c75b0a6">
      <Text>Ryan’s pov</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c29034d2-282f-46df-902f-7a53f24eed4b">
      <Text>The room slowly spins, the ROAR of the crowd dissipates. Ryan vision clears, sound returns. He struggles against the pin.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b597ea45-e47f-45b5-99a0-382ab0f30a6c">
      <Text>The clock passes 10 seconds and a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">wazari</Text>
      <Text> goes up on the scoreboard.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b2c1e67-c66b-4cea-9f66-36f0a0f87c1b">
      <Text>Ryan twists, pulling his arm into his side as he attempts to bridge and roll...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0e656863-8885-433d-aafc-b9707327bd40">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">BUZZZZZZ</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fbad7d24-4fb9-4225-979e-950144e731c6">
      <Text>The timer goes off. The referee raises his arm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e20bb584-b80c-4c0e-a8fe-6ac302f0e28e">
      <Text>ANOTHER EUROPEAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="97ac83ae-0ab8-42d4-b9f7-8eeae95123ce">
      <Text>Ippon. Sore made!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7a1bfa56-b529-4ece-81f1-5cb368941bc9">
      <Text>Chang jumps up, he’s pumped. Ryan’s a little wobbly as he gets to his feet. The referee instructs them to straighten their </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gis</Text>
      <Text> and awards the win to Chang. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="29a6919a-e5a2-42ed-a2df-79d312b11724">
      <Text>Jang rushes over and bows to Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="621f5d0b-9d74-444e-8781-093a4b62194b">
      <Text>Chang</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0a3950f1-ae6b-474e-91b8-b63815bab81c">
      <Text>Are you okay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d2df86b8-ad86-4eb1-930d-93aaafa12bc3">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="366b2061-5506-4ec4-98bb-be2b4fa332e7">
      <Text>What’s left of me? Fine. Good fight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3bed90d7-b18e-47f5-901c-a1c564f31421">
      <Text>Chang</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a3e59529-ba90-4e07-9123-3c4696b45608">
      <Text>You too...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f9b48bf1-aeb5-4c79-8c61-274a9d54620f">
      <Text>They shake hands and walk off the mat. Sensei Joseph rushes up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f4247c88-38a8-46be-9b66-77318b802279">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8861aee2-2444-4edb-af51-02345039758b">
      <Text>You fought well today. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3248e83a-e403-47c4-99a8-88bfc7f69092">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3247c675-f56d-4580-850d-6ba74f0b0a3f">
      <Text>Well, I fought.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8d0dcdbd-2e4c-443d-aad1-e7ab2125d877">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cf99d77c-20c3-4ef6-865f-7c168245a4a3">
      <Text>You finished fifth. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="def6057a-a0fd-4a2c-9db1-5b1c64b6e56f">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2e02ecfb-7801-440b-9988-d8a9115ca3c6">
      <Text>So, I get a pat on the pack and some Advil?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="83d180f2-b449-419f-84c8-03734992133a">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c8dd858e-c7b2-4ba1-957c-fdf55f400730">
      <Text>You get </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">IJF</Text>
      <Text> points. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8aaf35ef-01b7-4ea5-a9a9-9efcc09de11b">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="58a0cf65-ea4b-44e0-b2e2-2b12d06c4312">
      <Text>So, what does --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b46b2f12-36ee-4bea-aab3-c21bed9ffea5">
      <Text>Daniel jogs over to Sensei Joseph.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8132515d-1dae-4394-b586-e1b3288c1337">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fcf26677-ad25-4803-9a86-6196ad157be7">
      <Text>I am fighting the Algerian.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6a27b266-5a3e-47dc-bc6b-063cbf817db6">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8450122d-ed8f-46c9-b99f-530d4fde0cd7">
      <Text>You got this. He’s a lefty and he likes to do </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ouchi</Text>
      <Text>-gari from the belt. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="85723815-f12d-4797-bfae-81e1c8315523">
      <Text>Daniel nods. The European Referee invites the ALGERIAN and Daniel onto the mat. The two competitors bow to each other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d2ac43cf-184e-486b-811a-87c13e83cf22">
      <Text>EurOPEAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fcc0ee25-f7ef-412c-9945-43efa698d655">
      <Text>Hajime!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="93bdd27b-cc72-42c8-b49e-c87a12904169">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b36d8d09-87db-4720-a406-bd60bd56f9a8">
      <Text>Let’s go, Daniel!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d0fecc27-2ecb-4ca2-abdd-d07736bc0271">
      <Text>Daniel circles. The Algerian reaches for Daniel’s belt and Daniel steps into him... entering a slick inner thigh throw (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">uchi-mata</Text>
      <Text>...) His head just missing the mat as he tosses the Algerian onto his back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4a750e85-b213-4575-90a3-750a609da9bd">
      <Text>EUROPEAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7792f2fd-38ee-4c5a-b35c-ca0f43ce3ab3">
      <Text>Ippon! Sore made!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d9fa03d1-49ab-4e1c-b8cc-10203feb196e">
      <Text>Daniel, Chantal, Sensei Joseph and Bujumbura team goes wild!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b54c9acf-e8c7-4918-b55a-9bfd56e84ceb">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="66" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Ryan’s DUPLEX - BATHROOM - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="29a1c513-b9ef-4eba-9cb0-860426c9ebbf">
      <Text>Ryan sits in a tub filled with ice. He dips a washcloth in the cold water and places it over his mat burned face. He leans back with a deep groan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="7491dfc9-aacb-4c7a-83d4-58b13318714e">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="66" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JEAN CLAUDE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JEANE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MAMA CIZA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. BURUNDI TEA AND COFFEE COMPANY - CONFERENCE ROOM - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="699244f7-0157-43d6-a57c-324e1dcf0d4e">
      <Text>Ryan stands at the white board. Mama, Eric, Jean Claude, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jeane</Text>
      <Text>, and Elvis take notes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c6a1a7a0-a16d-4c37-8251-ba0195a6acf4">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="605fd29e-02aa-4db0-ab55-0c09b63b30d2">
      <Text>(writing on the board)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d6281dd1-4d5e-4496-b79f-875a7fc659f2">
      <Text>So, functionally, the pronouns are He - Him - His. She - Her - Hers. They - them - theirs. Any questions?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7be82746-039f-4e18-b99d-2e53dec3f963">
      <Text>Mama raises her hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="27a8189c-dcb3-4614-8cd1-3ba0cd943541">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3e1717cf-6a34-42f7-88c4-dde1211a7fc3">
      <Text>Yes, Mama? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="61087dce-f133-465f-8959-3915ab7fca93">
      <Text>Mama </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">CIZA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="e001a218-476c-45a7-a08a-63d6367aa090">
      <Text>(pointing to his mat burn)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4bee8945-f3e6-48fe-89d3-ceb1aa8004cb">
      <Text>Does that hurt?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d80cfbbf-3cf4-43de-b330-e7bda7a3234d">
      <Text>Nella comes to the door, arms crossed, watching Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ba3c9b34-4dc2-4554-8288-919a08856b92">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d0c37871-9c60-4ad6-949b-6ed166b2ee5c">
      <Text>Only when I laugh.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8b5b6db0-85ca-4352-92ed-25d8fb74fac1">
      <Text>JEAN CLAUDE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8d98500f-2a65-4c28-a14f-f5efb1019b8e">
      <Text>You were very impressive.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="065c17f5-eedb-45d2-90a2-8055f632c8e2">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jeane</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cfeb7732-0fae-4f01-a94c-d476d953c36d">
      <Text>You were fighting people so much young! </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3ce6fd71-03fd-420f-9fc4-5c1ef37b9422">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="082043e9-d876-4186-b2bd-72cbc5628a34">
      <Text>Younger, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jeane</Text>
      <Text>. So much younger.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d925c196-944a-438f-8a85-6324175c9180">
      <Text>Nella smirks, shaking her head. She walks away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5323461d-4a8e-4569-be1d-bec30a8329e8">
      <Text>Jean CLAUDE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4bf072cd-7b89-4203-be17-c4afd99657c2">
      <Text>You should be careful, Mr. Ryan. It is a demanding sport, no?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3f073e76-74a7-434b-9369-5d620ecd4392">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a4289409-4a4b-4b45-a762-9cab6d461313">
      <Text>Yes. Yes, it is... Okay. That’s it for today. Everyone’s writing a solicitation letter for next class. One page, proper business format. Any questions?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a3913c08-8607-42ab-b58c-c1f0764d1092">
      <Text>Mama raises her hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4141cf80-aaf4-43ae-aa9f-7d7416944a89">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4081f3bb-6056-4829-bd84-b21e824ec8b0">
      <Text>Yes, mama?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="13b037be-8ef9-45ce-9209-6111d1b9fa1f">
      <Text>Mama </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">CIZA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4398d203-a733-41e3-9e43-02be6d658821">
      <Text>I don’t think it’s safe for you, Mr. Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bd177af7-7b36-48a4-9f9c-01198fcfa99d">
      <Text>Ryan sighs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="800b3e70-3330-4531-a291-a5e6c91203e1">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="67" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. BuRUNDI TEA AND COFFEE COMPANY - evening</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0548cfdb-f40a-40fd-b0d5-0ba9e10a1219">
      <Text>Ryan waits by his bicycle as Nella exits the office.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f012f1f0-a2ce-40ce-adca-0d55af5a39d1">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="12cf3c79-fe87-4070-98c8-c84aaafd62a1">
      <Text>Why are you still here?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="342ab208-d8f9-4da6-a96e-18658fb9e511">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ff9588cd-9b96-4c5a-ba27-0ccf3234b0c1">
      <Text>I thought we could get a bite.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c922d82e-6d60-457c-9e6f-3740141d6ef7">
      <Text>Nella hesitates.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eaec03c5-0dcb-49c7-a8d7-07730cc248c9">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1acc81d0-e15e-418b-8d7c-2da32a73e3ec">
      <Text>You </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gotta</Text>
      <Text> eat, right?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5a75f723-5702-4736-a93f-5f9a9c3306e7">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e79056c4-86af-4275-9c8e-0beeffe286c9">
      <Text>Leave the bike. I’ll drive.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="62cfdec3-fda0-438d-813b-59a7956eb23f">
      <Text>Ryan leans the bike against the entrance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="6189dc9a-1bb8-4b22-ae4f-73843cdc22b8">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 4/8" Page="68" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. local restaurant - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e33a73d3-b48f-4d2d-920e-1761539f1305">
      <Text>Ryan sits across from Nella. Several traditional Burundi dishes are on the table. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2f7d6353-4293-4131-941b-9c1f48c253eb">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8c5a61fc-cce4-48da-b116-3ad38e9f2b8f">
      <Text>Here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6a930e28-072c-4a29-b8a5-a1795c82a832">
      <Text>Nella fills a spoon with stew and holds it out for Ryan. He eyes the food.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c2736922-5b2c-4446-af16-7b3564d25ae5">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="258844bc-b19b-4398-89fc-fbb1c079a70c">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Renga</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Renga</Text>
      <Text>. It’s a traditional dish of Burundi.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="165e8130-b47d-4d4e-925e-0b4ddfc7d195">
      <Text>Ryan takes a bit. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5c6a27dc-d16c-46f3-8f97-a4547b6346e7">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7dcb8dab-c800-4f2c-b75f-6698616a2248">
      <Text>Oh... that’s good. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9260dc6a-3e4f-4e69-b66d-d716814e3375">
      <Text>Nella smiles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="79215b75-c8da-420f-a154-649bb7d68ba4">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ee3d9642-7487-48a5-b9b9-521baf738f78">
      <Text>Can I ask you something?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7fe17dcf-2dd4-411b-926e-9c6070ca0465">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b7f6c326-eed2-4667-9ca5-4e2967aa7091">
      <Text>Of course.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a88e35f8-dd6a-4952-945d-ea7294a74f38">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3d6693c9-850a-4779-8c5d-c60dc9f6553a">
      <Text>Why do you do this to yourself?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d53595cf-58a3-414f-a997-545b7b1c26ac">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ed8b8997-3ebf-4a36-a5b9-180f77aed2ac">
      <Text>I ask myself the same question every day... And the truth is... I do it because I’m not ready to die.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fb7b94b4-7bf0-4324-bdb1-ead2f83a299c">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8112bbfc-0f41-430d-83ca-06e9b6bf5c25">
      <Text>What? What do you mean?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4fb7f4ab-1487-45d6-8f5b-9cf59fea0a8e">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="82ce583f-0ea2-4a4d-bb90-4f981b40159c">
      <Text>When I was a kid, I was pretty good, you know. I mean, I was in the top two or three in the US... And then... then when I got hurt...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e3ebc709-cb6d-4c3c-ada5-2a83904d2664">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="840ff72c-b34c-4e54-b12f-07f3a70caadb">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fe99f9cb-8d33-451a-bd98-825533f43991">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ac2a2136-9ea3-44bd-b2d5-fe5ff2b2bf55">
      <Text>The dream died, and a piece of me died with it... and that’s on me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a3347d58-9b98-4e1d-911f-0ead2a684997">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5ab64e26-1388-46c4-aac3-28741a6bb157">
      <Text>I don’t understand...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="22f0d2c0-9474-4145-8091-9a5e1d9d4d31">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="835844c6-084c-443e-82b6-1e9475220bd4">
      <Text>I probably shouldn’t be competing. I guess that’s the truth, but when I step on the mat, the part of me that died... that piece of me is alive again. At least for awhile.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c41b1a03-a275-47bc-8036-d7ae0a507848">
      <Text>Ryan pushes plantain around his plate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="babc9907-77cf-47bd-8d62-b4f7c00ebdcb">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2946f9cf-eebb-4663-a468-0a99fc4204fe">
      <Text>I can’t stop time. I know that. But when I am on the mat I slow it down... I slow it down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9e0849d7-8e28-4a81-95e6-4422334f003d">
      <Text>Nella touches his mat burn gently. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="08d77273-d123-47c6-ad64-092d673ddd91">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5132d025-3028-42e8-af7e-991a1413afcf">
      <Text>You’re not worried about getting hurt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9e0849d7-8e28-4a81-95e6-4422334f003d">
      <Text>He presses into her and smiles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e75d4a3b-510e-484c-be16-fb5e295dcab4">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1986ec81-60bd-4d96-a9ba-14aaf8f6750b">
      <Text>A little. Are you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="500a6e9d-dadb-4859-a6a1-bac4ac236a38">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="69" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>int. ryan’s DUPLEX - LIVING ROOM - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e9516045-f2eb-4cd1-8f0b-3b68a4f52fc0">
      <Text>Nella and Ryan stand close to each other in the middle of the living room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="561235b9-abd3-4659-a83e-ead437305273">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1c727bf4-1ad0-4c1d-b55d-b91ebc12cfe7">
      <Text>Would it be okay if I kiss you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4d362391-636e-4255-baa9-dccd96cbda54">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5a55f5b5-d579-4098-b80b-695ac6ce2b6d">
      <Text>You’re right to ask.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="adfdff8d-ea35-43d3-8a88-2ab694891582">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8549ebf8-2773-463e-ad28-ea9bf55a9e3f">
      <Text>I didn’t want to assume --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="47791267-610b-4eab-ba09-726b1024e064">
      <Text>Nella kisses him and they passionately embrace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="a293410d-0313-4ca4-bb15-5eddba3875ff">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="70" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANIEL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. BUJUMBURA JUDO DOJO - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="33bbf824-26e0-4b10-8153-2a742edb5b56">
      <Text>Ryan, Daniel, and Chantal alone in the dojo, taking turns throwing each other in a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Nage</Text>
      <Text> Komi drill. Sensei Joseph walks up holding a letter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e2402483-6d1f-40bd-896f-b8f6762a54c0">
      <Text>SenSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4163ea55-6538-4e33-a4a1-fd1374a4e7db">
      <Text>The African Union rankings are out!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3bfe2055-c802-4358-9cce-7196ae2de805">
      <Text>He holds up the letter. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9ad4458e-a245-4188-b02e-548aa36c8e6c">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e653af77-0494-4b6e-a187-63cb853eab60">
      <Text>Chantal, you are number one in the division in Burundi and number two in the Continental Rankings.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d6e20332-b48d-4702-8762-e5a2860396c4">
      <Text>Daniel and Ryan give her a high five.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7552fdf4-6ad6-44e9-89b6-ec5dc4ec4c2b">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3561c9fd-31b9-4334-8054-304005abc619">
      <Text>Daniel, you are number four, and Old man Cutler is number six... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6902c612-7e25-4040-b31f-b8a34559d658">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d6fe171e-2853-49c1-a571-64fd8bc8d385">
      <Text>Alright Daniel! </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7f3b3dd5-873b-4ea8-a79c-a73df2785054">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f00277b3-af4c-4732-893a-885a59fe9298">
      <Text>Sensei, what does that mean for the Olympics?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7cba15d1-991b-4e0a-a98f-765a317ca156">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6e598505-b53c-4001-a518-1bc9ce773a46">
      <Text>You have a chance to make the team, Daniel!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="526032bc-e179-4f7f-94d0-c9124ec5c07f">
      <Text>Daniel stares in disbelief. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7bea106c-ce66-4c21-b021-fc15217c9a9c">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a9c956d9-e67b-4bb2-a3a3-2249e6d36fee">
      <Text>But we need to keep pushing. If you’re not in the top 34 in the world you need to be in the top 12 in the union... and number one in the division.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="70b71e35-2f36-46d9-8d78-acf9777c4155">
      <Text>MONTAGE:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8518cae5-3f2f-41c1-8733-959c372c38dd">
      <Text>1) SENSEI JOSEPH, CHANTAL, DANIEL, AND RYAN BOARDING AN INTERNATIONAL FLIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="13f405a0-5273-4c87-b3a1-54d3b6eae958">
      <Text>2) </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">IJF</Text>
      <Text> WORLD TOUR COMPETITION - CHANTAL GETS THROWN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b6d72889-19e9-4560-960e-97495e308504">
      <Text>3) RYAN GETS THROWN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="73b9c62c-b302-409d-8c07-ce29d1f016b0">
      <Text>4) DANIEL WINS A MATCH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ac64a7ec-dcda-4022-b8b4-d125167ecf35">
      <Text>5) SENSEI JOSEPH REVIEWS THE CURRENT RANKINGS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a2de58fd-7e2f-46bb-bf5f-2db7cdab8c28">
      <Text>6) RYAN WINS A MATCH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9f957038-04e3-4af9-b8f7-cdd8bfe5c19b">
      <Text>7) DANIEL LOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="87fb4a17-8e4d-49ad-873c-027345679132">
      <Text>8) CHANTAL GETS THE BRONZE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="acee1c09-ba39-40ca-b04a-db55cfd18fd9">
      <Text>9) NELLA WATCHES RYAN FIGHTING ON TV - STRUGGLING AS HE’S THROWN HARD!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="55f92fc4-fdc3-4c6f-b302-6558400b10bd">
      <SceneProperties Length="3 3/8" Page="71" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ANNOUNCER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANIEL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="KOREAN REFEREE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LEO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NEIL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tiblisi</Text>
      <Text> convention center - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fac87524-298d-437f-9c73-75a38cfd4b9f">
      <Text>A banner proclaims “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">IJF</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">GRANDSLAM</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TIBLISI</Text>
      <Text>.” Daniel, Ryan, and Chantal warm-up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e2924526-bb64-4a1d-99ec-1222fa9b37c7">
      <Text>NEIL ADAMS and LEO WHITE sit at a press table.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="56e6e025-a6a1-4a55-817f-61d0ed0093a5">
      <Text>Neil</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f1473cc2-add7-4e31-92ad-72a7aa3f65bd">
      <Text>Welcome to the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">IJF</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tiblisi</Text>
      <Text> Grand Slam. This is one of the most important competitions on the road to 2028. I am joined by my colleague and Olympic Judoka, Leo White.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="292faed2-5638-4b0e-ac0e-a6eca354cf6c">
      <Text>Leo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0d446da4-46bd-4fcf-885c-99cb5f3dfea7">
      <Text>We’ve put the marathon behind us and we’re in the final sprint. The last three competitions will pretty much determine who will make the team and who will watch on TV.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7fb7d025-1095-4820-a6f7-1a68a1fdfb8e">
      <Text>NEIL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0ca2618e-8f0f-497f-9f3a-b657ec9623f0">
      <Text>Exactly. And today we’re starting with the lightweights. Sixty kilos and sixty-six kilos for the men, and forty-eight kilos and fifty-two for the women.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="efe07eb9-49d6-409d-bbcd-5d2b10c4e35d">
      <Text>LEO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8cb07acc-9cf6-4cac-bf4c-a00e57bfd9a6">
      <Text>The perennial favorites, Japan and France are here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9bd71719-4d0d-402c-9182-b670bf67c62f">
      <Text>NEIL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9ad5f131-e0b5-4da9-b1ec-0bfbee1caad6">
      <Text>And they each have several competitors in the divisions.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0f52d711-a33c-4635-a606-59985f94eb1a">
      <Text>LEO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37634c06-dd64-4055-89dd-98f7b09945c1">
      <Text>Even the number four or five from Japan can be a world champion.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="98588c9d-ff77-4548-adb5-d3eb66f4c6c4">
      <Text>NEIL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="17f9f4ef-8a7b-485c-9dd2-8a7bf828cce1">
      <Text>That is a fact. A virtual well of talent.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="163d2bf7-8c41-4316-abb5-2cb61ce1d4fb">
      <Text>On the mat, Daniel in blue faces a ANTONY VINCENTE from Italy in white. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="01d071ad-d930-4420-8994-72d691b5fab3">
      <Text>Korean referee</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7ae06734-9867-463c-9729-359bd5090133">
      <Text>Hajime!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2157d701-96fe-4c0b-bf2e-f02a72c41a2a">
      <Text>The two jockey for position. The Italian comes in for a hip throw and Daniel defends by dropping to the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="81cc8dc9-b58c-4887-b338-e1a4da2e989b">
      <Text>Neil (o.C.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="95273818-1831-4696-87c3-dc9d086ec4e1">
      <Text>That’s going to bring on a penalty, isn’t it... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="344f9e18-5231-4faf-85a7-e06da0f3c4b4">
      <Text>Korean REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a8cd8e2a-75e5-4c76-9c73-db266bb28ac8">
      <Text>Matte!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ead8a7bd-d927-4ec1-b5c8-4ac1f0e6382c">
      <Text>The Referee points at Daniel and signals a false attack...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8a288a51-836e-4c67-9549-2523ef86d1b2">
      <Text>KOREAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d9cbd2a5-2a00-440c-9371-ecef05d9d261">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Shido</Text>
      <Text>. Hajime!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="25cad528-c2a8-4ea5-9595-97f710359ced">
      <Text>Vincente grabs Daniel again, and again Daniel drops to the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="94f752a6-a9aa-4784-9836-4c701b35b6da">
      <Text>KOREAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3d5fb93c-3f03-4dbf-aeba-f94ac303dff7">
      <Text>Matte!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="20e0d6ec-dbcd-4e67-b23d-413bf8227856">
      <Text>The Referee points at Daniel and signals a false attack...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3988dce7-f971-4208-a5a5-80c5e21b9e82">
      <Text>KOREAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="35f1de76-6573-4ac3-88a2-9eb85aa1fd2e">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Shido</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="81cdfad3-c31e-4a99-8515-c019836068d6">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dfbb61e0-5b30-4b54-a89a-08ca25afdbed">
      <Text>And in short order, the Burundi competitor has two penalties.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a7f175ce-cd26-4d1e-99fa-21bad283025a">
      <Text>Leo (O.C.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8b1c338f-0d03-465d-aad7-e46c49b42734">
      <Text>One more and he’s done.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fb46bf67-afc4-4398-8271-8b6b3e47201d">
      <Text>Daniel glances at Sensei Joseph.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="65ee9a49-b2c9-40c5-ad9e-70c9d45bbc0f">
      <Text>SensEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="dc7d922a-7117-413b-9892-1dc646157d16">
      <Text>(in Kirundi)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8e20240c-4527-468e-b579-9a94bcb29366">
      <Text>Your grip! Get YOUR grip first!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a917e07e-b89d-4cce-a704-09b7d437635b">
      <Text>Daniel nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="46da5c93-91a4-44c5-997d-b9627e0c1ac5">
      <Text>KOREAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="33c8ce7c-7690-4ed9-97f7-8b2ed6f1e019">
      <Text>Hajime.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="83d264cb-b218-4e6c-a2c8-985516494db0">
      <Text>Neil (o.c)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dd3bb1aa-c4b9-4733-ba7f-5e381000f63f">
      <Text>Not at all surprising. This is a bit of mismatch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a0a2fb7d-9584-4dd7-bd4c-24f4adf8ba02">
      <Text>Leo (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="95cb7073-74f0-4ab5-9c34-746242603ce9">
      <Text>Vincente is ranked 9th in the world, while Daniel </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Niyonkuru</Text>
      <Text> is ranked 79th. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ec9f08f6-c14d-4abc-979e-9d190f243acf">
      <Text>At that moment, Daniel fakes a forward throw, Vincente enters with </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">osoto</Text>
      <Text>-gari. Daniel reverses and the both fall with Vincente’s back hitting the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fcbb03a8-df57-4b67-9342-1f960a519e14">
      <Text>Korean REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fa9314a8-3ab1-4968-9ac7-4956d2b09059">
      <Text>Ippon! Sore made!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="05ed4499-9d56-45fd-af92-619cc18f9da7">
      <Text>LEO (O.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="75e24966-f280-4983-870a-293412c3a77f">
      <Text>Oh, man! Where did that come from? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="521954c9-8792-4471-bef6-22e903c5c1ca">
      <Text>Neil (o.c)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="29de439c-8db9-487a-9e6f-1a731492c9ca">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Niyonkuru</Text>
      <Text> just leapt up the rankings with that toss. What a shocking turn!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6666a66f-d5ce-4da5-b0ae-460b690da7ba">
      <Text>The referee awards the match to Daniel.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="112fa2fa-df32-489f-807b-83ba34b085b0">
      <Text>Daniel comes off the mat and high fives with Sensei Joseph. He jogs over to where Ryan’s warming up. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2d1fc749-f833-491a-b62a-35c3130c8180">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8af43bbc-5c24-4b58-8e54-6602101b7189">
      <Text>That was awesome!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="498f8d39-5b34-4ef2-8a85-2c240f52c31e">
      <Text>They chest bump.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cb456088-5886-4de1-9d85-22abcfd984aa">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="80c4d379-1576-42c8-b811-9946b4fa4e5a">
      <Text>You have driven me to be better... not just a better judoka, a better person.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4165daee-5a9f-4150-96d4-057dc4ae928b">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="847b030e-6637-4ddc-9822-58001213a453">
      <Text>Hey, you don’t want to make a grown man cry... not just before he goes on the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="be680ea2-b570-4ebe-bb50-c3317799656b">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9c004c12-dff4-4094-8917-ab979b96bb6b">
      <Text>It’s true. I am forever grateful.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="35d8f0d8-3035-48a6-a289-1419512ed9bd">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="87b39e91-ec70-4d21-9e82-177cd1065278">
      <Text>You’re going to make Burundi proud, Daniel. I’ll be in LA cheering you on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c0438e17-3d05-4ca3-a94e-6523009eced9">
      <Text>Announcer (oVER THE PA)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9cefed3d-4ce9-44b4-a2e1-03eed0c7b015">
      <Text>Mat one, Ryan Cutler, Burundi in white, Robert </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> from Germany in blue.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c4fc6fe6-10b7-4755-a761-674bd780a165">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph joins Ryan as he makes his way to the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2697fb6e-518f-46f9-ac95-80b063a845d2">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="60e17128-c645-49ca-b5ad-ba75f3408c58">
      <Text>Any advice?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="421b18e6-50bd-4204-a14f-d9def682d194">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="20539471-219a-4b6a-83a0-0fe02ec87c9e">
      <Text>I think you know what to do.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a0109976-e118-4607-91b5-0e57fa8f7a97">
      <Text>Ryan smiles and bows onto the mat. Across the tatami, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text>, wearing blue, does the same.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="65ec1152-6c3b-45e2-9d69-8ab035921260">
      <Text>Korean REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6f530042-ca3a-4dec-aebb-7f1d5d25fbc6">
      <Text>Hajime!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="014b1250-edf4-46bd-b7e7-9059f9bb97e4">
      <Text>Ryan goes for a grip and the German turns attempting one armed shoulder throw (ippon sei-o-</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">nage</Text>
      <Text>.) Ryan blocks the attempt. The German turns hitting Ryan in the temple with his elbow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ccb0c44f-61d3-466e-9e38-69d24d540be2">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="57572678-89f9-42ab-baa7-2d666fe1238a">
      <Text>Hey! </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9a0d7bc2-8a1f-4056-9d5d-94fc7aac68e3">
      <Text>Ryan sees stars. The German takes advantage. He enters a major outer leg sweep (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">osoto</Text>
      <Text>-gari). Ryan goes down. The match is over. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4409a949-5e74-401f-88f6-c809263177e4">
      <Text>KOREAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5f79bee3-145e-4e1d-928c-a9d6a02c2aa1">
      <Text>Ippon. Sore made.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="771fe2bd-c23b-4564-86ea-dbcea1d3fd2c">
      <Text>Ryan’s still shaking off the cobwebs as the referee awards the win to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="07ff5fbb-f5d7-49bd-a62b-3054033d80a5">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="74" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="EGYPTIAN REFEREE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LEO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NEIL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tiblisi</Text>
      <Text> convention center - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6c151231-9946-4c14-836f-5cdb7a4219b6">
      <Text>Ryan holds ice to the side of his head. Daniel warms up as </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sensie</Text>
      <Text> Joseph massages his forearms.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="94d5aa84-2d64-4749-890d-9c27874c9993">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="844d88f1-9a82-4c91-97b9-0863b51c281c">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler’s</Text>
      <Text> strong... but stiff. Stay loose and move to your right. Circle get your grip and go. You got this.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2406ad5e-f60e-4663-90f6-b0d5d6eee92f">
      <Text>SeNSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f55d6acf-efee-4250-bd66-592d0ab9bf4e">
      <Text>He fights dirty. Be careful.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="efc39cda-2746-4be9-b781-f5675d3c5e07">
      <Text>Daniel nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Shot" id="226bc59c-bd2c-4541-b40e-aa1af56dc3b1">
      <Text>NEIL AND LEO at the press table</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3dc05588-1f59-41ba-a35f-12a34dbfe4b5">
      <Text>Neil</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4329351a-8103-4ad1-ad3c-9ac3293d73f7">
      <Text>What a fantastic ride it has been for Young Daniel </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Niyonkuru</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5372d5d9-a293-4ce5-a2f6-822e73aab2b4">
      <Text>Leo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="936ec7cd-af65-45c9-9e2f-056ec506e010">
      <Text>He’s made it to the quarter finals against the tough German </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="14e467f1-2d3b-4b58-b889-13e9f90da1d5">
      <Text>NEIL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="981d9c37-216f-484a-914c-ea1c84e569de">
      <Text>We’ll find out soon enough if it was a fluke or if he’s something of a phenom from the small country of Burundi.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Shot" id="b1e45356-f843-47e5-91b2-c68a607e6014">
      <Text>On the mat</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="52c1c92e-2eda-4441-a82e-f5ef9f0c3c3f">
      <Text>An EGYPTIAN REFEREE invites Daniel and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> onto the mat. They bow. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ed407b0d-4d31-482c-b7a3-a1ed485c0424">
      <Text>Egyptian referee</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5098d129-4c08-4ed6-9478-d95970d31812">
      <Text>Hajime.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7c171f39-d6eb-416d-b5d2-ab90d8152cf0">
      <Text>Daniel does exactly as Ryan suggested, he circles to the right and gets his grip. He pulls </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> to his left and then does a foot-sweep. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> wobbles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fc7ee621-6c4e-4fba-afad-065a0e2e4dbb">
      <Text>NEIL (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b09c3c4d-391f-4bd5-8bd2-657460032051">
      <Text>A nice bit of </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ashi-waza</Text>
      <Text> there by Daniel.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2c90c557-6c7b-4500-8fc8-73250c6c6079">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> tries to enter with a body drop throw (tai-o-</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">toshi</Text>
      <Text>), Daniel steps over and reaps </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler’s</Text>
      <Text> leg (ko-</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">uchi</Text>
      <Text>-gari). </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> falls, turning to his belly at the last second.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a8ed47fb-0cbe-46ba-a38a-fdefa0b97169">
      <Text>EGYPTIAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d8a5fa7f-e3d9-49ed-a678-40ec3934fb52">
      <Text>Yuko.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="942acda2-bcbf-4e01-b470-611168b654c7">
      <Text>Leo (O.C.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4b9eed35-3dc7-4f38-9dde-b7ecaa5a0fd3">
      <Text>Oh, wow. That puts the Burundi on the scoreboard.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5a85f89f-4dd5-4af0-a3b9-c1c2a53a7f43">
      <Text>Neil (o.C.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="20eff854-38a1-4163-a76f-122b0e9214d7">
      <Text>He turned out of it, but enough of his belly was exposed to warrant the score.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="c6b97fc0-87c3-4ee1-b3bb-ca11a1a465e6">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 4/8" Page="75" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANIEL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="EGYPTIAN REFEREE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LEO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NEIL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">TibLISI</Text>
      <Text> CONVENTION CENTER - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a12119fb-3a19-4205-9f1f-4c89ea693d9d">
      <Text>Time ticks by. Daniel’s still ahead on the scoreboard by the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">yuko</Text>
      <Text> with ten seconds left. Daniel ties his belt and tucks in his </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text>. Sucking wind. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e62d1ac8-251c-49be-9667-83d569c62b1c">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="40356b58-baf1-44e9-988a-26ea1d813623">
      <Text>Only ten seconds left.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0ac7f016-1c9f-4f13-8ecc-cb8d50d31dda">
      <Text>Leo (O.C.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b582f164-9b0a-4479-8a46-e547d4c7ca65">
      <Text>I think we can say that his win over Vincente was anything but a fluke.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="42daa294-ad11-4c46-a723-3edef15dd671">
      <Text>EgyptiAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cb2f7487-6434-4972-8f65-a69a02686960">
      <Text>Hajime!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="424f0ccc-e6cc-4bc3-b4ff-87f34d32812d">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> rushes toward Daniel. As Daniel reaches for </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler’s</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text>, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">graps</Text>
      <Text> his wrist and applies a standing arm-bar. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c1e04653-6924-448c-a92e-a9bdf2e5be37">
      <Text>There’s a loud SNAP and Daniel lets out a primordial scream of pain.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="98bf59b3-28fb-4794-9bcd-59949d804d04">
      <Text>Leo (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5c6d1c19-8adb-4caa-b661-6efcd5d3d22a">
      <Text>Oh my god... that’s a blatant </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">waki-gatame</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b7241a57-2331-40b6-8690-0901a7328c5c">
      <Text>EGYPTIAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fe496c68-3a47-4154-938d-d8a7e3b8757b">
      <Text>Matte!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dd6083b6-db40-4e29-9785-4dd25c6674a5">
      <Text>He calls for the medical team as Daniel writhes in pain. Sensei Joseph is on his feet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d51b7517-7974-4dd8-a011-813246279fd7">
      <Text>Ryan too... the entire grandstand waits, watches as Daniel holds his arm, the elbow sticking out at an odd angle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="adc707a0-c13d-4f82-bff4-4e0214d94d97">
      <Text>The Referee cocks his head, listening over his earpiece.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Shot" id="aaa7fb30-a44f-48ba-9576-05c0f979f4b2">
      <Text>The press table</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1c4860d5-1edb-4c28-8693-14d36aa889ec">
      <Text>Neil</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="50ae3148-a006-491d-8b45-0410b481f0de">
      <Text>That was a flagrant foul. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a32f6697-80f9-4ece-8c94-7ec0b212d12d">
      <Text>Leo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2bee306e-be2d-44ef-a7fb-ced6c7ca3f3c">
      <Text>Hate to see that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Shot" id="d8f1b7ed-7bd9-4be0-b238-b5f4b850149a">
      <Text>On the mat</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="93328452-a76d-483a-83fa-5bd7e2683cec">
      <Text>The referee turns to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e6f4defc-c9e6-4dd1-b3b7-0036e9fc2580">
      <Text>EGYPTIAN REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a02dbe73-e04a-4265-abbf-4f01242b6c3b">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hansoku</Text>
      <Text> make!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1b23df1f-3495-4f8a-998d-fcd024d71bb3">
      <Text>The medical team helps Daniel to his feet. The referee awards Daniel the win... but his arm is broken. The medical team helps him off the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dc72be1c-94df-4e39-9eb9-b1ae750e8139">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph goes follows him. Ryan runs over.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="45ce0448-31b3-47b1-9957-4c3a553ea651">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8dbf7a99-8558-4018-9a2d-5aee414836ae">
      <Text>That mother --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="46bd9922-0340-45ef-83bb-28bfba08a730">
      <Text>Tears of pain and anguish roll silently down Daniel’s cheek...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="82afcbac-b102-40a4-adbe-7394f9a739da">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b758ccbe-8f85-478c-8d3e-a1a4ba10a38b">
      <Text>I was so close... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a5a00294-a576-493c-b07d-74bfcc87fd02">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a66cce17-f6a1-4c90-9660-763499c1fa83">
      <Text>I know, you’re going to be fine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c2467c15-b90f-4aac-89d5-38f495c27ad7">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="41c54778-dc18-4550-9801-149c1519d919">
      <Text>Take care of the team, Ryan... I have to go with him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b4ed6f52-5d8f-4ba4-acab-e28553d9a3cc">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ef8eeb82-39ab-424e-bb2f-595b4ecbbad0">
      <Text>I got you... go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d0962f6a-5743-4106-9415-5a3f2faacc0d">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph goes with Daniel and the medics.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="4280984c-539d-4a3c-b019-e49c12c30c6d">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="77" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tiblisi</Text>
      <Text> hospital - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="78a58d08-e1d0-4f14-af1a-a122753ba0d2">
      <Text>Late in the day, an Uber squeals to a stop at the hospital entrance. Ryan and Chantal, still in their </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> pants, carrying their </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> bags hop out of the car and rush into the building.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2ff29028-f93e-4495-9e47-247181f8040d">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="77" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">tiblisi</Text>
      <Text> hoSPITAL - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="df344ed1-e102-45ee-a086-fdcfdd929f1e">
      <Text>The elevator opens on the fifth floor. Chantal and Ryan spot Sensei Joseph.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c701c9b2-6817-48e3-b25e-778f63420db0">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c2fd2011-2a54-4569-9f64-2faacda38b4a">
      <Text>Sensei!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b92213de-ed4d-4e6f-9a3b-9bdf88a4c4de">
      <Text>Chantal runs up to him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="380ea244-a878-4c86-a2cf-7c7f34caa1fe">
      <Text>SenSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="431c9578-9ce7-44d7-ad29-d88c989d116d">
      <Text>He’s in surgery.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fe3869df-7d2a-4dc1-a9ea-7b4033364991">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="781c6ec1-f312-4d53-91e2-34a6011a43f6">
      <Text>How bad is it?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f70112ef-fb36-4ccb-96e4-272f811be759">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="959e8b90-7c92-4899-a082-34275a7183de">
      <Text>Bad enough.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="03619d86-ef9d-4015-b3ba-846c2042ab8e">
      <SceneProperties Length="3 2/8" Page="77" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SURGEON">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">tiblisi</Text>
      <Text> hospital - waiting room - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a66b80e2-68e2-4cbd-947b-86ca4cab12c0">
      <Text>A SURGEON in green scrubs approaches Sensei Joseph, Ryan, and Chantal. Sensei stands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="827be8c2-efa9-4114-9c59-4b28f1c6fbae">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9d5e5fd7-2791-4fcf-b945-3c9e2e31aef2">
      <Text>Doctor?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="90a393bb-0785-4bb5-9069-25ca92a334f2">
      <Text>SURGEON</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="70b32a8b-1905-4ac6-93dd-6b18fd6f1a63">
      <Text>There was a complete tear of the ulnar collateral ligament... and there was some fractures that made it more difficult. There were bone chips that had to be removed. But the surgery went fine. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a5fe3cb4-52ce-46b2-993a-a9d131bab39d">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="98882664-b012-4867-b8ad-e2d8017ac80f">
      <Text>What about his recovery? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="de5b065c-2d07-48a4-817e-76bf29d7380a">
      <Text>SURGEON</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9025951e-d027-4613-abc1-3803072aaefc">
      <Text>Six weeks in a cast. Another three months of rehab he would be perhaps eighty percent back to full recovery. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5952ffb6-3e72-40c4-a67e-dd3411092ab7">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="59ef16f7-2cb9-42f8-b6c6-4daccf87ba7c">
      <Text>Can I see him?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d4f53351-1f49-4b6c-b870-5e19cc22644a">
      <Text>The Surgeon nods. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="62093717-9b17-4d46-b52b-9a7a0f34a6bc">
      <Text>SURGEON</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dded2cbc-12cc-4898-9da5-f77ef3583cdd">
      <Text>I’ll show you to his room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f292921d-5c94-4844-b336-6f064ae98c72">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d7944da3-a4b1-417f-af2a-d8d2643ea37c">
      <Text>We’ll wait here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ef1b75fd-efcf-4104-aeeb-676f402af783">
      <Text>The Surgeon and Chantal head down the hall. Sensei sits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e7d88efd-096f-461c-8e2a-42932159716a">
      <Text>SeNSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="07c7bd2d-ab89-4822-babd-281393a684c3">
      <Text>How did the rest of the matches go?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="37e3ecd2-25fd-4ed4-b82e-fa29f905efff">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d02e712f-753e-47ae-9022-9dfa6379fce5">
      <Text>Chantal took bronze. Lost to the girl from France by </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">yuko</Text>
      <Text>. Then crushed the Egyptian girl.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5571d40b-d927-4f23-869d-7f8f143adc07">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fcde80f6-56de-482c-a9d9-ea39624009d0">
      <Text>And you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8376700a-d9f4-4f5c-8ec7-7bbc748578ca">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bf1c8da8-4862-403e-bb05-7b4fccb56ebd">
      <Text>Me? I left.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="473b2e0e-56d5-47e9-98a2-af1e4f96c8c2">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0c2fecd4-87e1-4352-bf87-710dda36d4a5">
      <Text>But you were in the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">repercharge</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bd517898-6afd-40c2-b713-9f95c33aeb54">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="18ec76dd-e093-4557-b826-49617b2ccf0d">
      <Text>After Chantal got her medal we left.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8de977fb-5624-4772-8e9e-396d588f91d7">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="44b2f875-8269-4d26-9bd4-6c9249249295">
      <Text>You would have fought for third. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4d4622d5-558c-4712-9426-714f371f9fb1">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d2e9803c-0529-4193-b2ad-b2a51df2a242">
      <Text>So what? It doesn’t matter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="248b2c37-37d5-4c8e-bf5d-850736e0d9ee">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="64e16920-cd22-4ce6-8c09-65ac2ef50f88">
      <Text>But it does. You finished fifth... fifth in a Grand Slam... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6a45a0ee-ba48-4456-be1b-e9bda42ed380">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4a04bc31-0b15-43ef-840a-a228148ea04a">
      <Text>They give you a kick in the ass for that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a2527f26-085a-461a-ae55-5a837ff5270b">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f310c6f9-8f8f-4ad5-adb1-30fb13680b17">
      <Text>No, they give you points. Lots of points. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a4784560-6134-4ef4-b67a-0895b4dc82d6">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="56f3a96b-df2e-4977-b945-ebbc16e4f4c7">
      <Text>For fifth?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b7067d23-5ab0-429e-bf81-5e6fe174349c">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph nods. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3acb1144-65b3-4002-b809-58fd16a9548d">
      <Text>SenSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="84a7cd99-2ff3-4c84-9c58-22b4425f384f">
      <Text>It’s up to you now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6996e8bd-63f7-470d-a22d-df4c7a4c86f8">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e03f7d3d-f21c-45b3-ac0c-84e3c33cbbaf">
      <Text>What is?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8fa5ecee-d6ff-4c87-9fc5-6442ad408704">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="57c9088b-4629-48e4-a2f6-2eb8d3f68318">
      <Text>You have the most points of any competitor in the African Union.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="46510737-3668-4774-9dda-2580dda593aa">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8b384eaf-3203-4381-9194-351f885c4a73">
      <Text>Sensei, I’m a little fuzzy here. What are we talking about?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="57344189-b4fd-4fb5-9eb8-e99c6c49bcd7">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aeeab2df-d636-40f1-b59e-17666402134b">
      <Text>The Olympics. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="35940205-1ccc-4227-b20b-02d36b56404e">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="993f1af7-b73e-4acc-804c-2260a61bad97">
      <Text>The Olympic, Olympics? Those Olympics?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="98da713e-b0ab-4ea1-89bd-29b51785ac78">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c750d849-3268-46a4-9267-5e8eb7b33844">
      <Text>You have a very real chance to qualify.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4ab22de0-945d-4070-9584-878f164e7873">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="756577b2-52c8-49ea-8131-4275d80810da">
      <Text>Yeah, right. There are dozens of African competitors --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ca33dcc9-e82b-46d8-80af-2e32d94acf4c">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4f1f9200-6428-4a90-b238-2e4bf962be4d">
      <Text>Not ahead of you. Daniel was, but now...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3a3f606e-1c83-4dc4-8760-597d213d2805">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="33915034-5f82-4a5b-8fbf-a2214bd2e5dd">
      <Text>What about the South African?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="65a95518-facd-479c-8a30-4d04322b29c4">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7a4ec797-dc0e-48bd-8079-26a3b3135e38">
      <Text>He’s out with a knee injury.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4399f4fb-74cc-4142-a570-da79df789c72">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7f0dfdcc-a29a-426f-92ed-7e5c47def8d7">
      <Text>Ahmed from Egypt?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4eebc1b6-c985-4976-a835-f501b0ec2fe5">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="08b18999-bee7-43a8-aead-758fea96991c">
      <Text>He moved up to sixty-six... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5ba69603-2271-4935-adfe-b4c07effba30">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="81396a76-4c3f-4b47-8309-7dda5e597080">
      <Text>I can’t.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="00eeee13-4e33-44e6-aa7d-226780ccbdbe">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ee6205e0-5c46-4567-94c1-29b55dd8985a">
      <Text>Why? Because you are too old?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f2a0265f-8657-4621-ac6e-99bb32330f82">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b10aa835-7a37-4f53-818c-277852efbaa0">
      <Text>Way, way too old.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4eef1baf-04cd-44b1-8265-434daef7dd25">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="abb15eec-327c-487b-b8cd-19d7f0ebadbd">
      <Text>Do you think the competitors you beat think you’re too old?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="008c7e9c-b6c5-481a-b756-a646154abbe1">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1ceedf1c-51e7-4fde-96fe-c4f61028ca47">
      <Text>No, no.... No way. I haven’t... I don’t deserve to... I mean, shit. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a8218f90-a583-4bd1-ad45-4dc2bc629ae7">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6c440411-0a48-4620-bd24-18fdf2ba6bc2">
      <Text>You are one the best judoka in Africa. Not “for your age”, not “in spite of anything”, you are. I am the first coach from Burundi to have </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">have</Text>
      <Text> an Olympian compete in judo... I want to be the first to have two.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="84361003-908c-4fc3-9c73-dd52552c9640">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5deab547-a56c-4574-8692-fd6a282f695e">
      <Text>This is insane. I can make the team... from Burundi and compete in Los Angeles? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c1224933-b987-4edb-be91-9a288bb96279">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9e717ffc-c374-4828-818f-2f7ba916b75f">
      <Text>Lie to me, and tell me you don’t dream of being an Olympian.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5e765be6-12a0-4eb8-bfb3-a66b9d65bb6f">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="82444085-02bd-418b-aca0-e0acc640e312">
      <Text>I don’t dream of being an Olympian... much... anymore... not every day of my life.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4726e9af-a8d6-4073-a8bb-89e90598ba47">
      <Text>Chantal comes into the hallway.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cc5b8c03-f659-4b63-bcd0-5464d38a9aa4">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4f66a788-1dd5-42a1-9baf-158159863f4c">
      <Text>Daniel wants to see you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="17d72633-677b-4f9e-9c34-11176af710d9">
      <Text>Sensei and Ryan follow her to Daniel’s room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="a7159155-36e4-4341-a4a6-dfe3b60528c2">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="81" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANIEL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tiblisi</Text>
      <Text> hospital room - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="91f4a73d-d55d-4f80-9431-776c4e4e1656">
      <Text>Daniel, groggy, his arm in a cast, an IV hooked up, looks over as Chantal leads Sensei Joseph and Ryan in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0c133701-38ad-48ef-98f8-ee1eadd02800">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0769413a-3230-4a7f-b497-b02d8dd8a36e">
      <Text>Sensei... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4c4991c5-a7bf-4f59-894d-fe016e57094b">
      <Text>Joseph walks over. He takes Daniel’s good hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="24769622-b54e-44a6-974c-50a5d45efbc4">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="83e05e5e-cb98-4e90-be3c-78152d42e786">
      <Text>I was so, close... so, so close...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4bf18b60-dba1-4df7-b96e-cd5bf8bd2cd4">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4c13e859-8269-4a0f-a7f2-494a2377b67a">
      <Text>You’re going to come back even stronger. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="82e415d6-3619-4268-ad63-b5d5e7e72212">
      <Text>Daniel smiles. Ryan steps up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6775d09d-b471-40ae-8d61-9d827cc0e009">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fb6ac8b7-ac5f-4b8d-b6af-509906bb3326">
      <Text>Remember me?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="44221d1e-09b9-4116-84f8-d37d9c7ce563">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="26ff778d-d0ff-4a22-9e36-4135276d4e27">
      <Text>(shakes his head)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d105b2ac-5614-4b61-85f1-4858da41e005">
      <Text>Did you win?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ea38f8ec-c69e-4fbb-a28d-c6b5bbbdc2df">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="63b4eee3-975f-4ba1-88a1-7b3fbcb00984">
      <Text>No, kid. I didn’t win.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4892c8b6-9881-41d3-a571-0135efb95895">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f49e7881-8e0a-472e-8ad0-e9cdebeb5bdf">
      <Text>He broke my arm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3a5d6b0d-c4c8-4a7d-a428-c52ed19f2f08">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="14e415a3-e547-492d-9152-f7a7649d5b00">
      <Text>I saw that. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3da53590-0c80-4f2c-beff-d675bdaa2edf">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="44bbac4a-e311-4fba-bd68-ee917e8bdba2">
      <Text>I am going to miss practice I think.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="de5e6cd4-971e-4498-9152-a5ea0a689c5f">
      <Text>Chantal turns.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c336545c-cd88-4ced-934d-1a080d186adc">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fc2a3343-f32e-43dc-8e71-c3f17990db07">
      <Text>I am going to stay.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c06dba75-4e81-4757-a565-286cf5564172">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph, and Ryan acknowledge her and head out the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="d67f64ea-4119-426b-9975-5e50b7c8943f">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 3/8" Page="82" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ELVIS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ERIC">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JEAN CLAUDE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JEANE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. BURUNDI TEA AND COFFEE COMPANY - CONFERENCE ROOM - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bd2cd12d-698f-48ce-af06-3cae2c67927d">
      <Text>Ryan is up at the white board. Mama, Eric, Jean Claude, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jeane</Text>
      <Text>, and Elvis take notes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="66be07b1-190b-4817-892d-22ee434633d4">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="024988e4-5e59-457c-87a7-fc2d7e855e8a">
      <Text>Okay, who can tell me what an “Ice breaker” is?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2780033a-b085-4f97-9f55-e03591cfaa67">
      <Text>Eric</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0468939c-b9bf-470a-82aa-28c7992fc65f">
      <Text>It’s a skinny knife... and you stab the ice.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9ba70aa2-f06c-4adf-a189-2f78f189ab8a">
      <Text>Eric mimes stabbing the ice.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9a8e595c-61da-4621-8e96-751f6da9980a">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6ef61522-e063-494b-ac8d-44c091e34bba">
      <Text>I see where you got that. That’s close. That’s an ice pick.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="06e51c0b-2b14-45dc-8429-bacf89303fa6">
      <Text>Elvis</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a30d71f3-52c7-460e-a98d-7640348d4067">
      <Text>It’s a statement to calm nerves, like to make the very first move.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5cbfc4f0-6fd5-45af-95ee-0f851a1bcb97">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0246be4d-ccb6-420c-9784-8a6119249cda">
      <Text>Exactly. Anyone here get nervous when talking to new people?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8c4ca42d-2392-4935-845c-6aa5accbbde3">
      <Text>Everyone but Mama’s hand goes up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d0dc20c2-96e8-4c69-b444-b6e9ea267990">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9caa89d3-1534-4a7b-a753-25e7183a8e7e">
      <Text>Okay. Me too... what if you have to speak to them in English?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2be849c9-c4c2-4ff5-b6c5-0b4bc46a7e4c">
      <Text>Mama’s hand joins the others.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4382bc92-73da-4f27-88b8-36cdbe1290e4">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e6344872-02b0-4b50-9a2f-c35cadb7d95b">
      <Text>Completely natural, right? So, how do we break the ice?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="378e62fa-7321-42d8-a2e9-d6c4db987021">
      <Text>Jean CLAUDE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="32a38acd-c8bd-4b9f-aac0-848c031d10bb">
      <Text>With a compliment?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bffa34c8-127b-420f-b507-90c21b5441a0">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="387abcfd-4c1f-41d7-ac23-8d7294384cf4">
      <Text>Such as?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7e7bfcbd-364b-4f21-8bca-d561f304e64a">
      <Text>JEAN CLAUDE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="da071032-7a59-4f5d-b3fc-a4d4929e0567">
      <Text>(turns to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jeane</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="20c16013-1ece-482c-8bc9-68eb8efcd96f">
      <Text>Miss </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jeane</Text>
      <Text>, you are looking quite well today.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="b1604338-16f1-42aa-bec6-ba29af99358c">
      <Text>(to Ryan)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="030bfd53-d106-44cd-97ac-473e44cad6dc">
      <Text>Yes?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1b2472a6-33ae-4a92-8724-9670cad1f67f">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6dc675b7-2d13-4e6b-9e82-64a492c4c354">
      <Text>Sure. That works. What else?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c59ede83-a32b-4dbf-a8dc-a1dfa1b44cb5">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jeane</Text>
      <Text> raises her hand. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cd2acbbe-e990-42a1-902b-a3ff07d57641">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jeane</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1f91fccc-87d3-4d79-b28b-4e5eaf949ca5">
      <Text>I don’t know if this is right... but maybe you break this ice with humor?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="875754be-d50b-4cf8-80f7-d3ccaeaf5777">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c41379cc-2d9e-4d0d-bb44-100f1d9fc9f4">
      <Text>Aha, excellent! Humor is a perfect ice breaker. So, who has a joke they want to tell.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f4eb7ff2-ab08-4b88-9dd3-8a02f9509311">
      <Text>Eric</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dc7146b2-d6ed-4bc2-bb99-684fc447c86a">
      <Text>I have a very funny joke, I think. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="4da066fa-47cf-4534-b571-80576a47f362">
      <Text>(clears his throat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="85b1050d-2467-4fe9-a3e2-f1489a47017a">
      <Text>A man walks into a house of ill repute with a small man on his shoulder --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5fc1df1c-0bff-4ae7-aa7b-2d8b345b96f6">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="916aad45-fd19-405a-bd96-615f0ce722ff">
      <Text>Okay, I think I know that one... We may need to talk about what is and isn’t appropriate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ecb98d76-7190-449d-9a67-2ab92cf00d9a">
      <Text>He glances at the clock...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6f3318a9-55c3-4ee5-a007-2d200211f8fc">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="102098a3-c954-4fe5-97e4-48da08e61e4b">
      <Text>But we’ll pick that up next class... Eric, you can save that for another time.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="05139251-d643-45cc-8430-ead297930db6">
      <Text>The class gather’s their things with “thanks/goodbye” as they file out. Ryan gets his things together, glancing at his phone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cbc86cd5-8747-41a8-98d7-4024250a237e">
      <Text>He has 12 texts and another 12 missed calls from Sensei Joseph. Nella leans into the class room, beaming at Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b6928a5d-4e64-4f99-8419-a8e56189eccf">
      <Text>NelLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8445a2b4-c8b9-4bae-998a-e5d2cb36b022">
      <Text>Good class?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="019562f8-1663-4f34-8605-803202c93481">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="129b6d88-e54c-46c8-baa2-5b9b04514c44">
      <Text>(distracted)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4fc82568-22d0-4b97-9122-b8772e86a641">
      <Text>I... yes, I think it was... um.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f7c21b20-ef2a-47af-9a6c-bb108c6a0395">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="42e45f4e-6d9b-445c-89b5-263785369c0a">
      <Text>Want to grab some dinner?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f50d5f85-72bb-41ee-b67e-acf23923b75a">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1b080e3a-789b-43fa-bf7c-2190a5331ea1">
      <Text>I do, but I need to go to the dojo... can we meet up later?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b047c682-75f5-4152-add6-4823d8738254">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b8b55778-c8df-4fff-be49-b0476d26ef3c">
      <Text>Is everything alright?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a054964e-cad5-48e2-96f1-a8d5f6443bc2">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c1e8724a-93e4-47e2-92de-c9d7aeee2989">
      <Text>I’m not sure.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fc0b29fb-8c7d-4b54-a8ef-c9ed7a62f51c">
      <Text>He walks by Nella. Stops in the hall turns back and kisses her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2d9c4bff-3740-4556-be59-9f1dda335bc9">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f5413f43-1143-46d2-bc65-0a371bf0b5ca">
      <Text>Later?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e75127db-e2f4-4104-a003-9e10c0693f51">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="be0e52ee-9cd0-41e8-9cef-34ba8e023c23">
      <Text>Text me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="579d1906-7c01-4f47-b035-316a34b8dc24">
      <Text>He nods and makes a bee-line for the exit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="36516874-7eda-4b37-bd4a-670e97ae4b33">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="84" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Burundi TEA AND COFFEE COMPANY - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b1a85ab1-d0f7-4d9d-ab5c-f15339d95b28">
      <Text>Ryan hops on his bike.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="32b07a65-6902-459a-913e-3be5ff06c331">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="84" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. BujumburA JUDO DOJO - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="63028503-7f5a-49a6-9547-d2d1e02f622f">
      <Text>Ryan parks his bike out front. He sees Sensei Joseph seated at his desk. Joseph waves and beckons him inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9746c940-5b77-44a0-9213-bf85407c9208">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="84" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. bujuMBURA JUDO DOJO - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="46dcedc7-d05e-4a0f-8064-759559748371">
      <Text>Ryan bows and steps inside. Joseph stands to greet him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9c248f6b-d202-4efd-8697-955b244d5224">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b7443bd2-c970-4e72-bc8f-5383c1acd493">
      <Text>What’s going on? Is it Daniel? Is he okay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cb516b86-063d-45c2-8973-a7c2b27574ea">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="abd8d89d-e111-49fd-88b2-ea28a79d1594">
      <Text>He’s fine. But why didn’t you call?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c8678778-f271-46b2-aefb-b5d3ee872b2e">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1fe2d860-d6ca-4bd8-add8-d442879e53cd">
      <Text>Uh... what?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b73ded7e-c3bf-4aa4-b922-f644c669993b">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4f339de6-73e2-45ed-b9c5-1d9e5c056f64">
      <Text>You could have just called.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ec85b434-5ab9-418b-af00-dd7049dfafec">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="05dc5472-978e-4bc1-ac3f-d7251de3c9c3">
      <Text>I didn’t think of it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d84d4da3-b087-499a-b08c-aa37b412d67e">
      <Text>SeNSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="25f72b05-31d1-4770-bc53-129503f39979">
      <Text>I got a letter from the African Judo Federation today.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="925e4587-4305-4c0f-9240-9246ae1074ee">
      <Text>He hands the letter to Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="59e8cdbb-49d2-4218-b956-8c11ff990bda">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="60ffa8bb-877e-47d3-abef-fe6b504799d5">
      <Text>We are pleased to inform you that your student, Ryan Cutler has been officially selected to --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bf572198-1bb6-46d3-a76e-b4305f993600">
      <Text>Ryan stands in stunned silence. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a380dc0e-9d05-488d-8c9f-19dbb1421b5e">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="267e03d8-7e0f-4870-9d78-ba4f2f36e4e1">
      <Text>I’m on the team?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c419c562-8520-447b-ba80-3f0e728a08cc">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ec76464b-a4ae-4ccb-acc8-b502109fbf7b">
      <Text>You are on the team. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f1e69ba0-d3d0-4982-812e-b2bc8e67368a">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4778f942-c306-4ab4-aa98-4dcc04760e22">
      <Text>I’m ON the team? No joke?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="19584ddb-f6c9-4e46-b8da-3c7dddd26037">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph laughs and shakes his head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="78105c40-4f70-481d-b381-284a9e1c901c">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9f152f80-7884-4081-bb63-a0aa1bb3b451">
      <Text>Do they know how old I am?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cbd4540b-9ecb-4d6d-b580-a0c7645dcb86">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="52a9324e-7b6d-4086-b915-aacff814549b">
      <Text>(shrugs)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8baf73db-5f96-46c4-b14c-ef78a7c8c663">
      <Text>They looked at your performance over the last six months.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="792e28d4-7e33-4bc8-ad44-d41631767fa2">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4d389f07-2d04-4b31-93f9-1191798eeadd">
      <Text>But... I... I have to go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bde9a8fa-c285-4841-a79b-ff78bb53ff7b">
      <Text>Ryan drops the letter and leaves the dojo. Sensei Joseph watches as Ryan hops on the bike and pedals off. He chuckles and picks the official offer letter off the floor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="aaeb104c-c8a8-4093-8081-4d6fdd92a5b5">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="85" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Nella’s house - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="35026b60-441a-4622-abf3-2c5163ae3474">
      <Text>Ryan slides his bike to a stop outside Nella’s house. Rivers of sweat drip from his face. His shirt clings to his back. He drops the bike and goes to the door, knocking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0510b053-b3b8-445b-a018-5e277f9ff574">
      <Text>Nella opens the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="748d9974-671a-4102-9c6e-18a04406deb7">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="859d741c-2b28-4d9c-8494-4afc92d7a1f1">
      <Text>Ryan? What --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c75e6384-d3b1-4771-8151-46071835ca2a">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="959b09b0-2398-44ee-89be-5705fe7f7fd3">
      <Text>Can I come in?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="86b40469-1418-4e38-b226-5f49a3541394">
      <Text>Ryan steps inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="88c0541e-12f2-48d9-b6fa-42265c613b62">
      <SceneProperties Length="2" Page="86" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. NellA'S HOUSE - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fe6db3ea-3d1b-4f54-ab96-28eb094caa4a">
      <Text>Ryan paces. Nella watches him, worried.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4ff1a1be-5ae6-4493-a285-20cb0c05eab6">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e2e8f575-820c-4981-9c6a-eae7c75c759a">
      <Text>Ryan, what is it?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0ba39e79-0aa8-41ad-b4d2-f39b4c2b57ab">
      <Text>Ryan </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="882d6d4b-fb82-484a-a800-b6d02b97ad42">
      <Text>I made the team. I’m going to the Olympics. I’ve been invited to go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fd68ad23-f3e6-461f-85bf-ebfccee62910">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e49a9e46-c6d8-4e2c-a2a1-dd47c3f51955">
      <Text>Oh, that’s amazing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0da0f10a-5685-4e5a-8a3b-3f8cc56efc81">
      <Text>Nella hugs him... He doesn’t return the embrace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4daa31b3-3d22-40ee-81c1-a17eb4bdc729">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="12071068-59c8-4903-99d4-2c6a92b48dd6">
      <Text>I don’t know... What am I thinking? I’m going to get killed. And I don’t mean hyperbole, I mean I could actually get killed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bc6e4da1-8cda-40b3-8e30-e7d4a8fb74a7">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="51f56434-1acb-4e6e-9eaa-ed7886219f85">
      <Text>Age is just a number. Did you tell me that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3fee8fe8-0bbd-4c77-bfa4-340e9026e4d3">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cf634b51-ab26-458c-9a83-3464664d03e3">
      <Text>I kept telling myself that... but I... I don’t think I really believe it. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="94a627ba-4c46-4565-8abe-09ac8b2003f6">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="11510065-184d-45ec-bcea-0bac12415cb7">
      <Text>Come. Sit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b7a6300a-5148-4335-b10e-53296680196a">
      <Text>They sit on the couch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fbbe9d20-70ad-4d77-821b-b1389b4f6e65">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="04efdf5e-2c70-43cc-86f0-413c7ee460bf">
      <Text>You could decline.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="04e8a9e4-308d-471c-9a94-7092d90f7775">
      <Text>Ryan nods. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="27455199-8c5f-4aad-a603-96f3bbf8141a">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c54714a7-5f2f-4153-8044-db7a6365e566">
      <Text>I could. I should.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d32ba5c5-031c-4eac-a486-654e0718c7c9">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c3413f63-3b16-4580-95ac-9165edd498ee">
      <Text>But?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e379941f-7983-418a-910d-c32af268242b">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5e6c9590-2480-4c01-99dc-010156f889da">
      <Text>I’d spend the rest of my life wondering why I passed on a once in a lifetime chance, in my one and only lifetime.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8648c4ec-28f9-4548-8c8f-45fcc242e908">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eb8fa635-2ccf-44b9-9926-6824335324be">
      <Text>Then you should follow the dream that’s been following you. Maybe you can start to believe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b83dc640-95e1-442f-a500-09509734eaeb">
      <Text>Ryan kisses her, and she kisses him back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="56ffb16d-3194-4ba5-be8d-041f4f94b5c8">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="caeb9869-c329-4bd3-8f1b-522ac8033fe4">
      <Text>I think I am falling for you, Miss Nella.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="00d080b6-fbda-4c1e-9df6-0e4b2a5c3e91">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9114eae2-25e3-466a-b38d-325f206ed256">
      <Text>Good. Fall for me and not your opponents.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="82761d4f-e134-498f-aff0-c0e9eacbc12b">
      <Text>Ryan smiles...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5bdbbfeb-522b-46c7-bc02-abd236c93d8b">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c4731eff-24bc-4495-adb2-649ec118a6e1">
      <Text>That was good. I see what you did there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f85c5344-68a2-4d08-a041-5c97bf890326">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="83bbd7e1-dbfb-4292-9735-aedd0bc90c63">
      <Text>It’s an ice breaker.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f2ba11d4-888c-4ef6-a201-eeaca9eef6f2">
      <Text>He kisses her again. Passionately. He pulls back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="229ec178-b0a6-4d4d-8f84-6d3bbc1bd644">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="faed277b-30af-4f7c-b3f0-38cc0b8c802e">
      <Text>I need to get to the dojo. If I am doing this, I am NOT doing it half-assed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f4c764e0-edec-47fd-966a-c242c18d91a4">
      <Text>Ryan hops off the couch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Shot" id="a83ccdb7-98d5-46c5-810c-3d048f36bb6b">
      <Text>Montage:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="31afe6cb-c0fb-4850-9a17-f26d33908ce2">
      <Text>1) INT. BURUNDI DOJO - Ryan and Chantal take turns throwing all the other students on a crash pad. Daniel, arm in cast still watches. Joseph gives a pointer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7349cf65-d0d6-4a20-9640-ca1d3e9e1920">
      <Text>2) Chantal carries Ryan up a flight of steep stairs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ae188cd1-409f-4e4a-912a-d81116638f8d">
      <Text>3) Ryan carries Chantal up a flight of steep stairs. Daniel slowly follows, arm still in the cast.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b403777-4376-4599-9d91-4aa8c16de7ad">
      <Text>4) Ryan and Chantal randori with the students - one after another. Daniel’s cast is off, an angry red scar on his elbow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8323f50f-5fa5-4489-a8b7-0965e94c5496">
      <Text>5) Ryan, Chantal, Daniel at the gym. Sensei Joseph holds a stopwatch as they do pull-ups with a weight belt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2d0bfffc-ad45-4c3e-828c-9a4858c15f82">
      <Text>6) Ryan at Nella’s. She’s asleep in bed. He’s doing push-ups on the floor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="1d02a56d-babd-4887-b11a-0fcba4b82baa">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="88" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DANIEL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Bujumbura AIRPORT - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a15ce143-b870-4d9c-a0a5-f8ae608da1f0">
      <Text>Ryan, Chantal, Sensei Joseph all wear Burundi team sport coats. They stand among another thirty athletes from the Burundi Olympic team.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5d49062f-e54b-468f-9b45-1e5333b2784b">
      <Text>Nella, Daniel, Elvis, Mama, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jeane</Text>
      <Text>, Jean-Claude, Eric, Tiny, Darci, Montel, Tiny, Donna, Tiny, Tommy, and Aaron have come to see them off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4ad2ee0d-9cdc-4720-a7fa-5ed01d27beeb">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bb3eb1d5-fc2f-40fd-b085-0ce4bdb34042">
      <Text>I want to say how proud I am of all of you. You’re a big part of why, for the first time in my career I have not one, but two students competing in the Olympics. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="af514077-d379-4a96-9da8-0acd0404c15e">
      <Text>They CHEER. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c9464826-a511-4ca2-99ef-65da8d73ef6e">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a3aa8e54-cdff-4ee7-bae9-2440b05ea3b8">
      <Text>Daniel... Nella...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="616a3703-2b0e-42c9-bd6b-41d46ed65162">
      <Text>Ryan motions them to step away from the throng.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0d74e6fa-084e-43c4-8123-f6d3fef18617">
      <Text>He hands them each an envelope.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="887fa036-3333-4078-9008-553befcab34e">
      <Text>DANIEL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0bed82be-c7c8-4b78-8507-dbbac463011b">
      <Text>What is this?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dbd38209-75d1-42e2-86f6-e604a594a6c7">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ef43c8ed-440a-4c82-92db-62dcc10087d8">
      <Text>Chantal is an amazing judoka, but more than that she’s an amazing person. I couldn’t stand the idea that you won’t be there to see her fight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e5fae05b-b21e-4f1c-8c97-57ef25d1eecd">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eaa5910f-123a-4be5-a308-8d45bec4ba06">
      <Text>What did you do?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="751d3f39-bddb-4a78-9ca1-ecd3f8b39669">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b1a4b69a-4249-4ea2-b27a-b7db06125b42">
      <Text>It’s hotel, air, and tickets to the two days we fight. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d65cb200-088d-44be-87ef-b1ef5fa11ad5">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d69d1398-e38d-4535-b8c2-010811eac00b">
      <Text>How can you afford this? I know what we pay you and...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="064c3213-7c2a-419a-8070-148404c991d7">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="293c65dc-d587-4dba-8397-bf4f7c0e3d15">
      <Text>I know you do. But I can’t think of anything I’d rather spend my money on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="534a4aa8-3754-4976-b0b1-b180ef87b4ac">
      <Text>Daniel</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d240b352-1e41-4c5f-90d0-61b62eb2467c">
      <Text>How can I thank you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="80777ce6-5fd5-4a18-a93e-7937e0e3c6c3">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="47d98ed1-4def-486b-bbb5-27bd1f6cf994">
      <Text>Cheer loudly?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e443854a-545a-4592-8417-0bb3bf06d1e8">
      <Text>Daniel grabs him in a bear hug. He then runs over to Chantal... As he explains what Ryan has done, Chantal looks at him in awe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="af520157-f193-4d20-aac1-272ea6e9b9c9">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e325ff51-7f53-488e-850a-6b4862ed8735">
      <Text>I want you there for me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cfbabecc-6b1a-4ff7-92e6-e374a8dc0394">
      <Text>In response, Nella kisses Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="780a2284-1da9-4d34-9294-c5444d5e80e8">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ac2fa4b3-2f4b-441b-82aa-b2b5ff715411">
      <Text>Time to go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="06f286b0-278d-49ee-9a95-d9ec48ab9686">
      <Text>He kisses Nella again and picks up his duffel and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> bag. Chantal, Sensei Joseph, and Ryan go into the terminal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="7167e6fe-51ec-4142-a9b9-b731913ed430">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="89" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. Westwood olympic village - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4e58654e-9552-40e2-a8ee-f3fcb0e9dc13">
      <Text>A line weaves out the door. Ryan, Sensei Joseph, and Chantal wait their turn to go through security, metal detectors, bag search, and check in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="884c96a7-4008-4384-91dd-bdf7fd1d769d">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="89" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NIKEME">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Westwood OLYMPIC VILLAGE - dorm - ryan’s room - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="09aedbd2-2731-42d7-8c8e-e7cbde3caddb">
      <Text>Ryan unlocks the door and enters. He’s face to belly with </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NIKEMBE</Text>
      <Text> from the African Union Basketball team.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c90e1dfc-b008-4609-843b-ef88dd6f5e15">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Nikeme</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="643ee94b-af90-4aac-9959-aa76b6f746d1">
      <Text>Are you lost?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0405fbc7-74f1-49c1-8dd1-1e1b1ac611d6">
      <Text>Ryan sets his bag down on the empty side of the room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="85a31c11-be21-4df6-87d2-f64e55ae6e00">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2fde0810-e221-497d-9b71-584a84062789">
      <Text>No, I’m Ryan. I’m on the judo team.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ea15c8c4-fe9c-4c9c-8f91-ee3f645b1110">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Nikeme</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="65f8cce3-dd30-4499-9d5e-43e4605fd543">
      <Text>Coach?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="819d1fb5-192d-4e9b-96b8-b048dde4ab65">
      <Text>Ryan shakes his head. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bd77a7ba-48ea-4b2f-8d39-2b1640452f49">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Nikeme</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5c56560d-393e-42f0-9720-f995c7ae35c2">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Nikembe</Text>
      <Text>. Basketball.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="80e07018-31cf-460c-9d0f-033cd84c3384">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b4f01b46-2f3f-4a22-95d5-41dd2b3a7042">
      <Text>That would have been my first guess. I hope you have earplugs. My ex-wife swore I snored... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="87969329-c2eb-464f-bdc7-e794bde8c4ce">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">NIKEME</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="418f9c51-baff-4069-941d-2c262a535cdc">
      <Text>Do you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2fb4d8d7-2485-4d92-b5dc-ffa305918d6d">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f7e4b846-5bea-416f-83f2-b99ce622d49f">
      <Text>I don’t know. I’ve always slept through it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2a808a5b-2db9-41a3-b5a5-4e2fba4fba68">
      <Text>There’s a knock on the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a0aa7eca-8c43-4c31-b7be-bfdd0e9e7c13">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fff21197-a770-46a3-8e82-69dd37dce3e6">
      <Text>Sensei wants us to go to the venue and do a light workout. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="14fb1466-a583-4865-9842-0e8b0ad039a5">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="15fb071b-4a16-440b-809f-219ef77237db">
      <Text>I’ll be right there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="7e63c989-a9f2-423e-818e-01a2ec01ad93">
      <Text>(in </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Kurundi</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d28de855-c62c-4fd4-9552-7055b150e5c3">
      <Text>Nice meeting you. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1e8ac8b6-5e3f-44ea-a864-1ca399d303e1">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Nikeme</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ee71e439-c302-41f4-be83-edcaeb6f6dbd">
      <Text>You too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7f7840ac-c8dd-4f2f-8cf8-08e2be7395e7">
      <Text>Ryan grabs his </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> from the duffel and his ID bag. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="00167a12-176d-441d-baa2-679e1f584e1b">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="90" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. La convention center - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="12cd59df-60ac-46e7-8ae1-603209cf0de9">
      <Text>The jumbotron says “LA WELCOMES THE WORLD TO THE 2028 OLYMPIC GAMES.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="8e39411d-fda4-4809-831a-133536cb915e">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="90" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. LA CONVENTION CENTER - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="25fc652b-d6b2-4a06-a52e-3373bab3d771">
      <Text>Two official mats command the center of the massive convention floor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="56571e03-d22b-4c82-9706-d3e325cc4794">
      <Text>Four practice mats are setup behind the bleachers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="726fd57f-1ac0-462b-ac87-9047ce50be42">
      <Text>Chantal and Ryan trade </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">uchi-komi</Text>
      <Text> as Sensei Joseph times them. They have broken a decent sweat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="adedf811-a2e5-4658-830e-3a4ff87634fd">
      <Text>SenSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="90a09143-8d5d-4493-9522-9f9effd00e1b">
      <Text>Time!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="73ef0cd7-4e99-440c-bd96-4edc35fbaade">
      <Text>They jog over to Joseph.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fd49f83b-4f2e-47fe-97a8-e85071e0fef5">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1d78d168-8622-44f9-80ce-faf751f98835">
      <Text>How are you feeling?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="29c762b2-b053-4da3-8031-b925d4c81825">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b835bdc9-0abf-43b0-9edb-1facda961de9">
      <Text>Good. Nervous, but good.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="64041d36-4f67-4a07-a555-c83da75d73be">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f53430a6-34c8-4ca1-b2f9-c02b17d0a533">
      <Text>Your weight?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b0d4450a-e588-4cdc-a0a3-5fb32ea7cca4">
      <Text>CHANTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="48609bf6-639e-41d9-bc06-d8f937329a01">
      <Text>A quarter kilo under.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="af96d138-19df-49cc-b273-ce450a27fe70">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2b7d9a5f-0667-4bbf-8e41-539936c6b9fa">
      <Text>Perfect.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a27815f6-76a8-4c18-9158-0df6112c088a">
      <Text>Joseph turns to Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3b5d0910-5f0f-4e0d-9b7c-04af46e5002d">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="068c4532-6359-4273-a713-2a18e3e3f2a1">
      <Text>Half a kilo over.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="89ac1012-7fb3-4d7f-a7ed-062f7328243c">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d4c7745c-2eff-4bc5-8ab7-1f13191324c9">
      <Text>That’s good. You have two days until weigh in. Plenty of time.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4cf43ff8-1a29-458e-aa47-8112811efd86">
      <Text>Ryan nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aa8bb108-e6ad-4267-97ef-457531aefdc0">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="66155369-8b09-4abe-83be-d4a6799420ac">
      <Text>And how are you feeling?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e542bb6c-171a-4495-9365-60afd8cfb4c2">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="016473f5-7ae0-415f-a7db-ce0cc1383004">
      <Text>Bewitched, bothered, bewildered... but mostly. Thankful.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cab89b56-c332-49fc-8b61-e3da6f140b0a">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ee0cad7b-1675-418d-ae59-5d62c523fcae">
      <Text>Let’s get back for dinner... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="55dde9fc-4a4f-4a28-b895-1fdd77efde2c">
      <Text>(to Ryan)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9b72b038-920d-430b-83ae-6cdab8e9fbd7">
      <Text>Not you. Just her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="59fced01-9ba8-4bf2-b901-8a8ed1f5a81a">
      <Text>Ryan hesitates then follows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="00d294fd-5a57-4de0-933b-9a182a9d53f1">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="673fc489-012b-4987-924d-4125ccc5e33b">
      <Text>I can eat a little.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="25c5783a-fae6-4faa-8540-0f22bf1b55a5">
      <Text>They head for the exit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="8f39d70f-ef41-4455-af56-cb9cbc32a1af">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="91" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. WESTWOOD OLYMPIC VILLAGE - DORM - RYAN'S ROOM - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="18bbbf85-0aa7-4cf9-b381-50dddf0ea494">
      <Text>Ryan stares at the ceiling. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Nikembe</Text>
      <Text> SNORES contentedly. Ryan grabs his cell phone and turns it on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a13a93cd-8579-4041-a7dd-3ba44fc70663">
      <Text>He thumbs through his texts until he finds “SARAH.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9c22424e-257e-4b73-ab34-edaca8f47cc6">
      <Text>Ryan types, “Thought you might want to know I am back in LA and competing in the Olympics. You were there when the dream died... Thought you might want to know that there’s an ember that survived.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a89e9804-e77f-4965-bc6f-a58b76585440">
      <Text>His finger hovers over the send button. After a moment, he places the phone down without sending the text.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="164cbe44-80ab-4e19-94a3-d568803bcb75">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="92" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. La COLISEUM - the opening ceremonies - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="659929fc-af8e-48f3-a180-06fb40d6b952">
      <Text>The parade of nations. The spectacle and performances, and pageantry of the opening ceremonies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="f0dc13ff-64b3-4f7a-94b9-234c8aaa230c">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="92" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ANNOUNCER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. La coliseum - Entry tunnel - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="36ea0b08-f2ec-43ee-968a-d3fc796c952e">
      <Text>Ryan and Chantal stand with another half-dozen athletes, Sensei Joseph, and two other coaches. They wear colorful AFRICAN uniforms. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7162f3f2-bd56-4b06-8d2e-b42f0c17d99a">
      <Text>ANNOUNCER (O.C.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="25248643-d481-4168-96f6-124f2ec5b8a9">
      <Text>BURKINA FASO.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="71ce82a7-a45f-4b8f-aa27-5a587101b894">
      <Text>The ten team members and the four coaches from Burkina Faso walk out into the stadium followed by Ryan, Chantal, Sensei Joseph and the Burundi Olympic Team.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c615a773-ed73-48be-aa44-52021ab3d4ed">
      <Text>Announcer (O.C.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="15a40963-a411-41d1-b2d8-2a0cd7526e9c">
      <Text>BURUNDI.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d173d603-02bd-4b11-ac61-36e7c3cd1a60">
      <Text>Ryan and Chantal enter the stadium.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="a5a552af-b388-4e38-8e2a-90dd3ae964d8">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="92" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="KRISTY COVENTRY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Ext. La colISEUM - THE OPENING CEREMONIES - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="48fc1b49-a3d2-4516-b69f-ed94ebcb5d14">
      <Text>The track is filled with the marching teams. The CROWD of 90,000 spectators fills the stands. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8b6b14ae-a9e6-41bd-9214-b32b217d83e2">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="88432f1a-5bdb-40ec-90cd-5eeb8f76c085">
      <Text>Oh... my... god...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a718764d-64fb-443e-9eec-4c82faef312d">
      <Text>Ryan’s overwhelmed with emotion. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fc060830-ecf4-4c9d-940d-557bf972e52e">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8b79011e-f213-4b2d-9193-cf1068f65b9b">
      <Text>Are you okay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f249df43-65bb-4a4b-90f2-4f3f6d15106e">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e31aab31-7e5a-48c5-a91d-86b4a9121520">
      <Text>Living the dream... I just can’t believe I’m really here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f0e8c463-30d8-488d-9146-2ad2d72c03bf">
      <Text>Chantal hits him in the shoulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b2ab9291-54d6-4da5-bc62-cd47851a6897">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e7569295-ccbb-488a-b9e3-e878283d30d5">
      <Text>Ouch!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6a535b49-255b-44fc-909a-ff1da0a2a562">
      <Text>Chantal smiles...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3d8061b5-c73d-4d19-95e4-87116eb30ab9">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="abc06df2-c4d0-4ac5-b35c-9a60edfef447">
      <Text>Damn, girl.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ee07f369-bd35-4af3-bb80-5ba43c718a48">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ab445cfa-bc00-4469-87dd-4f5ee1382a71">
      <Text>You’re here now, Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="64e49b35-12c4-4736-abca-6d4bf4286a4b">
      <Text>Ryan walks to the infield where Burundi joins the other countries forming the patchwork of flags and colors.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="db9975cd-d31e-4258-bc47-f09ac13420c3">
      <Text>MONTAGE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ca259de3-f552-446e-a949-fc757af35725">
      <Text>1) Kristy Coventry addresses the athletes:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b30334b6-1fd0-49b5-9c41-15cab4feed42">
      <Text>KRISTY COVENTRY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1d73bd68-6cde-4f1e-a754-7aa9a521797f">
      <Text>I now declare that these, the thirty-fourth Olympic games, are officially open.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="821d8961-4b1b-45f0-9ccb-fc8777db2165">
      <Text>2) Taylor Swift performs</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="97771369-929c-425f-a6cf-6786ada92c36">
      <Text>3) Snoop Dog performs</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e38110cb-4ba7-49e1-a7f2-63010c112640">
      <Text>4) A dance and acrobatic team performs...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="607e28e3-cf3a-404e-a95b-b4198d1263fc">
      <Text>5) The Athletes march off the field</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b277cf55-7cf0-4a05-bfd6-c777d570806c">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="93" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. la COLISEUM - THE OPENING CEREMONIES - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6530af5e-87d7-49e6-b50f-ef61f06b7c4d">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph walks to where Ryan and Chantal soak in the wanning festivities.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7708f539-beb7-4c2a-ade7-6151271f8ef0">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="337356a5-8b98-460c-8aa0-9ec26892c764">
      <Text>Come. Let’s get some rest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="04ddbc7f-323e-4fa2-94e3-37fe91949a49">
      <Text>Ryan nods, still plainly awestruck.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="c8803f14-bcd0-4cf2-b3e2-a15fd862bc76">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="93" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. westwOOD OLYMPIC VILLAGE - DORM - RYAN'S ROOM - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fe79c176-d5c7-4c53-8841-97cd0b222f06">
      <Text>Ryan lies in bed, staring at the ceiling, the shadows look like judokas grappling... as he stares the shadows move taking him to --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="996c0186-faf1-4ad0-9864-ca3b12f24f31">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="93" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. OLYMPIC TRAINING CENTER - FLASHBACK - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="440feaa0-534a-434e-9e13-62d4afbe8937">
      <Text>Ryan fighting for an Olympic berth against Kevin Asano... He enters a throw, there’s a LOUD pop... he goes down, holding his knee in anguish.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0b07e896-e0dd-4b98-9f5f-1d8cd2be4cda">
      <Text>The throw, the pop... the knee... over and over that image runs on a loop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="5320ff78-97d3-41f0-9947-b3605ae44a21">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="94" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WEIGH-IN OFFICIAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WEIGH-IN SUPERVISOR">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. la cONVENTION CENTER - weigh-in - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e1396791-87b2-44d5-848c-5834a187733a">
      <Text>Ryan at the front of a line with a large room filled with officials and scales.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="93c34826-b878-45be-ae1c-96cead80c025">
      <Text>Ryan hands the official at the table his passport.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="321c51cc-144b-49b6-9cec-3a78e4d7ae4d">
      <Text>Weigh-in official</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a8466182-733b-4c35-a1da-f90e43e4df13">
      <Text>Are you a coach?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="398d2657-ccdc-460d-b25f-83a531084f86">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bb7c7f88-f280-440e-8e36-91c3e3701ee8">
      <Text>Competitor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c14f29eb-967e-4d57-9f57-15426701a72d">
      <Text>The official raises an eyebrow. A SUPERVISOR looks at Ryan’s passport. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d567c55e-b2de-4234-a5a4-99c5b51c8af1">
      <Text>WEIGH-IN supervisor</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f9b9c6e8-94cb-42b6-8321-1c7ba276b9f5">
      <Text>No joke?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="26ccc37b-d679-44c1-adb4-6efd06b15cd2">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d2caf475-218c-4650-b150-fc28bb042dfd">
      <Text>The joke is bagel...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5bc4d12a-3887-421a-a4a1-22bc722c4d6c">
      <Text>WEIGH-IN SUPERVISOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d14bd4bc-a868-45db-9595-c17e879b850d">
      <Text>Sorry?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="30810895-b2f6-4375-a1c8-11ec4041c180">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d1e3c458-cc66-4173-8af9-e1052a37caa6">
      <Text>No joke. I am competing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d45ba57c-7a68-48de-8952-e2aacde07824">
      <Text>He steps on the scale.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="039d8cdf-f16a-4568-83fd-0165817edca6">
      <Text>Weigh-in official</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a79804b5-67ad-43fe-91ca-31eaf4bf3f58">
      <Text>Fifty-nine point nine-five kilos.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="53229aad-bd2b-4315-aa6d-9bb1c9282827">
      <Text>Ryan makes a fist. He’s made weight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ee8e93de-c863-4d74-bf48-b22893cf4e44">
      <Text>He puts his Burundi team sweats back on and meets Sensei Joseph in the hallway.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0087e53b-8af9-40b2-acd1-b3ab347ecb64">
      <Text>SenSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a4a9bfb3-676a-4128-92e2-e4948ee4a6fa">
      <Text>All good?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aaf282be-509e-4545-bfd3-ca25a647f6e7">
      <Text>RyaN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8a34b0c8-ffdb-4231-a193-3a65f942be18">
      <Text>No sweat. I mean, some sweat. A lot of sweat, but I was under. Let’s go eat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4f8b8fe5-adf5-4444-89c8-20e870af5dff">
      <Text>WeIGH-IN SUPERVISOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3240778d-612b-4cad-bd2e-a9c5fd545ce1">
      <Text>Excuse me! Mr. Cutler.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="736f9a98-f332-4082-a5c1-6ec1fdd85978">
      <Text>Ryan turns.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6a5acc2a-9f21-4423-a07a-1bccf22c5e45">
      <Text>WeigH-IN SUPERVISOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bcb4f615-e648-4297-80b1-0830f2df0046">
      <Text>Would you come with me please?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="81db42cd-792c-4455-98d6-a01691d46e39">
      <Text>SeNSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="91b8e450-4eb9-4f6d-95c5-49f72112a43c">
      <Text>What is this about?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6bdd0403-f9af-4d03-a3c2-dace63e753bb">
      <Text>The supervisor looks him over...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f8b7b7d8-7c1e-40a2-9c05-f920ce8d4b23">
      <Text>WEIGH-IN SUPERVISOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="315a90b6-3e24-4100-b5e3-7f031cc5ea15">
      <Text>You are...?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="49b30fe6-cfd1-4e7d-95c8-a92b61cad97e">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="694bccd3-ce42-4ce6-9cfc-554a4264ab35">
      <Text>His coach.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6ef81fb6-1f6b-4e69-97ae-2dafd9d7f336">
      <Text>WEIGH-IN SUPERVISOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1fdb4f20-2b84-4c05-9549-38b1b89aa2cc">
      <Text>Good, you come too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3323306c-46ee-4e43-ba47-6cab2a42c7d2">
      <Text>Ryan and Joseph share a look.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="51413332-4469-42bb-8ff6-893a725963a8">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="95" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="IFJ OFFICIAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="IJF OFFICIAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. la convention center - meeting room - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ae90eaf8-af4a-45b1-acac-4f63f4efe6d0">
      <Text>Ryan and Sensei Joseph enter the meeting room to find a panel of International Judo Federation officials staring at them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4a0eb944-b004-4a4c-b759-1581d93b5cdc">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ifj</Text>
      <Text> official</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2deace12-969d-47b5-b773-1d3078872249">
      <Text>Which of you is Ryan Cutler?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="02b33308-34e6-4d89-b085-047d91943b29">
      <Text>Ryan steps forward.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b934fe4e-19c0-4ae0-933a-78a63ad8b9c4">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2e648125-c082-48d1-9234-d7535b84d2e5">
      <Text>Is there a problem?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f1a2376a-10a6-49c4-89d5-fe8fd1dc4129">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ijf</Text>
      <Text> official</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1e9b5485-4d87-4743-9451-9827f24fb117">
      <Text>No... not at all. We have some concerns --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f9dc665d-db21-47ee-9af5-acbf733779fa">
      <Text>SenSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d8b98874-6be0-4fcd-91c1-1228036a7a0d">
      <Text>About what?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="24036065-171d-4d86-8a66-bf1f3a0b729c">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ijf</Text>
      <Text> official</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dc76fb29-0685-427a-93c8-251db4fe9b44">
      <Text>There are questions... considerations... well, concerns because of his age...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0d5ea4ed-78cd-4a3f-8f10-802a9d1136fb">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="64038c33-0640-456b-a00c-8a483da90b8f">
      <Text>There is no upper age limit for competitors in the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">IJF</Text>
      <Text>. He qualified, he was chosen by the IJF. He’s been approved to compete, and he just made weight... so if there’s nothing else...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b2be38c5-feb8-4694-b564-039d8d64d82e">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ijf</Text>
      <Text> official</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5589f0bc-89a2-4904-97c4-8dbbdca00eca">
      <Text>There IS something else. We find that his medical clearance leaves some questions and out of an abundance of caution and concern for his safety we are requesting that Mr. Cutler submit to a medical exam tomorrow at 10 am.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b6ab5ba0-fbe4-45c1-b64c-514d074183f2">
      <Text>ANOTHER OFFICIAL hands Joseph a document with the instructions. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5bcd1f3d-5f5f-4b2c-8a05-186e1570eda2">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ccd24f50-5d7c-4914-a5b7-0e1709586591">
      <Text>I passed a medical exam.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="708eedd0-effc-4447-be22-7f0d81331c1e">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ijf</Text>
      <Text> official</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="860e0f82-1b8b-4d3c-8695-beef247468d5">
      <Text>This is the condition we require.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="60656f24-7044-4f09-8723-c863058c10cf">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c8725f79-09b8-4c15-8691-edc369eb37ee">
      <Text>This is bull--</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d3dcb3eb-248c-4c86-bb99-933f7cc6466f">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="373f6c66-95bf-4e0e-9ea0-9abe082bcb58">
      <Text>We will be there at 10 am.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3c45d22c-cb81-43a2-8356-885e31e136d8">
      <Text>They turn on their heels and exit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="6cf48fec-82ca-426b-868a-91dc1dbc3d65">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="96" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. La convention center - hallway - nighT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eab42d60-6f06-460a-aae6-666bb5a569d0">
      <Text>Ryan fumes, Sensei Joseph folds the paper.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="13d5ddaf-4461-4f2e-ba04-ff4a36b266a4">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="95bc4a72-da32-4647-85cf-b85259b88ce0">
      <Text>What the hell was that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="481c157a-2837-485c-a954-677c1d502ecc">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7748308f-2435-404f-8c9e-cb8ad270a1a0">
      <Text>They can try. You passed before you’ll pass again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cbe29b00-ac3c-41cd-a2dc-be2d09f9060b">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph lets that hang in the air.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="d4a463ce-a66e-46c6-b6ee-21609abd5241">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="96" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DOCTOR">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. La cONVENTION CENTER - exam room - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fba564d5-1e74-4385-8edb-4bcb0d4fdcc9">
      <Text>A DOCTOR examines Ryan. Has a stethoscope, listening to Ryan’s chest. He has a blood pressure sleeve on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2857589f-030c-4fe6-9553-1655c3be5b07">
      <Text>Doctor</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d1f16cc2-75d9-46ee-aba5-596feeb09738">
      <Text>Deep breath. Let it out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="43b2148e-0ee2-46da-accd-abf65af26b19">
      <Text>The Doctor pulls the sleeve off of Ryan’s arm. An </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">IJF</Text>
      <Text> official watches intently. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="944a26da-ffbb-4f7a-afc2-d27043695a56">
      <Text>Doctor</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d8021aa0-f94f-43ca-bcc2-a28d3242f62d">
      <Text>Blood pressure is good. Lungs are clear. You appear to be in good condition, but I do have some concerns.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7980c6c9-4a8f-4f90-85f6-29c511d72119">
      <Text>The Doctor glances at the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">IJF</Text>
      <Text> official. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b5f43aa4-7ddb-4eca-97ad-af4ca722f28a">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f8c4a696-bc40-4755-b74e-c01ee75ed925">
      <Text>Concerns?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b1cc32d1-4872-4981-b469-c10c3e0008ac">
      <Text>DOCTOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="a378665a-534f-48d6-8faf-acd44eaa6b3d">
      <Text>(glancing)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="885c4cf3-8e26-4687-b48f-6f2fc8a11e34">
      <Text>We need to see what the blood work shows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="adf35c46-1736-4ae2-93e5-0afcecb88c95">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1eab60de-3f79-4fa8-9e89-b31e4bc48fad">
      <Text>How old are you, doc?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4384db77-8a0e-4265-ba54-db7da6b84a0e">
      <Text>DOCTOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="79649215-1c30-4566-827e-c6b1d0777505">
      <Text>Me? Fifty-three. Why?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aaa616d1-70d2-411a-b009-d6f631f5d83e">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f2946559-25df-4426-9473-b6e1ef14a9ed">
      <Text>What if, in ten years, they decide you shouldn’t practice medicine any more? Not because your skills have eroded, not because you are making errors, just because your not fifty-three anymore?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d98fb9b5-3904-4429-8167-81f4b22a5015">
      <Text>DOCTOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2bcc4761-953a-4ae8-9dae-4773dd96a04b">
      <Text>I’m just dong the exam...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d66afa06-ff4b-4526-b3e2-f07dc662cfd3">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="d1a7f2c9-2394-4ca6-b752-82b5b4483780">
      <Text>(leaning in)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="73cfd916-a0fe-48b4-bee8-31a9e4157e1e">
      <Text>They told you to get me out because of my age. They told you I was too old. Maybe they are worried about liability, I don’t know, but I passed the medical, I qualified for this tournament. I deserve to be here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c0050a81-648e-4103-986c-3dc44bb7569c">
      <Text>The Doctor glances again at the official. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a45484a5-1f38-41f9-80b5-3aa6c25ef139">
      <Text>DOCTOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="490ba84f-7383-41a2-a65e-a18f7bb53576">
      <Text>We will have everything back in the morning. You can get dressed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="accbc912-cf37-4c26-bff9-2d87f23cb50a">
      <Text>Ryan puts his shirt on, defeated, unsure. He heads for the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e24ebf5d-41b7-4dd8-a7cf-0d206d1de0e3">
      <Text>Doctor</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e395eb1e-3f75-46f7-8246-97840b355e73">
      <Text>Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2000ba84-06c2-406a-bd4a-c36df1a78f4f">
      <Text>Ryan turns back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f3824891-6ac8-4b76-9f8f-3e13ee715195">
      <Text>DOCTOR</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c038d256-c961-4b87-8e6d-437e32b4ff26">
      <Text>I will be a better doctor in ten years. Good luck to you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c367e1c3-f2e8-4347-81cf-c2f4f3927637">
      <Text>Ryan acknowledges the Doctor and goes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="c2819c5e-e0a0-4ba1-8f4c-e680bee946d2">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="98" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. wESTWOOD OLYMPIC VILLAGE - DORM - RYAN'S ROOM - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="83513ff0-2b3c-4cd9-9cbd-74abd037a4fe">
      <Text>It’s 7 am in the morning. Ryan stretches quietly as </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Nikembe</Text>
      <Text> SNORES. His </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> has been laid out with a pile of tape, wraps, knee pads, and his black belt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c138a988-c347-4b05-a555-683772e33407">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph knocks on the door. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0afeff93-4860-49ec-8d9d-91b69094311a">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="9037269d-10ea-4c19-a22e-2565c18f631d">
      <Text>(whispering)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="65f5e8d6-eafa-4555-be47-44c7abf3f379">
      <Text>The results are back from the doctor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d87c51b8-c0f6-4cb0-90f9-516a3ee62fc5">
      <Text>Ryan waits. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="14867096-94d3-402c-9aba-26a053e2a1c8">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="311fc5b9-1eaf-40a5-8bf1-e5f2c96ecbbc">
      <Text>(wide grin)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="444b4842-99f9-4999-bfc5-3e8aa5ad6353">
      <Text>Time to kick some butt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d6a3c00f-4d9c-4efb-a35e-93e1f4739b59">
      <Text>Ryan silently celebrates and stuffs his things into his </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text>-bag.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="7b4a0ed0-af86-4341-9e00-59b41336a1b5">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 4/8" Page="98" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ANNOUNCER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LEO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NEIL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. La CONVENTION CENTER - main hall - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0dfdf3e1-21af-4c0d-8e65-0f8fbeca3cd1">
      <Text>Four tatami mats are laid out on the floor of the convention center. Bleachers, filled with spectators surround the mats. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1949e8da-fb06-4de9-962e-540788eeeea6">
      <Text>Announcer (v.o.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3e29e3d6-57b0-4ef5-b1c6-3e1fe522283f">
      <Text>Ladies and gentlemen, welcome to the first day of these 34th Olympic Judo competition.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a2b10d5c-a766-4ded-8d98-9b7823a56f02">
      <Text>The CROWD ROARS. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="03118215-22d8-4041-8c93-ae657a3cdb68">
      <Text>Announcer</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1d85777e-c610-43e2-bd3b-1d52e318e4c3">
      <Text>On mat one, we have the men’s 60 kilogram division...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7964378b-3b41-4670-95da-51339165a1aa">
      <Text>As the announcer continues... Neil Adams and Leo White, dressed in suits and ties stand with the mats behind them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6afeb79c-32cc-48d5-aea6-77482c2f19bf">
      <Text>Neil</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7d0e2ad2-2f72-4e2e-93e3-306d9271b56a">
      <Text>Hello everyone one. We’re once again back on the biggest stage in the judo world... or in any world the Los Angeles Olympic Games.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d47a6c3c-2e88-4e33-aecd-875ad9c36e82">
      <Text>He turns to Leo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3ff955ed-91d7-4c09-9365-b72e963411a7">
      <Text>Neil</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="918a11be-b77c-4002-ad2e-9ed8c58f8f3b">
      <Text>I am pleased to be here with two time Olympic Judoka, Leo White... Leo, you were in the now defunct under 95 kilo division, and today we have the lightweights.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1f24eb58-a56f-4e68-9ee4-3879b24c77e3">
      <Text>Leo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="491a09fb-4995-412f-9406-8b495a8ef93c">
      <Text>That’s right. Today it’s 60 kilos for the men, and 48 kilos for the women... And we can expect some intense matches... The Japanese are the favorites, but there’s a number of serious threats.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="36f37316-0b94-4c02-9852-8d7095c7cf64">
      <Text>NEIL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="469151a2-ef9f-48b7-951a-9625c7397714">
      <Text>Including Jonathan Yang from the United States a former Cadet and Junior world champion. And on the other end of the spectrum is the competitor from Burundi, Ryan Cutler.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9289305a-5df5-48c9-9296-a684f5e8b636">
      <Text>LEO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5afa9139-b612-4b4c-9ca2-2bf5a07b4099">
      <Text>Ryan was a top athlete when I was competing but he hasn’t been a part of the international scene for almost forty years.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="75168af8-a894-414e-861e-c5353f9d4619">
      <Text>NEIL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f3baad19-79fa-46cd-9137-e03f35b521c2">
      <Text>He is, by all accounting the oldest qualifier ever to compete in Olympic Judo.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b873c0fe-89ad-48d5-aded-5a2b43295c6b">
      <Text>LEO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5cc114ff-e002-4e6f-8c57-f5cdcd063be6">
      <Text>By almost two decades. The oldest person to ever step onto an Olympic Judo mat was Orlando Madrigal who was just shy of his forty-forth birthday when he fought in the 1964 Tokyo Olympics. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="78f54602-b3d2-4916-89e0-4b6c8a3a910f">
      <Text>NEIL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="41f95f5c-c5f7-4a25-8732-2fa1a5c5cebd">
      <Text>The Olympics where judo first appeared.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="123292b7-1547-433c-aa55-5ce875d9a86e">
      <Text>LEO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c8578d73-1b1f-4eca-b412-ecc634b80dab">
      <Text>Ryan will be moving onto the round of 8 with a bye. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9e3d1945-fa51-40fe-8395-b2caa3c84009">
      <Text>NEIL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="63c2922f-8a6f-4624-86fa-289ffb47dd2f">
      <Text>Good for him. I think he’s going to need all the help he can get.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="0ac0befe-d47a-45d2-b065-0aac6dcfa4fe">
      <SceneProperties Length="4 2/8" Page="100" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ANNOUNCER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHANTAL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LEO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NEIL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="THAI REFEREE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VLADAMIR">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. La CONVENTION CENTER - warm-up area - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bd5e0761-daa1-4a89-8fe1-eafedad8c992">
      <Text>Ryan and Chantal take turns entering throws.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b206c1a5-48fd-45e1-b60e-6a436564dd22">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="71875daf-59fc-4198-8da1-9a4dd24898a3">
      <Text>Do you want to throw?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0f99d435-3a0a-4286-a3e0-7ff207bb0366">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6a75c93a-8b28-41bd-a27b-908ac744def0">
      <Text>Not really.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="48e8397a-a7ce-429a-9c7c-a62cad11f247">
      <Text>Chantal shrugs and enters on him. Sensei Joseph approaches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bc838846-4735-482c-8921-3f9dffc0894c">
      <Text>SeNSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0e9bd761-5416-4a7d-a896-35d1078d545f">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Saravenko</Text>
      <Text> won by ippon with </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">urenage</Text>
      <Text>. You will be up against him next.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bbd88875-531d-4ac7-b832-17682eafd23e">
      <Text>Ryan nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f6f35d15-e36c-4a4e-88fd-a1b97e0fe381">
      <Text>Chantal</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="333f630f-b5fb-445d-8ffb-1d3c8aaad422">
      <Text>The Russian’s are strong.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4f706b17-8327-4c06-ae26-5fe22651e542">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="91858731-09f1-4510-9d5f-5665090c7a8f">
      <Text>(sarcastic)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5c7cacda-794f-4c50-95da-81f797aa722c">
      <Text>Oh? Really? You think?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a274db0c-a4eb-4669-8f20-b5f23b038b19">
      <Text>CHANTAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ff21bef4-4eb5-4043-82fb-f9cecba11e0f">
      <Text>Just saying.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5f459968-f103-479b-a2ef-308e7556b102">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bb72bc90-57d6-482d-bae3-6873ac28784e">
      <Text>Now, I want to throw.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b6ddc25b-ffc9-406f-a1d8-1310e729b858">
      <Text>Ryan enters on Chantal and gently throws her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5bb60d56-510c-475d-8f64-dc0f08ad7390">
      <Text>SeNSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d15fac59-0e2c-40a5-8c11-cf7326fbadb1">
      <Text>We’re on deck.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dc2743fa-6e7c-4b32-bf25-6e538fbb4d9c">
      <Text>Ryan nods and follows Sensei Joseph out to the arena.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8d73a0be-6523-4dab-979d-c3b2ec913a64">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d82fc386-0b9d-41ee-a712-14296b1fe5ea">
      <Text>How do you feel?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ee8adf4a-8ec0-47bf-8b53-f94772eb1ce9">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="68ef9225-8ba3-4ce9-ade2-281ca82cc5d4">
      <Text>A little like chum in a shark tank.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="11581334-1b70-44f7-926b-512920ec3722">
      <Text>Joseph rubs Ryan’s forearms.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2f094724-58db-47ed-a248-457336c5a8e9">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="65c19e64-121d-4e3b-a406-368bc8105cbb">
      <Text>You’ve prepared for this your whole life.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5541481d-ef7b-4cea-a28b-75ed63399657">
      <Text>Ryan allows a smirk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d9f3bdcb-754a-4963-88f5-77ed864c6fc8">
      <Text>Announcer (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca4f680e-88f0-4789-9cf0-21fa026f0c7c">
      <Text>On mat number one in white representing Russia, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vladamir</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Saravenko</Text>
      <Text>. And in blue representing the Republic of Burundi Ryan Cutler. Mat number one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4bcaf096-fe40-40e3-8ec7-5e15e089faa3">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c42c654b-270e-4a61-9474-2eadcc2f86e2">
      <Text>Do your best.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="29ad78ca-d5bb-4ee4-9ff5-e02ffc42a29c">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="15076003-0ce7-4523-977e-4dc92c12f659">
      <Text>(to himself)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="063cbcb0-8858-4303-bdd3-6bf7b8c5aef3">
      <Text>All I can do.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a092188c-93fe-4bb3-a9c6-dc46d017aa13">
      <Text>Ryan steps onto the mat. Standing across from his </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VLADAMIR</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">SARAVENKO</Text>
      <Text>, 28, carved out of granite. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b1369a96-aefb-4e26-a736-8561e4ce97ac">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e0b6c578-4b18-40fb-b4df-9aebcc691185">
      <Text>Cutler received a bye in the first  round and now he faces the European Champion, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vladamir</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Saravenko</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0bfc600e-0118-4024-b16a-cd990dbe2393">
      <Text>Leo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="20109c72-f2d6-44ec-b492-b8c3b39028e5">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Saravenko</Text>
      <Text> was a favorite at the last worlds, but he’s been plagued by injuries.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dc3d56b0-7ed4-420a-98d0-07a009aa1491">
      <Text>NEIL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4a9c7db8-faf7-4584-88e1-4944180534ed">
      <Text>He has. However, I spoke with the Russian coach and he tells me that Vlad is in the best shape of his career.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="395e8836-f63d-4151-a56c-203a313ddc79">
      <Text>On the mat, Ryan and Vlad bow. The Referee from Thailand begins the match:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0bc6e88d-a5ba-4766-95ec-c01c1512f1ad">
      <Text>Thai referee</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d8e05d6e-a67d-4cbd-8857-fb8110892ae4">
      <Text>Hajime.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="24aba6b5-efcb-4492-9798-b3d73f8f8c89">
      <Text>The Russian immediately swarms Ryan and gets a grip on Ryan’s belt. Ryan pushes his hips back and the Russian enters </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ouchi</Text>
      <Text>-gari.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b00e4362-bdde-40ea-a865-4e44bb56cedf">
      <Text>ThaI REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f361796a-dc29-4274-9155-c8ee3a125577">
      <Text>Yuko.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6dd81f1b-a5b2-4746-8520-ef9d16c3ade4">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f67c5d68-f27f-4717-957d-9d0d6dcc2907">
      <Text>A good score that with </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ouchi</Text>
      <Text>-gari. Cutler turned out at the last minute or it could have been all over.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d0eda593-7fcf-4ba2-8ed5-e6be88e9330d">
      <Text>The Russian works for a pin, Ryan has his leg </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">entagled</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9196d3d1-d30c-4011-879e-1862dbab3dac">
      <Text>Leo (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="75eb0ac6-da4f-4110-9496-20cb1deeda09">
      <Text>Vlad has to get that leg free to get the pin, but Cutler’s tied him up pretty good.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="875ecd90-83b2-45df-9898-9181b35ccc9e">
      <Text>Ryan grabs </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vladamir’s</Text>
      <Text> arm and goes for an armbar.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1ea38e11-96a8-4a27-83e0-2b28f952ade9">
      <Text>NEIL (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a2867f59-2203-4973-b9a2-c80b7bda7b40">
      <Text>Cuttle’s working for the armlock. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="97019c9c-a839-464e-90eb-5ad4c313c3ee">
      <Text>The Thai Referee stops them...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="38d24c92-0b01-4e1f-a0ae-005f772bf7f6">
      <Text>Thai REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2eff8e36-50c7-4604-a647-b38761efc58f">
      <Text>Matte!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="98f7b4ee-592b-4565-8f1b-8c445cbe4735">
      <Text>Ryan looks up at her, confused. She signals for Ryan to stand, a warning.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ecd09a07-fde1-4fae-af46-3259e1e54e86">
      <Text>Leo (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c6867357-343c-4fbb-ba07-93316c91474c">
      <Text>Cutler almost had that </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ude</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">garame</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="acf38f3a-0055-4cd3-b1a4-d11ab67d2601">
      <Text>Neil (O.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1d65b2c7-d62f-4ab3-912d-f5d1382e5b9a">
      <Text>I thought he did have the arm fairly well straight. Not sure why it was stopped.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eeb8cc17-bd1f-45d8-b9b6-48b9f17905a1">
      <Text>On the mat, Ryan and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vladamir</Text>
      <Text> take their grip, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vladamir</Text>
      <Text> jumps into a deep inner thigh throw (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">uchimata</Text>
      <Text>), ducking his head and somersaulting. Ryan goes flying, helpless to do anything but take the ride.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eb2448d0-b7ec-422e-85ea-c4e23708a498">
      <Text>Thai REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="00646c53-fa6d-478c-ae89-33cb8889e554">
      <Text>Ippon!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d008dc38-8388-47f6-94d3-e88e02624798">
      <Text>NEIL (o.c.) </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="55a05911-65a3-45ea-ab09-a379897b2622">
      <Text>The judges may want to take look at that... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1ffcf08e-e6f1-44b0-9329-0c37731459ff">
      <Text>Leo (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a186037a-219b-4b9b-9b25-af89bd512a12">
      <Text>There’s been some serious neck injuries from that kind of head-diving </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">uchimata</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c1a01f4c-bf81-43e4-8902-647e9b05f5be">
      <Text>On the mat, the Referee indicates that they are reviewing the video by drawing a box with her fingers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f1856c79-70b7-4ee1-938e-5d3c5a7b8c03">
      <Text>NEIL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="995b390e-9251-4acb-a683-87a68b5a7af1">
      <Text>What a way to lose a match in the Olympics. Such a shame really.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0e9f6ab4-e2d8-4b85-84fd-4027fd36cb55">
      <Text>The Referee turns toward the Russian and signals head-dive.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="48afe91c-5f98-40bc-aa1e-abba670f659a">
      <Text>Thai REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a3bbcf15-9ed1-4413-883d-021f204d61e4">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hansokumake</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2bdfa33b-d686-42df-a490-829127872594">
      <Text>The Referee awards the win to Ryan. The Russian throws his arms in the air.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="77453060-15b7-4314-817d-40d929203dec">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vladamir</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3f0cf680-c9f7-4163-8c1b-ede92b251639">
      <Text>Nyet... No! No touch. No head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="27016dc6-82d9-4b0b-8b65-10178a7aa5f9">
      <Text>Ryan goes to shake </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vladamir’s</Text>
      <Text> hand... He ignores him. The Referee ushes him off the mat to the BOOS of the spectators.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7f62cdb9-428b-4cb0-b65d-49cedddc67d1">
      <Text>Ryan walks, dazed. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6140e7f7-2bae-4b21-962a-9c49d9228c0c">
      <Text>SenSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="33c32395-3ac6-4e00-944a-09998d5a433b">
      <Text>You won!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="350d8881-9e48-40c3-8b3f-0af985883711">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a68cff84-df32-45a4-a56a-c9767d204ff5">
      <Text>No, not like that. He lost, I didn’t win. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="749cb9a9-d690-42be-8137-0872234b9018">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9d985f52-e0bc-4942-8875-74dce72d86d5">
      <Text>Ryan, listen to me... you’re in the quarter finals in the Olympics. You’ve made the quarter finals!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5327ed70-bf51-4d07-ac33-ff2f090f1d8a">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="786d96b9-28a0-4cd2-8f28-2a1d9498c668">
      <Text>With a bye and a disqualification.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ea594b93-8ed1-402c-b816-c26916d54d58">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="03be1378-1e5c-455e-9781-5de457d0ebe5">
      <Text>You can complain about it later. For now focus on the opportunity in front of you. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9bfcb79e-e8c7-4353-8d0e-6dc0565caff9">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9997aa91-8fdc-4c87-b524-194982e1a7c0">
      <Text>I need a drink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ecb68449-c45a-4d84-8665-e6e2b133351f">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bdc99bbd-a8ac-42a5-8d33-aab2201b4dec">
      <Text>At a time like this?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="05305908-5f5a-4fcb-a0be-b92d94747310">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="30f9ccae-d892-4cf2-8ecb-0514c299c03d">
      <Text>Funny... water, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gatorade</Text>
      <Text>, I’m dying here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="486402a9-e8cb-4125-bbb4-8df7848e8865">
      <Text>At the correspondents table Neil and Leo are on camera.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="779483cb-2fa3-4c9c-a65f-424b52a2013d">
      <Text>Leo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="121cb800-f067-468e-a049-72a381893c1d">
      <Text>Well, Ryan Cutler has shocked a lot of people here... He’s about to enter the quarter finals.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8d73a0be-6523-4dab-979d-c3b2ec913a64">
      <Text>Neil</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="41f95f5c-c5f7-4a25-8732-2fa1a5c5cebd">
      <Text>Unexpected is a bit of an understatement. Ryan’s matched with defending Olympic champion and reigning world champion Yuji </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Takamoto</Text>
      <Text> of Japan in the quarter final.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0c12e94a-f936-4aed-933e-0a4b75ce8b45">
      <Text>LEO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0f965f2c-02aa-4c0c-b1b8-5adfb4f47831">
      <Text>Blessing and a curse, he’s got an excellent chance of getting into the repechage... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b98a8bb0-1f22-4015-9c12-04720057200e">
      <Text>NEIL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d52d1aa0-ab02-4e53-bc2c-360d4184ed22">
      <Text>If he doesn’t get hurt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="06ed7e48-5a70-49d7-b286-028273fbd13b">
      <Text>LEO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ab0c4a95-43d8-4915-8a94-731da1d7ed59">
      <Text>If he doesn’t get hurt, is correct, and at sixty plus years old, that’s a very big if.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="1bf1a836-2c7c-41d3-ba7a-9fe410006a26">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="104" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. La convention center - dressing room - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6f76ddac-a43a-4d12-84e5-4920a91b8c9a">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph stands with Ryan who has changed into a white </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text>. Ryan retapes his fingers, his wrist, and both ankles. He sips </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gatorade</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e68b559b-8c21-4302-8082-48b09a60c3a7">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e2faacb3-bffe-44e7-b4ad-b2cb322575ff">
      <Text>I just don’t want to embarrass myself... or you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9b1be761-9665-4ba6-9c74-ece0b2fd6d90">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cf6bace9-f146-452e-9f2d-6178737f047d">
      <Text>Ryan, you don’t know?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="af3da207-2798-4b34-aa74-e0f4c87c975c">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0a16f1db-76d1-48f6-ba4c-84b8382ca6e9">
      <Text>Know what?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="91390f55-efb4-4dbd-8c57-05a0375c0616">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bb08f071-1e8c-4799-a2ea-35383892eae8">
      <Text>You’re the most inspiring person I have ever met.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c9a465fb-7743-46b9-83ab-b0a3c74aa55c">
      <Text>Ryan blushes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d612e3b5-58a7-45e8-8565-5c605b1aeda7">
      <Text>SeNSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1807ac03-1190-4135-94f8-37019f18db99">
      <Text>Crazy, but inspiring.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="fc006385-b6f1-47a4-a7dc-b390e8d03685">
      <Text>(a beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="547a5386-8388-45a4-80f4-fe65023c9fc2">
      <Text>Time to go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="35a7c625-9963-49d2-9e6e-1f3ef8e132e1">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 7/8" Page="105" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ANNOUNCER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LEO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MEXICAN REF">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NEIL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="YUJI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. La convention center - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e1403697-7059-4460-8241-a8e282a949b2">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph walks with Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ff61676b-8658-4297-a572-915689b610d5">
      <Text>Announcer (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca7670b9-afce-40d1-9b80-a863f065a911">
      <Text>On mat number one in  quarter finals of the men’s sixty kilo and under division - from Burundi Ryan Cutler. Fighting in blue from Japan Yuji </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Takamoto</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e1303c53-d5dd-4f54-8ecf-15776b2177b9">
      <Text>The MEXICAN REF invites them onto the mat. YUJI and Ryan bow onto the mat and then to each other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c43a77ec-1f95-4d90-ba1f-0a100cb34107">
      <Text>Mexican ref</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dd8093fe-1b02-48b3-8841-a9d5d02c9632">
      <Text>Hajime.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3664726e-ee17-4ec6-ae0e-9c6454ccb17f">
      <Text>Leo (O.C.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c70bcff1-5c21-455a-b432-b20772e543eb">
      <Text>May not want to blink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="22eb5820-9b94-4518-9d02-7439ea2da992">
      <Text>The Japanese competitor circles around. Yuji reaches for an overhand grip, Ryan turns, attempting a forward throw and ends up face down on the mat. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c6f5dd59-ef7b-4b74-af27-22959e548d92">
      <Text>MEXICAN REF</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="16efec9f-7170-460d-bbc3-6ead36f73850">
      <Text>Matte!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d4575c13-ffe1-4157-a3c5-8adab0226c1f">
      <Text>The Ref gives Ryan a penalty for a false attack. Ryan nods “guilty as charged.”  </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="58c9c248-25cf-406b-9677-55e2b4f174ed">
      <Text>MeXICAN REF</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cdbf3967-8ede-4917-bec7-298a6c15091e">
      <Text>Hajime.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c4cf6b94-479c-4936-8c7b-9de5ddccd4b3">
      <Text>Leo (o.C.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dfc854da-9b54-487a-abf2-88207bc8b676">
      <Text>Well, it’s lasted longer than I thought - </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="619b23f6-c584-4d48-ab0c-1148261d20fe">
      <Text>At that moment, Yuji attempts a foot sweep that Ryan reverses, knocking the younger Japanese competitor to his knees. Ryan immediately jumps on him and tries to work for a choke. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f8c44b01-ce8d-41e6-a264-71a5b52cf0b0">
      <Text>Neil (o.c)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cce16e2a-9c6a-4d21-8718-1d4249b6348f">
      <Text>Well, that was unexpected. The Burundi competitor came very close to a score there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a023a408-7787-47fe-b310-1bc64c66aa4a">
      <Text>The Referee keeps a close eye on the action, but Ryan’s getting nowhere.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="35c689fd-fd19-496b-8bcd-4b0d5475f2b3">
      <Text>MeXICAN REF</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cf6edce4-87b0-460d-aadc-cca8f6879080">
      <Text>Matte!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="514d5809-8bf7-40a9-9670-35170f489e4a">
      <Text>He stands the competitor’s up. Yuji straightens his </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> and nods, respectfully to Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dc05094e-bc12-42cd-91bb-1e8828fcd3db">
      <Text>Mexican REF</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c81e3de5-6cae-4ed1-a8bf-836b2f9062d2">
      <Text>Hajime.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bf01fcfd-17ee-4d84-ab2c-7d78415f7fee">
      <Text>Yuji circles Ryan and again goes for high grip. Yuji forces Ryan’s head down. Ryan falls to his knees again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="294b65b5-5c61-461c-b251-663c3a3de3a5">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="90e0db04-b5ea-4966-b360-6f86ab602e5f">
      <Text>That will be the second </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">shido</Text>
      <Text>, I should think.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f1518632-b56e-4029-b5db-aed1a76baa1c">
      <Text>MEXICAN REF</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="685df823-df98-41dc-8087-dea1428db72c">
      <Text>(pointing at Ryan)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2810c1dd-e7d4-4741-928b-5fd6571c29f9">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Shido</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a4100956-514f-4d98-b0d0-d4a326d00c3c">
      <Text>Leo (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3494522f-326f-49b6-836b-15708fd78092">
      <Text>One more penalty and that will end the match.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2bafb35c-7a2d-4fdd-b8aa-cfdb751fece6">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d5509f18-3aca-494b-9c6c-d411a1c340de">
      <Text>But it seems as if we may have underestimated --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7c58cfa0-f256-4093-a0b1-b785689dc333">
      <Text>Ryan gets his grip and tries a deep </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ouchi</Text>
      <Text> gari (inner reaping throw), this pushes Yuji backwards, but he uses the momentum to pull Ryan to him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9910dce5-70d5-493c-b076-faebc4da5875">
      <Text>Yuji turns and executes a near perfect </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">morote</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">seionage</Text>
      <Text>. Ryan lands with a LOUD THUD.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a0d7cdcd-2eaf-47e6-8760-fe93939d5cf5">
      <Text>Mexican ref</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="48506d42-3dca-4b4c-8cb2-095d79b66e2d">
      <Text>Ippon! Sore made.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c5f720ca-8e04-40e6-9ce7-32927936ade6">
      <Text>Ryan lies on the mat. He stares up at the lights. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ac0e411b-af6e-46a8-8110-32c3d9ed00ca">
      <Text>Mexican ref</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b4989d22-1f0c-47da-982c-17f341a9eef6">
      <Text>Are you hurt? Do you need medical?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="22abbafc-eec3-479e-ac02-94e8ba8b6eaa">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="00e964ec-cb29-4f53-b2e8-69edc25415b2">
      <Text>(sitting up, a broad smile)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c8e1e983-b915-40de-b1cc-9050194bab9e">
      <Text>I’m okay.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0de6cab5-2b0c-4458-a105-36eee0da01dd">
      <Text>The Mexican Ref awards the match to Yuji. Ryan and Yuji meet center mat and shake hands. Yuji bows to Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="941d5659-209c-4ef8-b7b7-1253834ae799">
      <Text>Yuji</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="67230fe6-0748-42de-9aad-7e8f59c44a5f">
      <Text>(in Japanese)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7190e446-1e1c-48be-9f86-ffe6ad1193b8">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Shitsurei</Text>
      <Text>. Nani </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">nensai</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">desuka</Text>
      <Text>? (Excuse me, but how old are you?)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="083ea3d3-ecc8-4ced-af09-556f4b3cea45">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="79a2f137-33cc-4ba8-9a9b-6f9137f37116">
      <Text>Roku-</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ju</Text>
      <Text>-</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ni</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">nen</Text>
      <Text>. (sixty-two)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="53f09bb0-1a2f-4118-9388-69dace0a55e8">
      <Text>Yuji</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="33ed2620-baa3-4dc1-a231-c3383538b6ae">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Waaa</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Tsuyoi</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ganbate</Text>
      <Text>!(Wow. You’re strong. Good luck!)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c85d4209-0003-4718-809e-b3853e488fa2">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="269b1a6e-9067-4c90-96db-30eb9e57c72d">
      <Text>Domo. (Thanks)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fb6572c9-a230-4080-9541-2070a612ad94">
      <Text>Neil and Leo at the correspondent’s desk watch as Ryan and Yuji part.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1ac03ec2-edcd-4f2b-8978-607be40341a4">
      <Text>Neil</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8da2f6c6-3d61-43a7-89b3-cae8abf5cfe3">
      <Text>And so, as expected, Yuji </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Takamoto</Text>
      <Text> moves on to the semi-finals and Ryan Cutler of Burundi will have to wade through the repechage to get another shot at a medal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="92de6355-8444-4777-83d2-a2948182edaf">
      <Text>Ryan bows off the mat and is met by Sensei Joseph. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="98941e37-d3e7-4a80-bd64-7af5cbc9a85e">
      <Text>ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7db4efcf-93de-4841-b1b1-c89daa11e535">
      <Text>That was a little like fighting a wood chipper. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e3c929f8-1def-4bca-820e-4d5ba6dcf4ed">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1e0a6691-48b2-486d-9376-f73c8e728560">
      <Text>Rest. You’re not done yet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bb70608f-e71f-4d9f-9549-1377e0b93f95">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a3e4459e-0ab0-40e7-ac6d-24b01aabab9a">
      <Text>Well, I ain’t dead, so...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bdb76e8a-6f2c-420e-b3f7-932199b5ec20">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0d211b6a-6867-4d3f-8b86-a4aa379282b6">
      <Text>You are facing </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> he’s the one --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7e3c9ef3-f9b9-4dc9-b5b9-050cb6d955fe">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4b14aba2-b3d4-4b6c-abb6-0135aa329c3e">
      <Text>Oh, I remember </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text>. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3ea21184-eaa1-4a8d-a55d-b865b434891b">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eabe4ede-3149-4435-88d4-0bc3f1cda853">
      <Text>Just be careful.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0e62f445-5c5d-4bbd-8ee9-d57130b1a9f5">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="49b36b50-c818-408f-ae34-e9e8a50abdf6">
      <Text>He’s the one that needs to be careful...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a9729179-ef81-4c71-9d0b-077db72f484a">
      <Text>Ryan’s laser focused.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="601c797c-55e5-427e-8ac2-27ea864f6ace">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="107" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LEO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NEIL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. La CONVENTION CENTER - correspondent’s table - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fa2aa5c5-42ce-493e-8c82-f2c193458f60">
      <Text>Neil and Leo look into the camera.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1af4306d-0fd6-4a1b-bd42-ec2b2cd61a26">
      <Text>Neil</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f1f0270d-8805-4229-9821-b5df2d575c19">
      <Text>What an unexpected turn of events. The number seven rated player in the world was just defeated by sixty-two-year old senior citizen who was ranked four hundred and ninety fifth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c50ca9f4-2821-4fee-92f3-b8617bbe98f1">
      <Text>Leo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d8ffe961-3a21-46aa-b124-0c0fdabc1bd6">
      <Text>Remarkable doesn’t cover it. Improbably, impossible? Closer to the truth. But hats off to Ryan Cutler of Burundi and he returns this evening to fight against the number THREE ranked player from Italy, the three time world medalist, and 2020 Olympic bronze medalist Giovanni Marianna.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="663e1fcb-1a8b-4aa3-8d1a-3e7259e33560">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="108" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. La CONVENTION CENTER - WARM-UP AREA - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5a4d4577-2e4e-41e4-9e08-2ed66bbd3aac">
      <Text>Ryan has ice on his knee. Blood seeps through his bandaged forehead. Sensei Joseph stands next to him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9e5193f4-210f-468b-b8f5-ffb36ff38e55">
      <Text>SenSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a2c9c35c-ed13-4678-bf24-a2ce114005ad">
      <Text>You have nothing else to prove, Ryan. Do you want to withdraw?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dc1c9ed5-b783-47c6-a441-8d7e664f73b7">
      <Text>Ryan gets to his feet, he does a deep squat, grimacing with pain. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8773a146-00fa-4672-89a6-c1875106a47a">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="152d9321-9508-4bab-8589-8447e1657798">
      <Text>I’m okay.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="640a7b0f-ba24-4c82-ada4-f53fcb1c5042">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="815a9cd7-81e4-4997-80f0-c6cdb170947a">
      <Text>You can barely stand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b59af2a0-043c-4ef8-9c09-0c2038a360ab">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4a8e54f8-2a0a-4c9f-bf66-c0453e6ad9e9">
      <Text>Did you ever see the Karate Kid?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f7b5012d-d52a-489a-a365-2b57932fbaeb">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="88e5e4a7-b931-43e3-b7f6-13c40341fc49">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7d81a24f-70c9-42fc-b606-8e4978a958ab">
      <Text>Ryan balances on his good leg and assumes the Crane position.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="75fce4ed-44bf-4ea1-9459-06615cef3297">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1a8adcf1-e414-419a-8131-c1703b7ef43f">
      <Text>No defense!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="6d3fd5ec-92ac-4209-9974-28414b70f08a">
      <Text>(a beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2725af31-3b5d-4b67-ae0c-72789a4befe4">
      <Text>Karate Kid? No..?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f16f2091-e141-4fa3-8fb5-da620cd5c1d0">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph LAUGHS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="d1e76366-49e5-474d-a823-a7eb7ce6d754">
      <SceneProperties Length="5" Page="109" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ANNOUNCER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JAPANESE REFEREE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LEO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NEIL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. La CONVENTION CENTER - MAIN HALL - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cb56b9aa-f0c3-4813-99f4-17dddf183d36">
      <Text>A single mat has been placed in the center of the massive hall. TV cameras surround the event area. LOUD MUSIC pumps up the sold out crowd.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3551cd17-36bd-4268-886c-bdd5bb7afeea">
      <Text>Announcer (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="75cbf1d3-599f-4e90-aed5-6f4a8acf6b96">
      <Text>Welcome to the final block for the men’s sixty kilo, and the women’s forty-eight kilos divisions. A few introductions of some of the dignitaries ---</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f7ad70f4-5cbb-4953-8ef7-8e0d22bd2fd2">
      <Text>In the entrance to the hall, Ryan wearing a blue </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> stands ready. He looks up at the stands... Nella has come to the closest rail. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="54e51fd1-423e-4001-aa72-44d5bb7830d5">
      <Text>Ryan walks over and she reaches for him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4169636f-567a-42d0-b506-4030f6908703">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="422d6a8f-930c-49ff-9a15-ec2cd7330809">
      <Text>Are you okay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ead066ee-4727-4cd3-aeac-01f67bf97300">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b61ca9a7-ec7d-404e-8589-0336b17739a5">
      <Text>Better than okay. I had a dream for half a century... and it’s here. Whatever happens. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6f951b44-ebad-487f-ab95-c73031bab67b">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="464e0dee-c002-413d-8b60-4c2d79fd0672">
      <Text>You can fight?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="65a83796-daf5-43ec-84b3-89015afe4e74">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="872fa6e1-c5a1-4f32-b308-93661c03cd25">
      <Text>Can and will. I’m not likely to have another chance, Nella. A little bruising’s nothing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bda56a42-be56-4edf-b3fe-bb9ab3985278">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="882e17cb-394a-40ce-91b8-bdbe80e7d437">
      <Text>Don’t hurt him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7f9a749b-74b8-4b2d-b1db-c7f6fa99ec08">
      <Text>Ryan smiles. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a9ed18a0-ce84-40b2-9ebe-dbf0d9302f63">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0e9c3ce3-d4b3-40eb-88bf-be31c0710224">
      <Text>I think I love you, Mr. Cutler.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d83dcee7-91d6-4902-a82a-f9788eb67e30">
      <Text>Ryan kisses her hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="12c8b9a2-916c-4be8-bf1c-5db6a4201267">
      <Text>Announcer (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4a20630a-2e08-40e4-a15f-1b23cc9cf079">
      <Text>Fighting for the bronze medal in white from Germany Robert </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text>. In blue from the Republic of Burundi Ryan Cutler.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5d99f8d1-9483-4fc3-8e8d-71f45ef93a74">
      <Text>GIOVANNI, 30 years old sporting some impressive cauliflower ears and wearing a white </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> walks to the edge of the mat, gives his coach a quick hug. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="14ee9a4b-9f10-4eac-be49-bae3cbc673a2">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph walks to the blue side of the mat with Ryan. They embrace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5745238f-76c9-42e1-9aaa-18fdfd2bced6">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eebac402-19ff-46b9-8680-034c3727c194">
      <Text>This is the proudest moment of my life. No matter what happens.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7a9cf9b9-16c6-4acd-a7f1-30d023462027">
      <Text>Ryan pats Sensei Joseph on the shoulder, turns to bow onto the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3be1af81-368d-4e76-828e-7581f9b96727">
      <Text>The JAPANESE REFEREE calls them to the competition area.Ryan and Giovanni bow to each other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="61d2a0db-e8d3-45f5-928e-1166589178e5">
      <Text>Japanese referee</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6ecdeab9-ee47-4ab8-958a-ce4140c299af">
      <Text>Hajime!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2208f138-9982-46d9-b95c-54979df632e6">
      <Text>Ryan and Giovanni go in for grips.  Giovanni takes an overhand grip. Ryan ducks under the grip and immediately attempts a left o-</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">soto</Text>
      <Text>-gari. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="36a62890-797d-4dcd-bd02-58d3615423f9">
      <Text>Giovanni blocks the throw and they both go out of bounds.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="335df9a7-81bd-4035-a581-c9961a6b49cc">
      <Text>JapANESE REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0c47f78c-3b65-4ab1-8d70-16fe6305bdfa">
      <Text>Matte!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="54a07dfc-6568-4369-80f3-5ecc4937e6b0">
      <Text>When Ryan returns to the center of the mat the Referee turns toward him. The Ref does a “ducking under” gesture and points at Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="70f562ff-d3c8-41cd-b0f0-2eb16e376471">
      <Text>JAPANESE REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="80f18b63-c5d8-4db8-9994-e75c55a08055">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Shido</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d24d5806-431b-486d-b9fe-0e529ffe5edc">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph jumps up. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ce6cd3a3-930f-494f-a76a-1aea6fdf6088">
      <Text>SeNSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a8e33f02-e8b0-413d-8371-b6410d5f7301">
      <Text>That was a legal attack. He attacked!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6665465e-8105-4aa0-9f9c-bb274328cc93">
      <Text>The Referee walks toward Joseph motioning for him to sit and be quiet. Ryan looks over and shrugs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="aefa484e-f631-4148-a66d-5ffbc9171e57">
      <Text>The referee returns to the center --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="83e75b7d-8ac7-4897-a0d2-3ff29a43e1d1">
      <Text>JAPANESE REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8f764bef-eb67-429c-933a-0ab7be4382c5">
      <Text>Hajime.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1554f470-25a8-4858-aee6-b4f2b8e23c2c">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0d09bf05-10d6-4bd7-82d0-04399cf63258">
      <Text>Not sure about that call, I have to agree with his coach.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3800ecf0-3851-442b-aafd-f5e7390eed4d">
      <Text>Leo (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="70616b6d-9dd4-4992-b0c8-beb0561e68ab">
      <Text>Looks like Cutler’s knee is bothering him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="44eecc0f-8ef9-4158-85bf-7ee655f44c85">
      <Text>NEIL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2016826e-4888-46cf-95ff-4ff4ed111681">
      <Text>Remarkable he’s lasted as long as he has.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b2a26b34-8b96-4a15-bef6-9b51a6b9456a">
      <Text>On the mat, Ryan gets a collar grip and Giovanni tears the hand away... taking Ryan’s ring finger’s nail off at the bed. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8b9a797d-854b-4153-9ef9-7e96c227b5f6">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2697307d-067a-4b78-86a1-d2ecfa882965">
      <Text>Ouch... damnit!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="885f2e68-74d5-466a-aa36-255339f3398e">
      <Text>Ryan’s hand drips blood. Another official comes to the mat and takes Ryan to the medical table. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e0bba74c-001f-41cb-b912-7bd2689539ca">
      <Text>Ryan glances at Sensei Joseph, nodding that he’s okay. The tape and bandage the finger, and clean the blood with hydrogen peroxide. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fddd16b7-de88-46c8-9de4-ce2ae16b1ce5">
      <Text>NEIL (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e94fd0ce-9bcb-4cd3-8264-cba4358ddb70">
      <Text>Just a reminder, blood is the only injury that allows the competitor to seek medical attention without ending the match.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8c52bdfc-0fe8-4298-891f-0a423de718c3">
      <Text>JapANESE REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6e59cfdc-9a27-4aa9-bf08-0da5f0abc41c">
      <Text>Hajime. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="34837fe3-d5dd-47c6-a976-f2e5347b66ab">
      <Text>Ryan reaches to get his grip. The pain’s too great. Giovanni enters a strong </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">harai-goshi</Text>
      <Text>. Ryan turns out landing mostly on his stomach. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="12c617f4-dbea-456a-990d-b0ac818d779b">
      <Text>Japanese REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3ba86ea1-33bb-4bc6-a3f8-f4fbe4ef8a22">
      <Text>Yuko!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e06cecd4-ad22-45ee-b3fd-67ecb7b53fbc">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ecab6155-1c10-49c0-8a55-f5de2c303eec">
      <Text>A clean </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">yuko</Text>
      <Text> for Marianna.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f3ea4f87-9032-4e9c-ad65-adf1b56d8f12">
      <Text>Giovanni goes after him. Ryan covers up.  </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="48da1a30-b074-482d-b46a-2dd02337bee2">
      <Text>Ryan looks at the clock. One minute left... Ryan’s behind by a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">yuko</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2b730856-cab6-42ba-b052-8d8eec641141">
      <Text>JAPANESE REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="3876ffbf-9919-4b86-893c-96c9c28c1cfc">
      <Text>(gestures non-combativity)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7ec72d1d-65e3-4de3-b6eb-372a7b2e0675">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Shido</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a8c2c1a1-78c6-4358-85d7-cc401c71077e">
      <Text>Leo (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="22c28eb7-8efd-4c61-b1b8-addb57c8e01c">
      <Text>That’s two </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">shidos</Text>
      <Text> against Cutler. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9d41e275-d8c9-40c2-b0dc-aeea97a75741">
      <Text>Ryan comes in for a deep one arm shoulder throw (ippon </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">seionage</Text>
      <Text>), but Giovanni grabs him by the waist and attempts to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">suplex</Text>
      <Text> him. Ryan breaks the grip and squats down, jumping into a stomach wheel throw (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">tomoe-nage</Text>
      <Text>). </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Marianni</Text>
      <Text> lands on his side.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c6fd4a25-9e09-43e6-8aea-e4ae8b27de3e">
      <Text>JAPANESE REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="95dfa0f1-cc70-41fc-8de8-8ae354621e8d">
      <Text>Yuko!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ca7b1357-7a40-4ce9-85f7-e9d654f380d1">
      <Text>LEO (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bcc12981-e649-43cf-ba59-edc70d4dcfd9">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Whaaat</Text>
      <Text>! Can you believe this?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a0440407-c6b5-4964-937b-8446dcd647f9">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f44974a9-4ae3-478e-8219-508f1acfc271">
      <Text>Cutler has tied it up with less than thirty seconds on the clock.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="55658ca7-68cf-40fa-b240-befdd836d721">
      <Text>Blood trickles down Ryan’s hand. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="52c3c800-14cd-419f-bec1-74144c2107ae">
      <Text>JAPANESE REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e599aa99-3ad4-4070-92bb-0a7c5d555688">
      <Text>Matte.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b2f18ddb-2bf0-4ab4-8e1e-b46a9437c98a">
      <Text>Again, Ryan’s taken to medical. The cut over his eye has reopened... They quickly attempt to stem the flow and rewrap his head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="836c0270-b82e-4880-a3b7-24e74a5932fe">
      <Text>Japanese REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6e5ca53d-dd84-4521-91ff-2e99ea3f0a31">
      <Text>If the blood doesn’t stop I will award the match.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a1d8cb7f-f1b1-4f35-91cd-d799425d37ae">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fc8fb98c-958c-497a-ba71-dfc80592885e">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Wakata</Text>
      <Text>. (got it.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b0998059-b2e5-4158-a17c-09b68d08f686">
      <Text>The Referee heads back to the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4d7cfa3d-373c-4151-b6f5-56fefd22698e">
      <Text>JaPANESE REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5c7b69e4-ab22-423e-9eef-debf9225708d">
      <Text>Hajime.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="55fef86f-2fac-4d46-bf0d-95990f6236f2">
      <Text>They circle. Ryan attempts an inner reaping throw (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ouchi</Text>
      <Text>-gari), but Giovanni steps out of that throw and counters with his own ankle stop (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ashi-garuma</Text>
      <Text>).</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2a0e2046-4f87-4c25-8b49-f52acdae8531">
      <Text>Ryan looks at the clock... he’s sucking wind, sweating buckets.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c2ebcdd9-c0c6-445d-beab-854f71c5466c">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6280b2b0-1c78-4b37-acc5-2ec8ea19f09b">
      <Text>Ryan, you first. No more penalties.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0b9495b3-0634-4c00-afc0-8efebd3b2263">
      <Text>Ryan nods as he finishes straightening his </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text>. Giovanni, while sweating looks much fresher.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7a4f3a5c-8faf-4759-8ca1-abdfa1c54d90">
      <Text>JaPANESE REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8f0755a5-42d0-404d-b1ef-373200c6598a">
      <Text>Hajime!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0c8018e3-1173-4ed0-a69d-10e69c9a2ccf">
      <Text>Ryan comes forward and shoots for </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">kouchi</Text>
      <Text>-gari. Giovanni counters with an </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">uchimata</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f160dd8f-27c6-4d48-b8ad-878f65e230c9">
      <Text>He lifts Ryan into the air, but Ryan lands on both knees. No score. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4e58a729-4fbe-4faa-9f12-609e2da9812f">
      <Text>Giovanni whips the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> around Ryan’s throat. Ryan gets his chin down. Giovanni puts a knee in Ryan’s back. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="216269bc-e855-4776-ac99-c0e2a6790be7">
      <Text>Ryan HEARS his jaw popping.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d2ff5647-3885-402c-821c-1c18131ecbf0">
      <Text>Japanese REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="09f17370-2dfb-48c5-b52a-f328cbf2e023">
      <Text>Matte.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="548deebf-a7d7-4b56-85ec-b0aeacc1bdcf">
      <Text>They stand up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="807864ca-2a66-4d88-a53f-03b07321bd33">
      <Text>JAPANESE REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="344b6e1d-9972-40f7-be69-92e4ed4ceb43">
      <Text>Hajime!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="14d7c977-5727-4e8d-9968-d4bf74b01b54">
      <Text>Ryan fights for grips... He steps to his left and sees Giovanni raising his left leg, preparing to sweep. Things go into slow motion... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5244cdaa-d917-4ea3-af87-dbfe36d8cd11">
      <Text>Giovanni’s foot reaches for Ryan’s trailing right foot... Ryan’s foot moves with him and then circles around, reverses the attack and sweeps Giovanni’s ankle, continuing to spin as Ryan switches to the inner leg reap (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ouchi</Text>
      <Text> gari) there’s a POP -- </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f7e25b2a-731d-4650-85f4-bf8ed694ec5c">
      <Text>There’s a loud GASP from the spectators. Daniel and Nella leap to their feet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7bddd1b2-5055-4f3d-b2ca-bf6dc4c67c53">
      <Text>Giovanni goes down on his back. The referee hesitates for a moment and then - </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="17f3b5d0-3328-45fa-9c3e-d4cf8b321623">
      <Text>JAPANESE REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="733dda96-6270-4a85-9560-98da98bdc200">
      <Text>Ippon! Sore Made.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b5c684c7-1471-4dfc-842c-4d2221b6d2c1">
      <Text>Giovanni pounds on the mat in disbelief. Ryan, grimaces in pain, gets to his feet, favoring his right leg.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Shot" id="fd44507a-8c18-4b67-b411-d57f2064685d">
      <Text>In the stands </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="992844e3-3729-4b2c-aeef-993ea9c15c29">
      <Text>Daniel and Nella celebrate... but it is short-lived.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="16266c36-0011-4d61-841b-542f8d35aa8a">
      <Text>Ryan walks off the mat, limping.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0c1d2615-5782-4eee-996b-1c1735c6f0bb">
      <Text>SenSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0c0a67ef-2b30-45b1-9f84-9fde26fe7be8">
      <Text>Your knee?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4a1e5a33-c1ff-4763-9d49-fb4daa8ae44a">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="49bf3976-ed99-4bdd-a7dd-14f6784f3be4">
      <Text>Yeah.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="77c3ba18-7072-4762-8198-29dc19c98467">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="caf79fd7-0c3d-42c2-9b40-74258f6fc160">
      <Text>Is it bad?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="afe1fe10-0d72-4ee8-9db0-c7afc282823f">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="efe86848-ca38-46c7-a07c-827923bab13e">
      <Text>Well, it ain’t good. I may never play the piano again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="85b0ef20-4a24-44ae-8eaa-33a4de57faa7">
      <Text>He leans on Sensei Joseph as they head back to the warm-up room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="d2fa42a6-a1d6-4dcf-b97c-892794f5d205">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="114" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LEO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NEIL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. La CONVENTION CENTER - correspondent’s table - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3b75445c-1f83-4b13-8e65-e86b5ceac8b9">
      <Text>Neil and Leo look into the camera.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="11f4da61-78d7-4ee3-b9bd-a854b7f7702c">
      <Text>Neil</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0f584765-ddd5-4962-853c-748703241426">
      <Text>What an unexpected turn of events. The number seven rated player in the world was just defeated by sixty-two-year old senior citizen who was ranked four hundred and ninety fifth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a83e77ae-2eaa-4ce0-a778-49a667a77567">
      <Text>Leo</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="67878a79-3408-423c-96d1-802430114674">
      <Text>Remarkable doesn’t cover it. Improbably, impossible? Closer to the truth. But hats off to Ryan Cutler of Burundi and he returns this evening to fight against the number THREE ranked player from Italy, the three time world medalist, and 2020 Olympic bronze medalist Robert </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="87c46a41-ccc9-4594-8f88-4d0042f49b43">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="114" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. La CONVENTION CENTER - WARM-UP AREA - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2651eebe-23ce-40a3-8ef2-05288638494e">
      <Text>Ryan has ice on his knee. Blood seeps through his bandaged forehead. Sensei Joseph stands next to him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="825d485e-e671-4194-9503-949e5ca496f9">
      <Text>SenSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="02084fd1-6acb-40ab-aa83-610f18f58eff">
      <Text>You have nothing else to prove, Ryan. Do you want to withdraw?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="669d2638-c067-4c04-80e8-358e3d0cccf0">
      <Text>Ryan get to his feet, he does a deep squat, grimacing with pain. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="96051ba0-e512-4af3-9323-e0e165c6e00d">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c30137a9-1bb0-4d78-872f-adc6ee3240cf">
      <Text>I’m okay.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1db944a6-6190-482d-aa59-1f51be8d2cd8">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cb3f33ba-56ec-4f9b-83f4-74431dc362d5">
      <Text>You can barely stand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c26a01c1-c48a-48e5-a971-0c1f75db8ff0">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c7222cec-a08e-4a44-b263-36eeb57b098c">
      <Text>Did you ever see the Karate Kid?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e17da12e-2e45-472f-9fe9-169833849f60">
      <Text>SENSEI JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="89095bb3-f1ad-4ea5-80b2-7cbea29af708">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2765058e-9729-4243-9bba-8fc5e8265d93">
      <Text>Ryan balances on his good leg and assumes the Crane position.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d6dd7a80-205e-4e91-8b0b-274dc1b824f0">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="36ab66f5-088f-4ec4-8bd0-01cd25e49c7c">
      <Text>No defense!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="28318e0e-0aa4-49e4-ac74-eeafef25eae7">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph shakes his head, LAUGHS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9b464113-af78-47f2-83bb-2a1318e8cfd7">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="115" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. la CONVENTION CENTER - WARM-UP AREA - day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="194318ca-f839-4ec4-b629-067d8c56d899">
      <Text>Ryan sits against the wall and watches the matches scroll up on a large screen TV. His name comes up along with his opponent Robert </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> from Germany. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2157ad11-965e-4756-a6db-6260c8fe3587">
      <SceneProperties Length="6 7/8" Page="115" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ANNOUNCER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DOCTOR">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GERMAN COACH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="IRISH REFEREE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LEO">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NEIL">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="NELLA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="RYAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SENSEI JOSEPH">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. La CONVENTION CENTER - MAIN HALL - night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b1d9c6a-01d0-45eb-a4be-262526a970f9">
      <Text>A single mat has been placed in the center of the massive hall. TV cameras surround the event area. LOUD MUSIC pumps up the sold out crowd.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5fdf5bbe-818f-4716-b63e-8d960d9a683a">
      <Text>Announcer (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="47966c98-9c6c-4b5b-9176-0c7544addbd3">
      <Text>Welcome to the final block for the men’s sixty kilo, and the women’s forty-eight kilos divisions. A few introductions of some of the dignitaries ---</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="559c9572-103b-4bc0-b792-e497f4b824b4">
      <Text>In the entrance to the hall, Ryan wearing a white </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> stands ready. He looks up at the stands... Nella has come to the closest rail. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c91d2e21-fc19-4f76-8cb6-27582e2a9476">
      <Text>Ryan walks over and she reaches for him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dec67108-cb55-4d07-88cd-67e63f76caf6">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="81492bd6-0f4e-4042-9eaa-0226b82684b2">
      <Text>Are you okay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0b260b9b-6a9f-4ccd-89ba-48033365efda">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="95b90d89-bad5-4f4c-9541-3a97578dbd46">
      <Text>Better than okay. I’ve had a dream for half a century... and it’s here. Whatever happens, I’m good. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e218f270-497e-4964-831a-357e4c0bdaef">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0335cc3f-ec8e-4843-ae67-d6e0facfa2b0">
      <Text>You can fight?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="04c313c0-a7b4-4870-93a2-2915fe8a6dae">
      <Text>RYAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a9fb1992-f9eb-473c-9703-4e10608d6dc1">
      <Text>I’m not likely to have another chance, Nella. A little bruising’s nothing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="53292f17-a64a-49b9-ad24-560929daee46">
      <Text>NELLA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2f5c8afd-f6c5-4d50-a190-47a7af996b0a">
      <Text>Don’t hurt him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bf6a1e63-0256-4a03-9530-11139a09c43f">
      <Text>Ryan smiles. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1e65edda-9c5f-4705-898c-d02036274ea6">
      <Text>Nella</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="849bc023-61ad-4b36-8179-f70846d438c1">
      <Text>I think I love you, Mr. Cutler.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9a8444ae-bcbe-4c7e-ae86-7d07add487fc">
      <Text>Ryan kisses her hand. Ryan spots Daniel in the stands... Daniel makes a fist, nodding to Ryan. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="978543f0-7295-44dd-b78d-cf600398a3c9">
      <Text>Announcer (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f9f34cdc-0b22-48df-9141-f3b664da53bc">
      <Text>Fighting for the bronze medal In white from the Republic of Burundi Ryan Cutler. And in blue from Germany Robert </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c97c7b41-a068-4bcb-ba2f-d197d016ea0f">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text>, wearing a blue </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> walks to the edge of the mat, gives his coach a quick hug. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9a9a61ad-2ea5-4ab4-bd03-c2029dd3513f">
      <Text>Sensei Joseph walks to the white side of the mat with Ryan. They embrace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6cc5a87c-1a95-4a40-92a5-def9d8a71129">
      <Text>Sensei JOSEPH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="88a487cc-334b-483c-8e23-49e01d871191">
      <Text>This is the proudest moment of my life. No matter what happens.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c74db020-8549-4a72-a5d6-bfbb76b2da6d">
      <Text>Ryan pats Sensei Joseph on the shoulder, turns to bow onto the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b00c3245-b423-4b94-952a-2383648540b0">
      <Text>The IRISH REFEREE calls them to the competition area.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="745dd1e0-6900-4337-8cb7-dd957310f552">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9fe48473-0106-4487-b8e1-644f3a2277df">
      <Text>And here we go for the first of the two bronze medal matches in the men’s sixty kilo division. And it is a historic match.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6d9f0608-414a-465b-a884-11b95ffa326a">
      <Text>Leo (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4ed9612b-11bf-4fdd-9280-674b80eabc83">
      <Text>The oldest competitor to ever compete in an Olympic Judo competition, and the widest margin between rankings.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0d1b7a3f-6448-4031-8eb4-629a0e796734">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.) </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="886ec874-6200-43c6-9da9-e625d60e9378">
      <Text>Let’s see how Cutler, ranked four-ninety-five fares </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">aginst</Text>
      <Text> the number three ranked </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="15a4728f-cb4b-4ec2-9ec1-5bdb3633cdb1">
      <Text>Irish referee</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="25c4ba3a-c04d-4cc7-908b-d7487db42c1c">
      <Text>Hajime.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a5f3db5f-3e6a-44a2-8db7-d7d84e935924">
      <Text>Neil (o.c)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aa51c06e-3206-4fc4-bee0-2e04454e4feb">
      <Text>This will be a tough one for Cutler.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="865fd827-88ed-4509-9cee-102c797bf842">
      <Text>Leo (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9d79f0e6-d326-4d8c-ab5b-60a7bfe2101e">
      <Text>It’s remarkable he’s made it this far.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="65d191a1-4c0c-4151-b4c1-8d6bbf1aeaff">
      <Text>On the mat, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> enters a strong one arm shoulder throw (ippon </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">seionage</Text>
      <Text>) and Ryan lands on his side. Their heads collide as they go down, and a gash opens up above Ryan’s right eye.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="96f45171-dd46-490f-8140-01a5f013ec2b">
      <Text>IrISH REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e11b54fa-a4ad-44ea-afde-9f5d4c59e645">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Wazari</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c2d3ad7f-06e7-4006-bc5d-6559a0a76b14">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f6668ac6-21fd-4871-801e-3e3ba077abed">
      <Text>And just that quickly, the German is up by </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Wazari</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2f728bcb-4d5b-442d-9ccc-c12875a76694">
      <Text>Irish REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="516419ac-8ae0-4ffc-961f-febd0a369e91">
      <Text>Matte!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c5ffcc9c-6113-4266-82b2-21f1a8d7682d">
      <Text>He calls for another official to take Ryan to the medical table.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="70dab39c-5cd5-48e4-9125-9294c91def4f">
      <Text>The other OFFICIAL escorts Ryan off the mat to the doctor. Blood drips down his face and onto his white </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Shot" id="0dd074c3-fea2-4ffc-87a4-b8dd00baa64e">
      <Text>In the stands</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7553b9c2-39c8-4f6f-a137-58600a4bf1ab">
      <Text>Nella takes Daniel’s hand worry etched on her brow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="93ab4fa3-f7b2-486c-b856-50e96b0a0890">
      <Text>The DOCTOR finishes bandaging the cut. A medic sprays hydrogen peroxide on the blood stains on Ryan’s </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e5e08517-c80d-48b5-8bc3-011cfa808e55">
      <Text>Doctor</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e51588d9-00a9-4eb4-9f13-ba7a6da3c970">
      <Text>You can see?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0eb95734-4140-4db9-8f8e-6b05268ab0ff">
      <Text>Ryan</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="512bccdf-0b0d-4052-a884-b3a40f65d607">
      <Text>Fine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d017777b-69ec-4f4b-9288-2edb59bbcec5">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a7855f21-41ca-4f22-9a4f-996564e30d23">
      <Text>A nasty cut but they seem to have stemmed the flow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="33009564-a9e6-4996-a028-493def066fc2">
      <Text>Leo (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b19458d5-8eee-45cd-b19c-4f6a0ab8c4c7">
      <Text>Like with penalties, you get two bites of the apple. If this bleeds again, or if the bandage comes off that will be the end of Cutler’s Olympic run.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Shot" id="777a1145-7324-41f9-ab72-10af92bbec54">
      <Text>Back on the mat</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="07b2be5d-abed-4fb0-8d0c-276d91da35f3">
      <Text>IrISH REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="9dcc47b7-6572-499b-8bea-9a9caf631cb0">
      <Text>(To Ryan)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c88d67b5-d70d-44c2-bc34-5f2afa310bac">
      <Text>You’re good to continue?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6cd551aa-e6d2-43f2-995f-0fa5545daada">
      <Text>Ryan nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f2dc4e5f-7807-47c7-a503-63a5a564574d">
      <Text>IrISH REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dee823a5-3db2-459b-a114-1965c61f67a9">
      <Text>Hajime!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d6f2fbb8-9127-43be-9711-f057b9b68af7">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> and Ryan meet in the middle of the mat. Ryan enters with a strong body drop throw (tai-o-</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">toshi</Text>
      <Text>), but </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> steps over the leg and Ryan leg crumples.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cb6e5dbf-c5bb-481c-87a7-7b06a6468efa">
      <Text>Ryan let’s go of Mueller and grabs his knee in pain. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> takes advantage and dives onto Ryan, trying to pin him. Ryan moves out of bounds turning to his stomach and covering up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="abab0507-0a2d-4455-8af5-c68dea4a2c95">
      <Text>IRISH REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="74191cc6-bb3d-4c56-8b6f-8300d0ab0a04">
      <Text>Matte!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dfd67e42-60fd-435b-921d-e8dd1c9ccedd">
      <Text>Ryan’s slow to get up. The referee walks over to him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7f28a939-8cad-429f-903d-a33cbb439fd2">
      <Text>IRISH REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2029254d-1dfd-46db-8395-50ec1ddd620b">
      <Text>Do you want a doctor. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d20393c2-9928-41d4-8279-fef24787e4ca">
      <Text>Ryan shakes his head. He get’s to his feet, limping badly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="531c8e13-9c36-4fc0-9f3f-dacac431c4a8">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e621a712-d6cd-47d7-b17c-0b7a511f834b">
      <Text>Cutler’s clearly hurt, and only thirty seconds left in the match and down by </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">wazari</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="563e4669-d598-404e-9acb-21bbcb827d7d">
      <Text>IRISH REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0f956dc1-a048-4e0c-b30a-c28dc9a1ea3d">
      <Text>Hajime. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6d2cbe12-c6b7-4a4f-b3ec-1a37f3f9de74">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> dives into a drop throw.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="24df7e95-1903-40a3-8a89-e0b4a763f48e">
      <Text>IRISH REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="29a60f18-6c8b-41b2-917a-1e9789f87f8e">
      <Text>Matte!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b3127e6d-feb9-47c8-b21c-c05343f25321">
      <Text>The referee turns toward </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> and gives the signal for a false attack. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> and Ryan move around the mat. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7e304af5-3ad8-43c3-b2b7-dd03e651128f">
      <Text>IRISH REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3b9971a1-b10e-4a91-9edc-84198f196540">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Shido</Text>
      <Text>. (Warning) Hajime! (Begin!)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7082577b-3b06-4458-a2dc-53f76b9e1d35">
      <Text>This time </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> gets his grip. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> sweeps Ryan’s bad leg.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0f68b17a-1e82-47f7-ba72-8443082a6489">
      <Text>Ryan grimaces. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> attacks the leg again, and again. Ryan goes down to his knees.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="11135e39-337d-4d74-b7ca-17812ed3a89d">
      <Text>IRISH REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8f46e82c-4c85-47fb-b3a8-179d439c1900">
      <Text>Matte! (wait) </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="01187f62-e91f-49c6-b0d2-cb1da158d3d9">
      <Text>The Ref gives the hand signal for non-combativity and points at Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c9526f8f-582b-4fc8-97fa-4604612dcb97">
      <Text>IRISH REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="34d139d2-20c3-4291-8e15-88c829b817f4">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Shido</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1661faf0-e903-4ce7-95fe-1f97fddfe9d0">
      <Text>Leo (O.C.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="127d1975-45e1-4634-ae7e-d9d94820d5da">
      <Text>Both have one penalty and with less than ten seconds to go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="81fcc62e-4236-47d5-960a-c4874fc040a8">
      <Text>IRISH REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="11bd432a-29bc-4baf-92af-6bfd70ef14bb">
      <Text>Hajime!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7082577b-3b06-4458-a2dc-53f76b9e1d35">
      <Text>Six seconds left on the clock. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> grip fights, glancing at the clock. Four seconds left. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b8c29414-605b-434d-8317-20ba71cf232b">
      <Text>They move toward the side of the mat. Ryan only has one hand on </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler’s</Text>
      <Text> sleeve. They both step out of bounds. The referee raises his hand to call matte. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b8c29414-605b-434d-8317-20ba71cf232b">
      <Text>He turns into a one handed sleeve grip throw (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">sode-tsuri-komi-goshi</Text>
      <Text>). Ryan lifts </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text>... </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler’s</Text>
      <Text> going over.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1b1adf60-4df0-4105-8ff7-0cb7860e629c">
      <Text>IRISH REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1fcab018-f716-499f-b8aa-894b693030e2">
      <Text>Matte!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0980e575-a2af-4594-bf4b-37c719077bfa">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> lands on his side toward his back just at the time BUZZES. The GERMAN coach jumps from his seat. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0334e8c6-1935-4b99-a607-551222f82f8b">
      <Text>German coach</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="71f5adf4-3750-4e73-9c80-19ef3db4a4d2">
      <Text>Matte! He called matte!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="de1d593f-fb18-4a78-bf45-43fdbee0cac7">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e7b6de27-9d36-410e-9eea-555e43482c8e">
      <Text>That was close they’ll want to take a look at that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="88895824-fa9c-4f3e-bf9e-de5f92be749c">
      <Text>Three referee’s huddle around a TV monitor watching the throw in slow motion. Looking at when the referee raised his hand and called Matte... looking at the clock to see if time had run out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="426817b5-4531-4738-b6e9-e9b601ba16e4">
      <Text>Leo (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b58773ab-350e-4609-a428-5a945bc9254e">
      <Text>The question is did the throw start before the referee called matte and had time run out?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="92537787-b453-42a8-aa84-90427e1b36a7">
      <Text>The side Refs confer and then speak into a walkie-talkie.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="763d5322-717d-4f68-a303-f13de4efb89f">
      <Text>IRISH REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f429da09-2cd9-4a9e-8c38-9d3dffe440a3">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Wazari</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="81b65347-ae3b-4f0a-bbb6-da9800bf75ad">
      <Text>They award the score to Ryan, tying the score. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Wazari</Text>
      <Text> each. The CROWD loves it. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b0b03cff-3812-488f-ad02-41379821191b">
      <Text>LEO (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="580ee67c-2e43-4976-bdbc-bdb6f5763c83">
      <Text>Are you kidding me? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7c469ff7-36d2-458b-ac12-eb9414ed3828">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="05d47397-7981-4bd7-ad1b-656a8394213c">
      <Text>If you had said to me that this match would be going into golden score, I’d call you mad. Yet here we are. Sixty-two year old Ryan Cutler fights on!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="81b65347-ae3b-4f0a-bbb6-da9800bf75ad">
      <Text>The German Coach looks apoplectic. Sensei Joseph can barely contain himself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7e2ae96c-c05b-4359-8517-42cf57af9243">
      <Text>Irish REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="61642710-4738-4905-aee2-0852cf6ca7dd">
      <Text>Golden score. Ready?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a0eba660-ad48-476d-879c-9e4e2df32be5">
      <Text>Ryan nods. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0ed76736-42da-4a86-bdb8-252b385ae5d4">
      <Text>IRISH REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7b8b5786-f0a1-456a-83b7-7f367b96d8e2">
      <Text>Hajime!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="01053f9d-1ed7-4599-bfc4-51165fb19fde">
      <Text>They circle each other. Ryan limps. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d317f3ee-3110-4732-ba6f-690d9a032851">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b5055fd9-3b68-4230-a37d-0dca9e670c80">
      <Text>What a match! Into golden score we go. The next point wins the Olympic Bronze medal!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f5b34f87-5a71-46d6-877b-f4978f2d064a">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> goes after Ryan’s bad leg again. Ryan lets out an involuntary scream of pain. This time with a kick. They both go to the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a1f3f8b2-603e-4ac7-9418-d83e2ec979da">
      <Text>IRISH REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="605d85c1-67f5-4ba7-9b39-7142c51288e3">
      <Text>Matte!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d02eb2d5-f5fa-4e9f-b029-6204afe425a5">
      <Text>NEIL (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="81c650c5-2695-4c18-80b1-a463020e784a">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler’s</Text>
      <Text> targeting that bad right knee.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1850ceeb-3bf5-449f-b920-fb2add70a5c8">
      <Text>IRISH REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="15f1a229-de97-4418-8565-32c9dd971984">
      <Text>(pointing to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2b6b41bb-4d75-44f8-a911-d9736f6e9b17">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Shido</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b7d3d293-ae9b-4865-aaac-f272af6c22b1">
      <Text>Leo (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8ae83b83-141b-46ab-87ab-dbab38f693c4">
      <Text>That’s the second warning for </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="958d1728-6b83-4a2b-96df-8a886a0cd864">
      <Text>IRISH REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="48f3b433-42e0-4754-8591-376b8684c611">
      <Text>Hajime!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d26deea3-1923-4c64-963b-2c5f6a8807bb">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> circles. Ryan reaches for his sleeve. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> moves  inside the grip and makes a hard stab at a knee wheel (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">hiza</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">garuma</Text>
      <Text>.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="214a1ae3-a029-4234-a638-2f817bdc8db4">
      <Text>Ryan’s knee goes out... And he drops onto his stomach. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a8f8e03f-3371-4d79-a1c1-0f30df0fd8fc">
      <Text>LEO (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4f615acd-6729-4e72-974a-4245b62ee374">
      <Text>Almost caught Cutler with that </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">hiza</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">garuma</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="869debbb-80de-4808-b036-8983dbb6e8eb">
      <Text>Cutler jumps onto Ryan’s back and attempts a turnover. He gets Ryan to his side.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c66bf6df-2b79-47ba-a0a7-76b0115b7fde">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dc546ab9-ba0b-440a-998d-7d47a588ea95">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler’s</Text>
      <Text> going for the pin, but Cutler’s got to watch for the armbar.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d35dd37f-47ae-405c-91f6-35e7cb40dc27">
      <Text>LEO (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9090eaab-a4dc-46f2-9549-d43dc06f2be1">
      <Text>As long as Cutler keeps that leg scissored he’s safe from the pin, but you’re right. He’s got to protect his arms.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="84ab330c-91aa-4746-95c5-6b6d2d696951">
      <Text>Ryan moves as if he’s avoiding the pin, but as he does so, he sneaks his right forearm across </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler’s</Text>
      <Text> neck and grabs his own </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> - an </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ezikiel</Text>
      <Text> choke hold.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="350e5357-be3b-426a-bad7-7e2d86459612">
      <Text>The Referee watches but doesn’t see the choke. Ryan has it... The German struggles in vain, but refuses to tap. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="53578610-6dd0-4e45-ba8c-55b6bb870661">
      <Text>Irish REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ef13d474-abcc-441a-8edd-afae3c5103ca">
      <Text>Matte.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="65f0298f-96ee-4895-ab06-144a793142a2">
      <Text>Ryan gets to his feet, his knee seems to buckle, he straightens up. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text>, however lays still on the ground. The referee calls for medical. The Doctor rushes onto the mat and turns </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> over.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="03929a9e-174a-4c03-afec-23820fb7c386">
      <Text>IrisH REFEREE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6ec58a8d-b113-4258-970e-c749b576f03a">
      <Text>Ippon! Sore made.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4037ba9c-ceca-40e6-b322-808c5e9b1186">
      <Text>Ryan limps to the center of the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8d5dfd61-f746-4f89-86c8-1bb2fa882339">
      <Text>Leo (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca90fe2b-1531-41ae-a066-3003d684c296">
      <Text>Oh, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">shi</Text>
      <Text>... He was out. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aa5c0018-847b-4857-be27-f1b09532f4c8">
      <Text>Neil (o.c.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e9686753-8527-4bd5-a1a9-6519201b47d6">
      <Text>A sneaky choke that and Ryan Cutler has taken a bronze medal at these Olympic games.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="47ff10bb-8890-4e52-aaec-0aba8bf169af">
      <Text>Ryan straightens his </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gi</Text>
      <Text> and tightens the belt. The referee awards the win to Ryan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d432f743-6509-4290-b482-a0695a066528">
      <Text>Leo (O.C.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="292d38dc-e54c-45fc-97d1-8570dc2abf69">
      <Text>What the hell just happened? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="61c055ed-51f9-4e98-a46f-6a6b00f25272">
      <Text>NEIL (O.C.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="27cb14a1-328c-446f-9d7b-fa3e39c55fd0">
      <Text>I think it might be safe to say - a miracle... a miracle just happened.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7a3250c5-042f-44ea-9338-6ef52e5ff6f0">
      <Text>The crowd stands as the Referee awards the match to Ryan. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hechtler</Text>
      <Text> sits up, confused, dazed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5bd20c80-9d0f-44d2-a4bb-f3ed1cd426c0">
      <Text>The crowd gives Ryan standing ovation. Nella wipes tears of joy as Daniel jumps up and down in celebration.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8536b79c-a4bc-4365-9976-ace4936d2c8a">
      <Text>Ryan bows to the referee, bows the spectators, raises his hands in victory and limps off the mat, into the arms of Sensei Joseph as Nella and Daniel join them on the arena floor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="f329a3e7-a13a-4826-b460-cda97363ce7a">
      <Text>Fade out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8f5dd3a4-2c37-49a8-a8fe-a294918ca60c"/>
  </Content>

